hadiths[543]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","Kitab al-Taharah. Al-Lului ne kaha: Abu Dawud Sulayman ibn al-Ashath ne hum se bayan kiya: Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Sulayman ibn Abi al-Saib ne humein khabar di, Talhah ibn Abi Qanan se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab peshab ka irada farmate to zameen ke sakht oonch-neech hisse ki taraf tashreef le jate, ek lakdi lete aur us se mitti ko karidte yahan tak ke woh narm ho jati, phir peshab farmate."
"2","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Hassan ne humein khabar di, al-Hasan se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab bait al-khala me dakhil hote to farmate: Ae Allah, main Teri panah mangta hun khabees o mookhbis, galeez o napaak, mardood shaitan se."
"3","Hisham ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne humein khabar di, Ibn Jabir se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne masjid ke darwazon par peshab karne se mana farmaya."
"4","Amr ibn Awn ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne humein khabar di, Zamah ibn Salih se, Isa ibn Azdad se, un ke walid se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi peshab kare to use chahiye ke apne zakar ko teen martaba jhatke."
"5","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Khalid al-Qurashi se, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, unhon ne kaha ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum piyo to choos choos kar piyo, aur jab miswak karo to arz me karo."
"6","Wuzu ke bare me warid riwayat. Muhammad ibn Uthman al-Dimashqi Abu al-Jumahir ne hum se bayan kiya ke Sulayman ibn Bilal ne un se bayan kiya; Sharik ibn Abi Namir ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apne chehre ko dayen hath se dhoya karte the."
"7","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne humein khabar di, Ishaq ibn Suwayd se, al-Ala ibn Ziyad se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne ghusl farmaya, phir apne kandhe par ek chamakti jagah dekhi jise pani nahi pahuncha tha, to Aap ne apne sar ke balon ki ek lat li, use kandhe par nichoda, phir apna hath us jagah par phera."
"8","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaidah ne humein khabar di, Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafsah bint Sirin se, Abu al-Aliyah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek beenai se kamzor shakhs aaya aur masjid me dakhil hua jab ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apne Sahaba ke sath namaz padha rahe the, woh masjid me maujood ek gadhe me gir gaya, to un me se ek jamaat hans padi. Jab Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne namaz puri farmai to un me se jo hanse the unhein hukm diya ke wuzu dohrayen aur namaz dohrayen. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye riwayat Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se al-Hasan, Ibrahim aur al-Zuhri ke tariq se naql ki gayi hai, aur un sab ka makhraj Abu al-Aliyah ki taraf jata hai. Ibrahim ne use Abu Hashim al-Rummani se riwayat kiya, aur al-Zuhri ne use Sulayman ibn Arqam se, al-Hasan se riwayat kiya. Aur Hafs al-Minqari ne kaha: Main hi woh hun jis ne ye riwayat al-Hasan ko Abu al-Aliyah se bayan ki."
"9","Muhammad ibn al-Ala aur Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Muawiyah ibn Qurrah se, unhon ne kaha: Banu Qushayr ke kuch log Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah, hum apne ahl-o-ayal ke sath zameen mein safar karte hain aur hamare paas apne honton ko tar karne ke andaze ke siwa pani nahi hota, to kya hum mein se koi apni ahliya se sohbat kar sakta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Haan, chahe do saal tak ka muamla ho."
"10","Qutaybah ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne humein khabar di, Uqayl se, al-Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne kapde mein khoon paya to namaz se hat gaye."
"11","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir yani Ibn Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya; main ne Abd al-Malik yani Ibn Umayr ko Abdullah ibn Ma'qil ibn Muqarrin se riwayat karte hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati masjid ke ek kone mein khada hua, us ne satr khola aur wahan peshab kar diya. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jitni mitti par us ne peshab kiya hai use uthao, use phenk do, aur us ki jagah par pani baha do. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat hui hai, lekin ye sahih nahi."
"12","Namaz ka bayan. Ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) unhein yani namazon ko apni qaum ke paas laye to unhein chhod diya yahan tak ke jab suraj aasman ke darmiyan se dhal gaya to un mein elan kiya gaya: Namaz ba-jamaat. To wo is ke liye jama hue, ghabrate hue, aur Allah ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein chaar rak'atein padhayin jin mein buland awaz se qirat nahi ki, jabke Hazrat Jibril Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke aage the aur Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) logon ke aage the; log apne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki iqtida kar rahe the aur Allah ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Jibril Alaihis Salam ki iqtida kar rahe the. Phir unhein chhod diya yahan tak ke jab suraj safed aur saaf rehte hue dhalne laga to un mein elan kiya gaya: Namaz ba-jamaat. Wo is ke liye jama hue aur Allah ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein Zuhr ki namaz se halki chaar rak'atein padhayin; phir Ibn al-Muthanna ne waisa hi zikr kiya jaisa Zuhr ke bare mein zikr kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Phir un se rukh pher liya yahan tak ke jab suraj ghuroob ho gaya to un mein elan kiya gaya: Namaz ba-jamaat. Wo is ke liye jama hue aur Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein teen rak'atein padhayin, do rak'aton mein buland awaz se qirat ki aur teesri rak'at mein buland awaz se qirat nahi ki; Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) logon ke aage the aur Hazrat Jibril Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke aage the. Phir unhon ne waisa hi zikr kiya jaisa Asr ke bare mein zikr kiya tha yahan tak ke jab shafaq hui aur Isha ki namaz mein takheer hui to un mein elan kiya gaya: Namaz ba-jamaat. Wo is ke liye jama hue aur Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein chaar rak'atein padhayin, do mein buland awaz se qirat ki aur do mein buland awaz se qirat nahi ki, waisa hi zikr karte hue jaisa Maghrib ke bare mein zikr kiya tha. Unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne raat guzari is be-khabri mein ke kya is par kuch izafa kiya jayega ya nahi, yahan tak ke jab fajr tulu hui to un mein elan kiya gaya: Namaz ba-jamaat. Wo is ke liye jama hue aur Allah ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein do rak'atein padhayin jin mein buland awaz se tawil qirat ki, jabke Hazrat Jibril Alaihis Salam Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke aage the aur Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) logon ke aage the; log apne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki iqtida kar rahe the aur un ke Nabi Hazrat Jibril ki iqtida kar rahe the."
"13","Al-Haytham ibn Khalid al-Juhani ne hum se bayan kiya; Waki ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke ye al-Hasan ibn Salih se, Abd al-Aziz ibn Rufay se hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Badal ke din din ki namaz jaldi padho, aur Maghrib mein takheer karo."
"14","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Umarah se, Abu Mijlaz se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Umar ko hukm diya ke masjid ke qible ki taraf rukh karke peshab karne se mana karein."
"15","Muhammad ibn Salamah al-Muradi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Lahi'ah se, ke Bukayr ibn al-Ashajj ne un se bayan kiya ke Madinah mein Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki masjid ke siwa nau masjidein thin, jin ke rehne wale Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane mein Hazrat Bilal ki azan sunte aur apni masjidon mein namaz padhte the: un mein sab se qareeb Banu al-Najjar mein se Banu Amr ibn Mabdhul ki masjid, Banu Sa'idah ki masjid, Banu Ubayd ki masjid, Banu Salamah ki masjid, Banu Abd al-Ashhal mein se Banu Rabih ki masjid, Banu Zurayq ki masjid, Banu Ghifar ki masjid, Aslam ki masjid aur Juhaynah ki masjid thi, aur nauwein ke bare mein shak hai."
"16","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hadrami se, Ansar ke ek shakhs se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi namaz padhte hue joon paye to use na phenke, balke use lapet kar rakhe yahan tak ke namaz mukammal kar le. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hazrat Mu'adh ibn Jabal, Hazrat Anas ibn Malik aur digar se riwayat hai ke wo namaz mein jooen aur pissu maar diya karte the."
"17","Ubaidullah ibn Mu'adh ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ash'ath ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hasan se riwayat kiya ke Saqif ka wafd Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua, to un ke liye masjid ke pichhle hisse mein ek qubba lagaya gaya taake woh Musalmanon ki namaz aur un ke ruku aur un ke sajde ko dekhen. Arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasool Allah, kya Aap inhen masjid mein thahrayenge jabke ye mushrik hain? Aap ne farmaya: Zameen napak nahin hoti, sirf Ibn-e-Adam napak hota hai."
"18","Muhammad ibn Salama al-Muradi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yunus se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kiya; Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne mujhe khabar di ke Abu Sufyan Madina ki masjid mein dakhil hote the jabke woh kafir the, magar Masjid-e-Haram mein un ke liye ye jaiz nahin hai, is wajah se jo Allah ne farmaya: Mushrik to napak hi hain, pas woh Masjid-e-Haram ke qareeb na aayen, ye ayat hai."
"19","Azan ka bayan. Abbad ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Mughira se, unhon ne al-Sha'bi se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko namaz ke liye fikr hui ke logon ko us ke liye kis tarah jama kiya jaye. Pas Hazrat Abdullah ibn Zaid Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke muamle mein fikrmand hokar wapas gaye, to khwab mein un ke pas ek aane wala aaya aur un se kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se kaho ke jab namaz ka waqt aaye to ek shakhs ko hukm den ke woh azan kahe, yun kehte hue: Allah sab se bada hai, Allah sab se bada hai, azan ko do do martaba zikr karte hue, aur jab woh farigh ho jaye to mohlat de yahan tak ke sone wala jaag jaye aur jo wuzu karna chahe wuzu kar le. Phir jab log apni namaz ke liye jama ho jayen to woh dobara kahe, wahi kalimat kahe, yahan tak ke jab woh Hayya alas-salah, Hayya alal-falah par pahunche to yun kahe: Namaz qaim ho gayi, namaz qaim ho gayi. Allah sab se bada hai, Allah sab se bada hai; Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur unhon ne poori hadith bayan ki."
"20","Ahmad ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Juraij se riwayat kiya; Ata ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Ubaid ibn Umair ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) aur Aap ke Sahaba ne mashwara kiya ke woh koi cheez kis tarah muqarrar karen jiske zariye jab woh namaz ke liye jama karna chahen to us se jama hon; pas unhon ne naqus ka mashwara kiya. Jab Hazrat Umar ibn al-Khattab naqus ke liye lakdi ke do tukde kharidne lage to Hazrat Umar ne khwab mein dekha: Naqus na banao, balke namaz ke liye azan do. Pas Hazrat Umar Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas gaye taake Aap ko woh batayen jo unhon ne dekha tha, lekin is bare mein pehle hi wahi aa chuki thi; Hazrat Umar ko sirf Hazrat Bilal ki azan ne chaunka diya. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Umar ne Aap ko is ki khabar di to is bare mein wahi tum se pehle aa chuki thi."
"21","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya; Ata al-Khurasani ne hum se bayan kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Abdullah ibn Zaid ki iyadat ke liye tashreef laye aur un ke liye bhalai ki dua ki, phir un ke pas se nikle, masjid mein dakhil hue aur apne Sahaba se farmaya: Humen koi aisi cheez tajweez karo jiske zariye masjid walon ko bulaya jaye, aur unhon ne hadith bayan ki, aur Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ai Bilal, upar chadho, aur Hazrat Abdullah ibn Zaid se farmaya: Un ke pehlu mein khade ho jao aur unhen azan sikhao."
"22","Harun ibn Sa'id al-Ayli ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, (h), aur Makhlad ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Usman ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Yunus se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kiya; Hafs ibn Umar ibn Sa'd al-Muazzin ne mujhe khabar di ke Hazrat Bilal Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas subah ki namaz ke liye aaye to un se kaha gaya: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) so rahe hain. Pas Hazrat Bilal ne kaha: Namaz, Makhlad ne apni riwayat mein kaha: apni buland tareen awaz mein, namaz neend se behtar hai, pas ise Fajr ki namaz ki azan mein baqi rakha gaya. Aur unhon ne Hafs ibn Umar ibn Sa'd se riwayat karte hue kaha: Mere ghar walon ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Hazrat Bilal..."
"23","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hisham ibn Urwa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Fatah wale saal Hazrat Bilal ko hukm diya, to unhon ne Ka'ba ke upar azan di."
"24","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hasan ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu al-Mu'tamir se, jo Hira ke ek shaikh the jinka naam Yazid ibn Tahman tha, unhon ne Ibn Sirin se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Bilal apni azan ya apni iqamat ke dauran apni ungliyan apne kanon mein rakhte the, aisi awaz mein jo na buland thi na past thi. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Un ki asal Basra se hai."
"25","Hamein Ahmad ibn Abi al-Hawari ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Walid ne bayan kiya, Abu Amr aur digar se, Ibn Harmalah se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Azaan ke baad masjid se koi shakhs bahar nahin nikalta magar munafiq hai, siwa us shakhs ke jise koi hajat bahar le jaye jabke woh wapas lautne ka irada rakhta ho."
"26","Jamaat ka bayan. Hamein Abu Tawbah ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Haytham yani Ibn Humayd ne bayan kiya, al-Ala ibn al-Harith aur Zayd ibn Waqid se, Makhul aur Yahya ibn al-Harith se, al-Qasim Abu Abd al-Rahman se, dono ne kaha: Ek shakhs masjid mein dakhil hua aur us ne namaz nahin pai thi. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya koi shakhs nahin jo is par sadqa kare aur us ke liye namaz puri kar de? Pas ek shakhs khara hua aur us ke sath namaz parhi, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur yeh namaz-e-jamaat mein se hai."
"27","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne khabar di, hamein al-Khasib ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, is khabar ke bare mein: Hazrat Abu Bakr khare hue aur us ke sath namaz parhi, halanke woh pehle Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath namaz parh chuke the. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is hadith ko isi mafhum ke sath Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se Abu Uthman al-Nahdi, Abu al-Ala ibn al-Shikhkhir aur Abu Ayyub al-Azdi ne bhi riwayat kiya."
"28","Libas ka bayan. Hamein Amr ibn Uthman ne bayan kiya, hamein Isma'il yani Ibn Ayyash ne bayan kiya, Abu Salamah se, Yahya ibn Jabir se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen shakhs hain jin ki namaz un ke saron se upar nahin jati - aur unhon ne hadith zikr ki - unhon ne farmaya: Aur woh aurat jo namaz ke liye khari ho jabke us ka kaan khula hua ho."
"29","Hamein Hannad ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki' ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Umayys se, Awn ibn Abdullah se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) namaz ke liye khare hote to unhen saaf suthre kapre aur umda khushbu hi pasand aate the."
"30","Namaz mein sutrah ka bayan. Hamein Muhammad ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, hamein Isra'il ne khabar di, hamein Abd al-A'la ne bayan kiya ke unhon ne Muhammad ibn al-Hanafiyyah ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko dekha jo kisi shakhs ki taraf rukh karke namaz parh raha tha to use namaz dohrane ka hukm diya. Us ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, maine namaz mukammal kar li hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tune namaz is haal mein parhi ke tu use dekh raha tha, us ki taraf rukh kiye hue."
"31","Hamein Umar ibn Hafs al-Wassabi ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Himyar yani Muhammad ne bayan kiya, Bishr ibn Jabalah se, Khayr ibn Nu'aym se, Ibn al-Hajjaj al-Ta'i se, marfu' taur par, unhon ne kaha: Unhon ne is se mana farmaya ke do aadmi aapas mein baat karein jabke un ke darmiyan koi shakhs namaz parh raha ho. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh Khayr ibn Nu'aym hain jo Misr mein qazi the."
"32","Iftitahi dua ka bayan. Hamein Abu Kamil ne bayan kiya ke unhen Khalid ibn al-Harith ne bayan kiya; hamein Imran ibn Muslim Abu Bakr ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab raat ko tahajjud parhne ke irade se uthte to takbir se pehle kehte: Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, Allah ke siwa koi mabud nahin, aur Allah sab se bara hai, bahut bara. Main Allah ki panah mangta hun shaitan mardud se, us ke junun se, us ke dam se aur us ke takabbur se. Unhon ne kaha: Phir woh kehte: Allahu Akbar; aur Imran ne apne dono hathon ko uthaya, naql utar kar dikhate hue."
"33","Abu Tawbah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Haytham ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr se, Sulayman ibn Musa se, Tawus se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) namaz mein apna dayan haath apne bayan haath par rakhte, phir un donon ko apne seene par mazbooti se rakhe rehte."
"34","Bismillah buland awaz se parhne ke bare mein. Abbad ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abbad ibn al-Awwam ne hum se bayan kiya, Sharik se, Salim se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Makkah mein Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim buland awaz se parha karte the. Unhon ne kaha: Ahl-e-Makkah Musaylimah ko al-Rahman kehte the, to unhon ne kaha: Muhammad Yamamah ke mabud ko pukarta hai. To Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko hukm diya gaya to Aap ne use poshida kar liya, phir Aap ne wafat tak use kabhi buland awaz se na parha."
"35","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Husayn se, Abu Malik se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Tere naam se, Ae Allah likha karte the. Phir jab ye nazil hua: Beshak ye Sulayman ki taraf se hai aur beshak ye Allah ke naam se hai jo Bara Meherban Nihayat Rehem wala hai, to Aap ne Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim likha."
"36","Ahmad ibn Muhammad al-Marwazi ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ibn Uyaynah ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Sa'id ibn Jubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi surat ke khatm ko na pehchante the hatta ke Bismillah al-Rahman al-Rahim nazil ho jati. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is hadith ko musnad bayan kiya gaya hai, aur yehi zyada sahih hai."
"37","Namaz halki parhne ke bare mein. Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Yunus se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi logon ko namaz parhaye to namaz ko un mein se sab se kamzor ke andaze par rakhe, kyunke us ke peeche budha, kamzor, hajatmand, bimar aur door se aane wala hota hai."
"38","Ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Mu'adh ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Abbas al-Jushami se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak imamon mein se kuch bhagane wale hain. Qatadah ne kaha: Main bhagane walon ko unhi logon ke siwa kuch nahi samajhta jo logon par namaz lambi karte hain hatta ke unhen us se bhaga dete hain."
"39","Ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Sawda se, Ibn Sabit se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne fajar ki namaz parhi aur saath aayaton ki tilawat ki, phir ek bachche ki awaz suni to ruku kar liya; phir khare hue, do aayaton ki tilawat ki, phir ruku kiya."
"40","Qiraat ke bare mein. Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Mu'awiyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'd ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Mu'adh ibn Abdullah ibn Khubayb se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne fajar parhi, to pehli rak'at mein Iza Zulzilat ki tilawat ki, phir dusri ke liye khare hue to use dohra diya."
"41","Hum se Muhammad ibn Salamah al-Muradi ne bayan kiya, hum se Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya, unho ne Yunus al-Ayli se, unho ne Ibn Shihab se, unho ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne sunnat muqarrar farmayi ke Fajr ki namaz ki dono rak'aton me qiraat buland awaz se ki jaye; aur Zuhr ki pehli do rak'aton me har rak'at me Umm al-Quran aur ek surat dil hi dil me ahista parhi jaye; aur Zuhr ki akhri do rak'aton me har rak'at me Umm al-Quran dil hi dil me ahista parhi jaye; aur Asr me wahi kiya jaye jo Zuhr me kiya jata hai; aur Imam Maghrib ki pehli do rak'aton me buland awaz se qiraat kare, har ek me Umm al-Quran aur ek surat parhe; aur Maghrib ki akhri rak'at me Umm al-Quran parhi jaye; aur akhri do rak'aton me Umm al-Quran dil hi dil me ahista parhi jaye; aur Imam ke peeche wale khamosh rahen aur Imam Quran me se jo buland awaz se parhe use ghaur se sunen, koi us ke sath na parhe; aur namaz me tashahhud us waqt ho jab Imam aur us ke peeche log pehli do rak'aton me baithe hon."
"42","Hum se Yazid ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, hum se Affan ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammam ne bayan kiya, unho ne Shaqiq Abu Layth se; mujh se Asim ibn Kulayb ne bayan kiya, unho ne apne walid se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab sajda farmate to Aap ke ghutne Aap ke hathon se pehle zameen par pahunchte. Unho ne kaha: Aur jab Aap do rak'aton ke fasl par uthte to apne ghutnon par uthte, apni ranon par sahara lete hue."
"43","Hum se Hafs ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, unho ne Abu Farwah se, unho ne Ibn Abi Layla se, unho ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ruku farmate to agar Aap ki pusht par pani ka ek kuza undela jata to woh us par thehar jata."
"44","Hum se Abu Tawbah ne bayan kiya, hum se Abu Ishaq yani al-Fazari ne bayan kiya, unho ne Asim se, unho ne Ikrimah se, unho ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko namaz parhte dekha jis ki naak zameen ko nahi chhu rahi thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Aisa na karo – ya unho ne kaha: Woh namaz jayez nahi jis me naak us cheez ko na chhue jise peshani chhuti hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye hadith musnad bayan hui hai, aur yehi zyada sahih hai."
"45","Hum se Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, hum se Abu Shihab ne bayan kiya, unho ne Ibn Awn se, unho ne Ibn Sirin se, unho ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) namaz me khade hote to idhar udhar dekhte; phir jab ye nazil hua: Yaqinan momin kamyab ho gaye, jo apni namazon me khushu ikhtiyar karte hain – to Aap neeche dekhne lage; aur Abu Shihab ne kaha: apni nigah se zameen ki taraf."
"46","Hum se Muhammad ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, unho ne Habib se, unho ne Abu Salih se, unho ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se, unho ne farmaya: Ek shakhs ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se namaz me waswason ki shikayat ki, to Aap ne farmaya: Ye khalis iman hai."
"47","Hum se Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad yani Ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, unho ne Burd Abu al-Ala se, unho ne Sulayman ibn Musa se, unho ne Banu Adi ibn Kab ke ek shakhs se ke woh Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas hazir hue jabke Aap baithe hue namaz parh rahe the. Unho ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ko kya hua hai? Aap ne farmaya: Mujhe bichchu ne dank mara hai. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi namaz me bichchu paye to use apne baen jute se maar dale. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sulayman ne is Adawi ko nahi paya."
"48","Hum se Abu al-Walid al-Tayalisi aur Hafs ibn Umar ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hum se Shubah ne bayan kiya, unho ne Husayn ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unho ne Abd al-Malik jo Amr ibn Hurayth ke bhatije hain se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) namaz parhte hue kabhi kabhi apni dadhi ko chhute the."
"49","Hum se Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hum se Hammad ibn Zayd ne bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Muhammad se, ke Hazrat Ibn Mas'ud Habshah se aaye aur Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hue jabke Aap namaz parh rahe thay. Unhon ne Aap ko salam kiya to Aap ne un ki taraf sar se ishara farmaya — ya unhon ne kaha: Aap ne sar se ishara farmaya."
"50","Jumu'ah ke bare mein. Hum se Ahmad ibn Amr ibn al-Sarh ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Yunus ne khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Ahl-e-Awali ko apni masjid mein Jumu'ah ke din jama kiya; jo Musalman Al-Aqiq aur is jaisi jagahon par thay woh Jumu'ah ke liye aate thay. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Malik ne kaha: Al-Awali Madinah se teen meel par hai."
"51","Hum se Abbad ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne khabar di, hamein Yunus ne khabar di, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Khawateen Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath Jumu'ah mein sharik hoti thin."
"52","Hum se Mahmud ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, hum se al-Walid ne bayan kiya, hum se Abu Amr ne bayan kiya, Wasil se, Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: Mardon aur auraton mein se kamzor log Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath Jumu'ah mein hazir hote thay, phir kamzori ki wajah se agle din tak apne thikanon par wapas na laut-te thay."
"53","Hum se al-Nufayli ne bayan kiya; main ne Ma'qil ibn Ubaydullah par qira'at ki, al-Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Mus'ab ibn Umayr ne, jab Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein Madinah bheja, unhein Jumu'ah parhaya, aur woh barah afrad thay."
"54","Jumu'ah ke din khutbah ke bare mein. Hum se Abu Tawbah ne bayan kiya, hum se Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne bayan kiya, Aban ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Main Jumu'ah ke din Adi ibn Thabit ke sath tha, jab imam bahar aaya — ya unhon ne kaha: minbar par charha — to unhon ne us ki taraf rukh kiya aur kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke Sahaba Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath isi tarah kiya karte thay."
"55","Hum se Ibn al-Sarh ne bayan kiya, aur hum se Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya; hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Yunus ne khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Hamein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) minbar par baith kar ibtida farmate thay; jab mu'azzin khamosh ho jata to Aap khare hote aur pehla khutbah irshad farmate, phir thodi der baithte, phir khare hote aur dusra khutbah irshad farmate; jab us se farigh hote to istighfar farmate, phir neeche tashreef la kar namaz parhate. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Jab Aap khare hote to ek asa lete aur minbar par khare hote hue us par tek lagate; phir Hazrat Abu Bakr Siddiq, Hazrat Umar ibn al-Khattab aur Hazrat Uthman ibn Affan isi tarah kiya karte thay."
"56","Hum se Qutaybah ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, hum se al-Layth ne bayan kiya, Uqayl se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke khutbah ka aghaz yeh tha: Tamam ta'rif Allah ke liye hai; hum Usi ki hamd karte hain, Usi se madad mangte hain aur Usi se maghfirat talab karte hain, aur apne nafs ki buraiyon se Usi ki panah mein aate hain. Jise Allah hidayat de use koi gumrah karne wala nahin, aur jise Woh gumrah kare use koi hidayat dene wala nahin. Aur main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi ma'bud nahin aur Muhammad Us ke bande aur Rasool hain; Us ne unhein haq ke sath khushkhabri dene wala aur Qayamat se pehle darane wala bana kar bheja. Jo Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki ita'at kare woh hidayat pa gaya, aur jo un dono ki nafarmani kare woh gumrah ho gaya. Main Allah apne Rab se sawal karta hun ke hamein un logon mein se banaye jo Uski ita'at karte hain, Us ke Rasool ki ita'at karte hain, Uski raza ki pairwi karte hain aur Us ke ghazab se bachte hain; kyunke hum Usi se hain aur Usi ke liye hain."
"57","Muhammad ibn Salamah al-Muradi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se (riwayat hai) ke unhon ne Ibn Shihab se Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke jumuah ke din ke tashahhud ke bare mein sawal kiya. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai, main Uski hamd karta hun aur Us se madad chahta hun - phir unhon ne bilkul usi ki manind zikr kiya, yani Uqayl ki hadith ki manind."
"58","Muhammad ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Humein Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se ye baat pahunchi hai ke jab Aap khutba dete to farmate: Jo kuch aane wala hai woh qareeb hai, jo aane wala hai woh door nahi, Allah kisi ki jaldbazi ki wajah se jaldi nahi karta aur na logon ke mamlat ki khatir subki ikhtiyar karta hai, jo Allah chahe wahi hoga na ke jo log chahen, Allah ek baat ka irada karta hai aur log doosri baat ka irada karte hain, jo Allah chahta hai woh ho kar rehta hai agarche log use napasand karen, jise Allah ne qareeb kiya use koi door karne wala nahi aur jise Allah ne door kiya use koi qareeb karne wala nahi, Allah Jalla wa Azza ke izn ke baghair kuch nahi hota."
"59","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Imran al-Jawni ne humein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Rabah se, Ka'b al-Ahbar se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jumuah ke din Hud ki tilawat karo. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Muslim ne is mein kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se."
"60","Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Khalid al-Ahmar se, Hisham se, unke walid se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) minbar par baithte to Aap ke aksar kalimat ye hote: Allah se daro aur seedhi sachi baat kaho."
"61","Qutaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jumuah ke din minbar par baith kar dua farmate to sirf apni ungli se ishara farmate jabke log aameen kehte."
"62","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya; Abu Mu'adh Bukayr ibn Ma'ruf ne mujhe khabar di ke unhon ne Muqatil ibn Hayyan ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Eidain ki tarah jumuah ki namaz khutbe se pehle padha karte the, yahan tak ke ek jumuah ka din aaya jabke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khutba de rahe the - aur Aap jumuah ki namaz padh chuke the - ke ek shakhs dakhil hua aur kaha: Dihyah ibn Khalifah apni tijarat lekar aaya hai, aur jab Dihyah aata to uske ghar wale daf bajate hue uska istiqbal karte, to log bahar nikal gaye aur samjhe ke khutba chhod dene mein koi harj nahi; to Allah Azza wa Jalla ne ye nazil farmaya: Aur jab woh tijarat ya khel tamasha dekhte hain to uski taraf muntashir ho jate hain. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne jumuah ke din khutbe ko pehle kar diya aur namaz ko muakhkhar kar diya. Aur mumanaat ke baad nakseer ya hadas ki wajah se koi shakhs bahar na nikalta magar Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se ijazat lekar, Aap ki taraf anguthe se agli ungli se ishara karta to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) use hath se ishara karke ijazat de dete, aur munafiqeen mein se kuch aise the jin par khutba aur masjid mein baithna bhari guzarta, to jab koi Musalman shakhs ijazat talab karta to uske pehlu mein (baitha) munafiq uski aad lekar khada ho jata yahan tak ke bahar nikal jata; to Allah Jalla wa Azza ne ye nazil farmaya: Yaqeenan Allah tum mein se un logon ko janta hai jo chhup kar khisak jate hain - poori ayat."
"63","Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) minbar se utarne se lekar namaz mein dakhil hone tak guftagu farmate the. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye riwayat musnad surat mein bhi marvi hai, lekin woh qawi nahi aur sahih nahi."
"64","Ahmad ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Hassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd se, unhon ne kaha: Main aur Jarir ibn Hazim Thabit al-Bunani ke paas the, ke Hajjaj ibn Abi Uthman ne Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat bayan ki ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz khadi kar di jaye to us waqt tak khade na ho jab tak mujhe na dekh lo; to Jarir ne samjha ke Thabit ne ye Anas se bayan ki hai. Dar al-Sumay'i wale nuskhe mein is hadith ke baad baghair number ke ek riwayat hai: Abu Dawud ne kaha: Maine Ahmad ibn Hanbal ko Jarir ibn Hazim ki hadith ka zikr karte hue suna jo Thabit se, Anas se (riwayat hai) ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab namaz khadi kar di jaye to us waqt tak khade na ho jab tak mujhe na dekh lo. Ahmad ne kaha: Logon ka khayal hai ke Hammad ibn Zayd ne kaha: Hajjaj ibn Abi Uthman ne ye Thabit ko Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Abi Qatadah se, unhon ne apne walid se bayan ki, lekin Jarir ne samjha ke Thabit ne ye Anas se bayan ki, to unhon ne isi tarah riwayat kar di."
"65","Do Eidain ke baare mein. Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se - ya'ni Ibn Abi Ayyub - Abu Isa al-Khurasani se, al-Dahhak ibn Muzahim se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Eid ke din hathyar le kar nikalne se mana farmaya."
"66","Abu Tawbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn Umayyah se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke saath nezah sirf is liye uthaya jata tha ke Aap us ki taraf rukh kar ke namaz padha karte the."
"67","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, al-Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Ayyam-e-Tashriq ke awwal se Ayyam-e-Tashriq ke aakhir tak takbeer kaha karte the. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mujhe Ahmad se yeh baat pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha: Shu'bah Ibn Abi Dhi'b ke paas aaye aur unhen is hadees ko bayan karne se mana kiya, ya'ni Ibn Abi Dhi'b ki al-Zuhri se takbeer ke baare mein hadees."
"68","Al-Hasan ibn Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, Tawbah al-Anbari se, al-Sha'bi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke liye Fitr ya Adha ke din Baqi' mein jharu di gayi thi."
"69","Barish talab karne ke baare mein. Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Yahya ibn Sa'id se, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) yeh dua farmaya karte the: Ae Allah, Apne bandon aur Apne janwaron ko sairaab farma, Apni rehmat ko phaila de, aur Apni murda zameen ko zinda farma."
"70","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad se, Sharik ibn Abdillah ibn Abi Namir se, Ata ibn Yasar se, ke Najd ka ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, hum qehat mein mubtala hain aur halak ho jayenge agar Allah Apni rehmat se hum tak na pahunche; pas Allah se dua kijiye ke humein ghaus ata farmaye. To Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dua farmayi, aur woh shakhs wapas gaya jabke un par barish ho chuki thi, aur unhon ne us saal aasoodgi se guzara kiya. Phir agle saal ek shakhs wapas aaya aur us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, Aap ne pehle saal humare liye Allah se dua ki to Us ne humein zindagi ata farmayi, pas humare liye Allah se dua kijiye. To Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya kafiron ki barish jaisi barish? Nahin; wapas chale jao."
"71","Safar ki namaz ke baare mein. Al-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Abi Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Dahhak ibn Uthman se, Ayyub ibn Musa se, Sa'id ibn al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab Madinah se bahar tashreef le jate to al-Aqiq par namaz qasr farmate; aur jab Makkah se bahar tashreef le jate to Dhu Tuwa par qasr farmate. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat ki gayi hai, lekin yeh sahih nahin hai."
"72","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash ne humein khabar di, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur us ne kaha: Main ek tajir hun jo Bahrain aata jata hai; to Aap ne use do rak'atein padhne ka hukm diya."
"73","Nafil namaz ke bare mein. Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Maghrib ke baad guftagu karne se pehle do rak'atein parhe, woh us ke liye Illiyyin mein likh di jati hain - ya buland kar di jati hain."
"74","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab ke bhatije ne hum se bayan kiya, apne chacha se; Ubaid ibn al-Sabbaq ne mujhe khabar di ke un tak ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamara Rab raat ke aakhri hisse mein nazil hota hai, aur buland tareen aasman mein ek pukarne wala pukarta hai: Kya Khaliq nazil nahi hua? Pas aasman wale sajda karte hain, aur un mein ek pukarne wala isi baat ka elaan karta hai, woh kisi aasman walon par nahi guzarta magar woh sajde mein hote hain. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sufyan - yani al-Thawri - is hadees aur is jaisi hadeeson mein kaifiyat ka tasawwur karne ko napasand karte the."
"75","Ahmad ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ahmad ibn Nasr ne hum se bayan kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Maine Sufyan ibn Uyaynah se poocha, yun kehte hue: Aye Abu Muhammad, main aap se kuch poochna chahta hun. Unhon ne kaha: Mat poocho. Maine kaha: Agar main aap se na poochun to kis se poochun? Unhon ne kaha: Poocho. Maine kaha: In marvi hadeeson ke bare mein aap kya kehte hain, jaise: Dil do ungliyon ke darmiyan hain, aur ke Allah us shakhs par hansta hai, ya taajjub farmata hai, jo Usay bazaron mein yaad karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Unhen jaisa aayi hain waisa hi chalne do, baghair kaifiyat bayan kiye."
"76","Sajde ke bare mein. Muhammad ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Zaid ibn Aslam se, unhon ne kaha: Ek ladke ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke samne aayat-e-sajda ki tilawat ki; ladka Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sajda karne ka intezar karta raha, aur jab unhon ne sajda na kiya to us ne kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool, kya is mein sajda nahi hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Tum hi ne isay parha hai; agar tum sajda karte to hum bhi sajda karte."
"77","Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humen khabar di; Hisham ibn Sad aur Hafs ibn Maysarah ne mujhe khabar di, Zaid ibn Aslam se, Ata ibn Yasar se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)... aur unhon ne isi tarah zikr kiya."
"78","Ahmad ibn Amr ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humen khabar di, Muawiyah ibn Salih se, Amir ibn Jushayb se, Khalid ibn Madan se, ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Surah al-Hajj ko baqi Quran par do sajdon ke zariye fazilat di gayi hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Isko muttasil sanad se bhi bayan kiya gaya hai, lekin ye sahih nahi hai."
"79","Laylat al-Qadr ke bare mein. Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Khaldah ne hum se bayan kiya; maine Abu al-Aliyah ko bayan karte hue suna ke ek dehati Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya jabke woh namaz parh rahe the aur us ne un se kaha: Laylat al-Qadr kab hai? Unhon ne farmaya: Isay pehli raat aur aakhri raat mein, aur taaq raaton mein talash karo."
"80","Dua ke bare mein. Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shuayb se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Ali ibn Abi Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas tashreef laye, jo Fajr ki namaz ke liye nikle the, jabke Hazrat Ali keh rahe the: Aye Allah, mujhe bakhsh de; Aye Allah, mujh par rehem farma; Aye Allah, meri tauba qabool farma. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un ke kandhe par mara aur un se farmaya: Aam alfaz mein dua karo - pas aam aur khaas ke darmiyan fazilat ka farq aasman aur zameen ke darmiyan farq ki tarah hai."
"81","Hamein Wahb ibn Baqiyyah aur Humayd ibn Mas'adah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Bishr ibn al-Mufaddal se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Bujayr se, unhon ne Mu'awiyah ibn Qurrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne jab bhi kisi ko Allah Azza wa Jall ki hamd karte hue suna to us ke sath mil kar hamd ko tawil farmaya. Humayd ne apni riwayat mein kaha: Hamein Bishr ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah ibn Bujayr ibn Humran al-Qaysi ne bayan kiya."
"82","Jo shakhs namaz se so jaye us ke bare mein. Hamein Yusuf ibn Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Jarir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ali ibn Amr se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) subah ki namaz se so gaye aur bedar hue to farmaya: Hum shaitan ko zaroor ghussa dilayenge jaisa us ne hamein ghussa dilaya, pas us din Aap ne Fajr ki namaz mein Surah al-Ma'idah ki tilawat farmayi."
"83","Namaz ke jami' ahkam. Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Hajjaj ibn Hassan ne khabar di, unhon ne Muqatil ibn Hayyan se marfu'an, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab koi shakhs aaye aur kisi ko na paye to use chahiye ke saf mein se ek shakhs ko apni taraf khench le pas woh us ke sath khada ho, pas khenche gaye shakhs ka ajr kitna azeem hai."
"84","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya; mujhe Ibn Lahi'ah aur Amr ibn al-Harith ne khabar di, unhon ne Bakr ibn Sawadah al-Judhami se, unhon ne Salih ibn Khaywan al-Saba'i se, unhon ne un se bayan kiya ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko namaz padhte hue dekha jo apni peshani par sajda kar raha tha jabke us ki peshani par amama lapeta hua tha, pas Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ki peshani se kapda hata diya."
"85","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di; mujhe al-Walid ibn al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya ke unhein Wahib ibn Abdillah al-Ma'afiri ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se koi shakhs namaz mein apna kapda apni naak par na rakhe, kyunke ye shaitan ki nakel hai."
"86","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya; mujhe Amr ibn al-Harith ne khabar di, unhon ne Bakr ibn Sawadah se, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Abi Maryam se, unhon ne Qabisah ibn Dhu'ayb se ke ek billi ne Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke samne se guzarna chaha jabke Aap namaz padh rahe the, pas Aap ne use apne paon se rok diya."
"87","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya; hamein Haywah ibn Shurayh ne khabar di, unhon ne Salim ibn Ghaylan se, unhon ne Yazid ibn Abi Habib se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) do namaz padhne wali aurton ke pas se guzre aur farmaya: Jab tum sajda karo to kuch gosht zameen se mila lo, kyunke aurat is mu'amle mein mard ki tarah nahin hai."
"88","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya; mujhe Abd al-Rahman ibn Sulayman aur dusron ne khabar di, unhon ne Ibn al-Had se, unhon ne Abd al-Rahman ibn Ammar se, unhon ne al-Qasim ibn Muhammad se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne jab Dhu al-Yadayn ne Aap se baat ki to khade hue, takbir kahi, logon ko do rak'atein padhayin, salam phera aur do sajde kiye."
"89","Sulaiman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya; Muawiyah ibn Salih ne mujhe khabar di, Abdul Qahir se, Khalid ibn Abi Imran se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Mudar ke khilaf bad-dua kar rahe thay to Jibril un ke paas aaye aur unhen khamosh rehne ka ishara kiya to Aap khamosh ho gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, Allah ne Aap ko ta'n karne wala ya la'nat karne wala bana kar nahin bheja, Aap ko sirf rehmat bana kar bheja hai, aur Aap ko azab bana kar nahin bheja: Is muamle mein Aap ke ikhtiyar mein kuch nahin, chahe Wo un par tawajjuh farmaye ya unhen azab de, kyunke wo zalim hain. Unhon ne kaha: Phir unhon ne Aap ko ye qunut sikhaya: Ae Allah, hum Tujh se madad chahte hain aur Tujh se maghfirat talab karte hain, Tujh par iman rakhte hain aur Tere aage jhukte hain, aur jo Tera inkar kare us se alag hote hain aur use chhor dete hain. Ae Allah, hum Teri hi ibadat karte hain aur Tere liye namaz parhte aur sajda karte hain, Teri taraf daudte aur jaldi karte hain; hum Teri rehmat ki ummeed rakhte hain aur Tere sakht azab se darte hain; beshak Tera azab kafiron ko pahunchne wala hai."
"90","Ahmad ibn Amr ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humen khabar di; Ibn Juraij ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Ibn Shihab ne unhen khabar di ke log, jab muazzin namaz qaim karne ke liye Allahu Akbar kehta, namaz ke liye khare ho jate thay, lekin Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apne musalle par tashreef na late yahan tak ke safen seedhi kar li jatin."
"91","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Muawiyah ibn Salih ne mujhe khabar di, Abu al-Zahiriyyah se, Jubair ibn Nufair se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne Surah al-Baqarah ko do ayaton par khatm farmaya jo Us ne mujhe Apne us khazane se ata farmayin jo Arsh ke neeche hai, pas unhen seekho aur apni aurton aur bachchon ko sikhao, kyunke wo namaz aur Quran aur dua hain."
"92","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Idris ne humen khabar di, Muhammad ibn Umarah ne humen khabar di, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Hazm se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke khat mein - ya'ni is khat mein - tha: Quran ko sirf pak shakhs hi chhuye."
"93","Al-Qanabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, ke wo khat jo Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Amr ibn Hazm ko likha tha us mein tha: Quran ko sirf pak shakhs hi chhuye."
"94","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Yaman ne hum se bayan kiya, Shuaib ne humen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm ke gharane ke paas ek sahifa parha jis mein mazkur tha ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use Amr ibn Hazm ko likha tha jab unhen Najran par amir muqarrar kiya tha, aur unhon ne us mein hadith bayan ki, us mein tha: Chhota Hajj Umrah hai, aur Quran ko sirf pak shakhs hi chhuye. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye hadith musnad bayan hui hai, lekin sahih nahin hai."
"95","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se riwayat hai: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaban aur Ramazan ke darmiyan fasl karo."
"96","Muhammad ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Muaz ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Khalid - ya'ni Ibn Duraik - se, Ibn Muhairiz se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sehri ko mustahab samajhte thay agarche pani ke chand ghunt hi hon."
"97","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhib ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Harith ibn Abd al-Rahman se, Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Thauban se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Do fajrein hain, jo bhediye ki dum ki tarah hai woh na kisi cheez ko halal karti hai aur na haram karti hai, aur jo phailne wali hai jo ufuq ko gher leti hai woh namaz ko halal karti hai aur khane ko haram karti hai."
"98","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Ismail se, Hakim se yani Ibn Jabir, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe khabar di gayi ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sehri kha rahe thay ke Bilal un ke paas aaye aur kaha: Namaz, Ya Rasool Allah, Aap khamosh rahe aur unhein koi jawab na diya, pas Bilal wapas aaye aur kaha: Namaz, Ya Rasool Allah, aap par subah ho chuki hai, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Bilal par rehem farmaye, agar Bilal na hote to main umeed rakhta ke hamein tulu-e-shams tak rukhsat de di jati."
"99","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym se, Husayn se, Muadh ibn Zuhrah se, ke unhein ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab iftar farmate to farmate: Ae Allah, maine Tere liye roza rakha aur Tere rizq par iftar kiya."
"100","Qutaybah ibn Said ne hamein khabar di, aur Ibn Wahb dono ne kaha: Al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Uqayl se, Ibn Shihab se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Roze mein koi riyakari nahin hai."
"101","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash se, Talq ibn Habib se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, maine Ramadan mein apni biwi se jima kiya aur unhon ne hadith bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Phir pandrah sa khajooron ka ek tokra laya gaya jo saath ruba banta hai, Aap ne farmaya: Is se saath miskino ko khana khilao, us ne kaha: Is ke do harron ke darmiyan hum se zyada is ka koi mohtaj nahin hai, Aap ne farmaya: Phir jao ise tum khud khao aur apne ghar walon ko khilao."
"102","Al-Qanabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Ata ibn Abdullah al-Khurasani se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, ke unhon ne kaha: Ek dehati Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya apni gardan pitte hue aur apne baal nochte hue aur kehte hue: Door wala halak ho gaya, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh kya hai, us ne kaha: Maine Ramadan mein roze ki halat mein apni biwi se jima kiya hai, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum ek gardan azad kar sakte ho, us ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum ek oont qurbani ke taur par de sakte ho, us ne kaha: Nahin, Aap ne farmaya: Phir baith jao, phir Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas khajooron wala ek tokra laya gaya, Aap ne farmaya: Ye lo aur ise sadqa kar do, us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, mujh se zyada koi mohtaj nahin hai, Aap ne farmaya: Ise kha lo aur jo tum ne kiya us ki jagah ek din roza rakho, Malik ne kaha: Ata ne kaha: Maine Said ibn al-Musayyib se poocha us tokre mein kitni khajoorein thin, unhon ne kaha: Pandrah sa se bees sa ke darmiyan."
"103","Muammal ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hadhda se, al-Qasim ibn Asim se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Said ibn al-Musayyib se kaha: Ek hadith jo Ata al-Khurasani ne hamein aap se bayan ki hai woh kya hai, maine kaha: Us ke bare mein jis ne Ramadan mein apni biwi se jima kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ek gardan azad karna ya qurbani dena hai, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne jhoot bola, balke woh falan tha apne ghar ki taraf ishara karte hue jis ne Ramadan mein apni biwi se jima kiya phir Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Kya aap ke paas kuch hai, Unhon ne kaha: Nahin, Unhon ne kaha: Baith jao, unhon ne kaha: Phir bees sa ya us ke qareeb khajooron ka ek tokra laya gaya, Unhon ne kaha: Ise sadqa kar do, Ismail ne kaha: Mera khayal hai Khalid ne kaha: Mere ghar walon ke paas khane ko kuch nahin hai, Unhon ne kaha: Phir ise apne ghar walon ko khilao."
"104","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Ayyub se, Ibn Abi Rufay se, Tawus se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab din ke awwal hisse mein safar par rawana hote to iftar farma lete aur jab suraj dhalne ke baad safar par rawana hote to iftar na farmate."
"105","Muhammad ibn Sulayman al-Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, Kathir ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Sulaym al-Bahili se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Apne maalon ko zakat ke zariye mehfooz karo, apne beemaron ka sadqe se ilaj karo, aur balaon ki maujon ka dua aur aajizi se isteqbal karo."
"106","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne kaha: Main ne Qays ibn Sad se kaha: Mere liye Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm ka khat hasil karo, to unhon ne mujhe ek khat diya, khabar dete hue ke unhon ne use Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se liya tha, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use un ke dada ko likha tha. Main ne use parha, aur us mein oonton par aaid faraiz mein se jo wajib hai us ka zikr tha. Unhon ne hadith bayan ki yahan tak ke ek sau bees tak pahunche; agar us se zyada hon to har pachaas par ek hiqqah shumar karo, aur jo bache wo oonton ke pehle farize ki taraf lautaya jayega. Aur jo pachees se kam ho to us mein bakriyan wajib hain: har paanch oonton par ek bakri, jin mein na nar ho, na buddhi ho aur na aibdar bakri ho."
"107","Qutaybah ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Ahmad ibn Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Ibrahim ibn Maysarah se, Tawus se, ke Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ke paas Yaman se zakat ke nisab se kam umr gaay-bail aur bakriyan layi gayin, to unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhe in dono ke bare mein kuch hukm nahin diya."
"108","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Humayd ibn Qays se, Tawus al-Yamani se, ke Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ne tees gaayon mein se ek tabi liya aur chalis gaayon mein se ek musinnah liya. Un ke paas us se kam laya gaya to unhon ne us mein se lene se inkar kar diya aur kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se is bare mein kuch nahin suna yahan tak ke main un se milun aur un se puchhun. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ke pahunchne se pehle wafat pa gaye."
"109","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Thawr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne kaha: Simak ibn al-Fadl ne mujhe Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka Malik ibn Kaflanis aur al-Muqawqis ke naam ek khat diya, jis mein tha: Gaay-bail mein wahi hai jo oonton mein hai."
"110","Usi sanad se Mamar se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha, Hazrat Jabir ibn Abdullah se: Har paanch gaayon par aur das par do bakriyan hain; pandrah par teen bakriyan; aur bees par chaar bakriyan. Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Jab pachees hon to pichhattar tak ek gaay wajib hai, jis mein ek sau bees tak do gaayen wajib hain; agar ek sau bees se zyada ho jayen to har chalis gaayon par ek gaay hai. Mamar ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Humein ye baat pahunchi hai ke un ka ye kehna - Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har tees gaayon par ek tabi hai, aur har chalis gaayon par ek gaay hai - Yaman walon ke liye ek riayat thi, phir is ke baad ye aaya."
"111","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Thawr ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar se, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Ek zamane tak main unhein kehte hue sunta raha: Hum se wo lo jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne liya, aur main hairan hota tha ke wo un se kyun qabool nahin kiya jata tha, yahan tak ke al-Zuhri ne mujhe bataya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ye faraiz likhe lekin apne amilon ko likhne se pehle wafat pa gaye. Abu Bakr ne jo unhon ne likha tha us par amal kiya, jahan tak mujhe ilm hai gaay-bail ka bhi zikr kiya."
"112","Muhammad ibn Mansur al-Tusi ne hum se bayan kiya, Yaqub ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Muslim al-Zuhri ne zikr kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne sadqe ke bare mein jo ahkam pukhta farmaye un mein se ye tha ke unhon ne Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ke sath pehle khat ke baad gaay-bail ke awqas ke liye muqarrar farmaya - aur awqas paanch gaayon se lekar das tak hain - ke das mein do bakriyan hain; phir unhon ne gaay-bail ke sadqe ko oonton ke sadqe ki tarah kar diya."
"113","Hamein Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Hisham ibn Urwah se, unhon ne Urwah se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne sadqa wasool karne ke liye ek shakhs ko bheja aur use hukm diya ke woh jawan oontni, buddhi oontni aur ayb wali oontni le le, lekin un ke maal ki behtareen aur pasandeedah cheezon se bache."
"114","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Affan ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdul Waris ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Salamah al-Khurasani ne bayan kiya - al-Hasan ne kaha: woh Ghalib ibn Sulaiman hain - hamein Kathir Abu Sahl ne bayan kiya, jabke hum Khurasan me the, unhon ne al-Hasan se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhare liye teen cheezon se darguzar farmaya hai: peshani, nukhkhah aur kusa se. Kathir ne kaha: Log samajhte the ke peshani se murad ghode hain, nukhkhah se murad kaam karne wale aur pani lane wale oont hain, aur kusa se murad chhoti bakriyan hain."
"115","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Ghalib ibn Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Kathir ibn Ziyad se, unhon ne al-Hasan se isi hadith ke sath riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Nukhkhah se murad chhoti bakriyan hain aur kusa se murad gadhe hain."
"116","Hamein Kathir ibn Ubaid al-Madhhiji ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Rashid se, unhon ne Makhul se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqat ko us waqt tak wapas na kharido jab tak unhein bandh na liya jaye aur un par nishan na lagaya jaye. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye Makhul ke qaul ke taur par bhi riwayat kiya gaya hai."
"117","Hamein Muhammad ibn Qudamah ibn Ayan ne bayan kiya, hamein Jarir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Mansur se, unhon ne al-Hakam se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Muadh ibn Jabal ko jab woh Yemen me the likha: Har baligh mard aur aurat par ek dinar ya us ke barabar qeemat ke Maafiri kapde hain, aur kisi Yahudi ko us ki Yahudiyat se na phera jaye."
"118","Hamein Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Wahb se, unhon ne Jarir ibn Hazim se, unhon ne Qais ibn Sad se, unhon ne Makhul se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Phalon ke andaze me logon par narmi karo, kyunke maal me ariyyah hote hain; ek aur rawi ne kaha: aur watiyyah. Hamein Mahmud ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, hamein Umar ne bayan kiya: Maine al-Awzai se pucha, unhon ne kaha: Watiyyah woh hai jo logon me chalta phirta hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sahih lafz al-watiyyah hai, yani woh jo zameen par ata jata hai aur us me se khata hai."
"119","Hamein Qutaibah ibn Said ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Laith ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Amr ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn Qusait se, unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr do mudd gandum muqarrar farmayi."
"120","Hamein Qutaibah ibn Said ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Laith ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ibn Khalid se - yani Ibn Musafir - unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr do mudd gandum muqarrar farmayi."
"121","Qutaibah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Laith ne humein khabar di, Uqail se, Ibn Shihab se, Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se isi tarah."
"122","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Agar maine ise al-Zuhri se na suna ho to Sufyan ibn Husain ne mujhe ise al-Zuhri se khabar di, unhon ne Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se isi maana ke saath riwayat kiya."
"123","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abi Hafsah se, al-Zuhri se, Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zakat al-fitr ka hukm diya, isi maana ke saath."
"124","Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zaid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Khaliq al-Shaibani ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam), Hazrat Abu Bakr aur Hazrat Umar ke daur me sadqah aadha sa gehon tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shubah aur Bishr ibn al-Mufaddal ne ise Abdul Khaliq se isi tarah riwayat kiya."
"125","Nasr ibn Asim al-Antaki ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Anas ibn Iyad ne unhein al-Harith se khabar di - yaani Ibn Abd al-Rahman - unhon ne kaha: Maine Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se poocha: Kya charwahon aur kheti ke mazdooron par zakat al-fitr wajib hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, ye to bas zakat al-fitr hai; Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke ise chhote aur bade, aazad aur ghulam, charwahon aur kheti ke mazdooron ki taraf se ada kiya jaye."
"126","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Wuhaib ne hum se bayan kiya, Mina me ek shakhs ne jo Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ke pehlu me tha mujh se bayan kiya; maine Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr se uske baare me poocha to unhon ne kaha: Ye fulaan ibn fulaan ibn Abdullah ibn Zaid hain - azaan wale; maine us shakhs se poocha to usne mujhe apne waalid se bataya ke Abdullah ibn Zaid ne apna ek baagh sadqah kar diya. Uske walidain Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, iske siwa koi cheez hamari guzraan ka zariya na thi. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use uske walidain ko wapas kar diya, phir woh dono faut ho gaye to usne unke baad unse wirasat payi."
"127","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulaiman ibn Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Jafar se, unke waalid se, unke dada se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne raat me fasal kaatne aur raat me khajoor todne se mana farmaya."
"128","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Jafar ibn Muhammad se, unke waalid se, Ali ibn al-Husain se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne raat me fasal kaatne, raat me khajoor todne aur raat me kheti kaatne se mana farmaya; iski wajah ye thi ke unke ek nigraan ne raat me khajoor todi thi."
"129","Hamein Ali ibn al-Hasan al-Naysaburi ne bayan kiya, hamein Abd al-Malik ibn Ibrahim al-Juddi ne khabar di, hamein Shu'bah ne bayan kiya, Ja'far se, apni sanad ke sath, isi tarah. Ja'far ne kaha: Hamara khayal hai ke unhon ne is ko sirf is liye napasand farmaya kyunke is mein fuqara aur masakeen hazir nahin hote."
"130","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne bayan kiya, Udhafir al-Basri se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne maal ki zakat ada kare us ne apne zimme ka haq ada kar diya, aur jo zyada de to woh behtar hai."
"131","Hamein Muhammad ibn Awf al-Ta'i ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu al-Mughirah ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Awza'i ne bayan kiya, mujh se Musa ibn Sulayman ne bayan kiya, main ne al-Qasim ibn Mukhaymirah ko kehte hue suna: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs gunah ke zariye maal kamaye phir us se sila rehmi kare ya use sadqa kare ya use Allah ki rah mein kharch kare to woh sab jama karke us samet Jahannam mein phenk diya jayega."
"132","Hamein Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Aswad ibn Shayban ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Nawfal yani Ibn Abi Aqrab ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat A'ishah Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, Abdullah ibn Jud'an kahan hai? Aap ne farmaya: Aag mein. Un par ye baat bhari guzri. Aap ne farmaya: Ai A'ishah, tum par kaun si baat bhari guzri? Unhon ne kaha: Woh khana khilaya karta tha aur sila rehmi karta tha. Aap ne farmaya: Tumhari is baat ki wajah se us par takhfeef ki jayegi."
"133","Hamein Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Yunus ne khabar di, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Jab ye ayat nazil hui ke Allah ke liye logon par Baitullah ka hajj farz hai jo us tak rasta pa sake to arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasul Allah, rasta kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Zade rah aur sawari."
"134","Hamein Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Abi Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ek buzurg ko Abu Ishaq se bayan karte hue suna, Muhammad ibn Ka'b al-Qurazi se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Main momineen ke seenon mein ye baat taza karna chahta hun: jis bachche ko us ke ghar wale hajj karayen phir woh faut ho jaye to us ki taraf se kafi ho jayega, phir agar woh hosh ko pahunche to us par hajj farz hai, aur jis ghulam ko us ke ghar wale hajj karayen phir woh faut ho jaye to us ki taraf se kafi ho jayega, phir agar woh azad ho jaye to us par hajj farz hai."
"135","Hamein Ahmad ibn Yunus ne bayan kiya, hamein Fudayl ne bayan kiya, Hisham se, Ibn Sirin se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Makkah walon ke liye Tan'im ko miqat muqarrar farmaya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: Ye hadith maroof nahin. Hamein Muhammad ibn Amr al-Razi ne bayan kiya, hamein Mihran ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sufyan ne kaha: Ye mushkil se hi maroof hai, yani Tan'im wali hadith."
"136","Hamein Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, Ibn Harmalah se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, woh kehte hain: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ehram wala bhediya maar sakta hai... aur unhon ne hadith bayan ki."
"137","Yahya ibn Khalaf ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ziyad ne mujhe khabar di, Abu al-Zinad se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Hazrat Aisha Raziallahu anha se yeh baat pahunchi ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne shutar murgh ke andon ke bare mein yeh faisla farmaya: har ande ke badle ek din ka roza ya ek miskin ko khana khilana hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is hadith ko musnad bayan kiya gaya hai, aur yahi sahih hai."
"138","Yusuf ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Said ibn Abi Arubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Matar al-Warraq ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Muawiyah ibn Qurrah ne un se bayan kiya, Ansar ke ek shakhs se ke ehram wale ek shakhs ne apni sawari se shutar murgh ke ghonsle ko rond dala. Woh shakhs Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ke paas gaya aur un se is ke bare mein pucha to Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ne us se kaha: Har ande ke badle ek oontni ka jima ya oontni ka bacha hoga. Woh shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas gaya aur unhein bataya jo Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ne kaha tha to Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ali ne wahi kaha jo tum ne suna, lekin rukhsat ki taraf aao: tum par har ande ke badle ek din ka roza hai."
"139","Abu Taubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muawiyah yani Ibn Sallam ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya se, Yazid ibn Nuaim ya Zaid ibn Nuaim, Abu Taubah ko shak hua, ne mujhe khabar di, ke Judham ke ek shakhs ne apni biwi se jima kiya jabke dono ehram mein the. Us shakhs ne Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se pucha to Aap ne un dono se farmaya: Apne manasik mukammal karo aur qurbani pesh karo, phir wapas jao yahan tak ke jab tum us jagah par ho jahan tum ne jo kiya tha to alag ho jao ke tum mein se koi apne sathi ko na dekhe. Tum dono par ek aur Hajj lazim hai, phir aao yahan tak ke jab tum us jagah par ho jahan tum ne jo kiya tha to ehram bandho, apne manasik mukammal karo aur qurbani pesh karo."
"140","Ishaq ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Najih se, Mujahid se, ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Tawaf-e-Ifadah ki raat apni sawari par tawaf kiya, apne aasa se Rukn ka istilam karte the aur aasa ko bosa dete the."
"141","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ne humein khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata ne mujhe khabar di, ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne tamam umron mein Baitullah mein aur Safa wa Marwah ke darmiyan tez raftari farmayi, aur Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne us Hajj ke saal tez raftari ki jab Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein bheja tha, phir Hazrat Abu Bakr, Hazrat Umar, Hazrat Usman Raziallahu anhum aur khulafa ne pai dar pai isi tarah tez raftari ki. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is hadith ko musnad bayan kiya gaya hai lekin yeh sahih nahin, aur yahi sahih hai."
"142","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, Rauh aur Ibn Bakr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Gumaan kiya jata hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Muzdalifah ki raat maujuda imamon ke thaharne ki jaghon par qiyam farmaya. Ibn Bakr ne kaha: Mera khayal hai."
"143","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, Rauh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Zabban ibn Salman ne mujhe bayan kiya, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Arafah ke din us chattan ke paas qiyam farmaya jo Arafah mein hukmaranon ke thaharne ki jaghon ke samne pahad ke nichle hisson mein hai, aur us ke logon par kapda dal kar saya kiya hua tha."
"144","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab Makkah tashreef laye to ek azan aur ek iqamat ke sath namaz parhi, Mina mein ek iqamat ke sath namaz parhi, Arafah mein do iqamaton ke sath, Muzdalifah mein do iqamaton ke sath namaz parhi, aur Wadi-e-Abtah mein rawangi ke din Zuhr, Asr, Maghrib aur Isha ki namazen parhin."
"145","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Yahya, Rawh aur Ibn Bakr ne unhein mafhoom bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Ata ne kaha: Mujhe yeh baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne shaam ko - ya'ni Arafah ki shaam ko - azan di aur Muzdalifah ki raat ko iqamat kahi. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yahya ne kaha: Iqamat, iqamat. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Isko musnad kiya gaya lekin yeh sahih nahin hai."
"146","Ahmad ibn Hanbal aur Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Abu Muawiyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Arafah mein do namazon mein se ek namaz azan aur iqamat ke sath parhi."
"147","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar - ya'ni Ibn Abd al-Wahid - ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awzai se, Sulayman ibn Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se yeh mahfuz nahin ke Aap ne hathon ko poori tarah uthaya ho siwae teen maqamat ke: istisqa, istinsar aur Arafah ki shaam; is ke baad kam darje ka uthana tha."
"148","Ahmad ibn Mani ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Awwam ne humein khabar di, al-Saffah ibn Matar se, Abd al-Aziz ibn Abdullah ibn Khalid ibn Asid se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Arafah ka din woh din hai jis mein log Arafah mein waquf karte hain."
"149","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Marwan ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Allaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Ubaydah se, unhon ne kaha: Jis saal Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki wafat hui, logon ne baghair imam ke Hajj kiya."
"150","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj ne humein khabar di, Muhammad ibn Qays ibn Makhramah se, ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Arafah ke din khutba diya aur farmaya: Yeh Hajj Akbar ka din hai. Tum se pehle buton aur jahiliyat wale log jab suraj paharon par is tarah dikhai deta goya woh mardon ke amame hon to rawana hote aur Muzdalifah se jab woh paharon par is tarah chamakta goya woh mardon ke amame hon to rawana hote, pas hamari hidayat shirk aur buton walon ki hidayat ke khilaf hai."
"151","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, Rawh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Tawus ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Mina mein imam ki namaz ki jagah ke baen janib qiyam farmaya. Tawus ke siwa hamare mashaykh mein se dusron ne Tawus ke qaul ki tarah kaha, is izafe ke sath: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apni azwaj ko ghar ke pehlu mein - Mina mein Apne ghar ke - qiyam karne ka hukm diya aur Ansar ko ghar ke pichhe ghati mein qiyam karne ka hukm diya aur logon se farmaya: Qiyam karo, aur Mina ke itraf ki taraf ishara farmaya."
"152","al-Hasan ibn Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) qurbani ke oont ke bare mein jab uska malik uska mohtaj ho to is ki ijazat dete the ke us par bojh ladha jaye aur us par sawari ki jaye baghair thakaye. Maine kaha: Kya? Unhon ne kaha: Paidal chalne wale admi ke liye, raste par pichhe chalne wale ke liye, aur agar woh jan de to uske bache aur uske barabar ko us par sawar karaya jaye."
"153","Hum se Abdullah ibn Sa'id al-Kindi ne bayan kiya, ke un se Sulaiman ibn Hayyan ne Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne Ata al-Khurasani se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhu se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur arz kiya: Mujh par ek qurbani ke oont ki nazr hai, main us ki isteta'at rakhta hun lekin use pa nahi raha, to Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Saat bakriyan zibah kar do."
"154","Hum se al-Walid ibn Utbah al-Dimashqi ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Damrah ne bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se usi sanad aur mafhum ke sath."
"155","Hum se Muhammad ibn al-Musaffa al-Himsi ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Walid ne bayan kiya, mujh se Mu'awiyah ibn Sallam ne Yahya se, unhon ne Ikrimah se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne al-Tan'im mein apne kapre tabdeel farmaye."
"156","Hum se Muhammad ibn Ubaid al-Muharibi jo Kufi hain ne bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Ayyash se, mujh se Sa'id ibn Yusuf ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kasir se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhu ke azaad karda ghulam Ikrimah se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne halat-e-ehram mein al-Tan'im mein apne kapre tabdeel farmaye."
"157","Hum se Hannad ibn al-Sari ne bayan kiya, Waki se, unhon ne Ibn Abi Zi'b se, unhon ne Salih ibn Abi Hassan se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ehram bandhe hue ek shakhs ko chamakdar rassi se kamar kaste hue dekha to farmaya: Ae rassi wale! Ise utar kar phenk de."
"158","Hum se Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Walid ne khabar di, Ali se yani Ibn Haushab se, maine Makhul ko kehte hue suna: Ek khatun Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein usfur se ranga hua kapra lekar hazir huin aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Main Hajj ka irada rakhti hun, kya main is mein ehram bandh lun? Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas is ke ilawa koi aur kapra hai? Unhon ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir isi mein ehram bandh lo."
"159","Hum se Qutaibah ibn Sa'id ne bayan kiya, hamein Bakr yani Ibn Mudar ne bayan kiya, Umarah ibn Ghazziyyah se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne jab door wali Jamrah ko kankariyan marin to qurban-gah ki taraf wapas tashrif laye, phir qurbani ki, phir sar mundwaya, phir fauran tawaf farmaya."
"160","Hum se Ibn Khallad ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ne bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, unhon ne Ibn Taus se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat karte hue bayan kiya, unhon ne farmaya: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Mina ki raaton mein har raat tawaf farmaya karte the. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye riwayat muttasil sanad se marwi hai."
"161","Usman ibn Abi Shaibah, Qutaibah ibn Sa'id aur Nasr ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Jarir ne un se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne shab-e-nafr me Abtah me ek neend soi, phir sahar se pehle rawana hue. Qutaibah ne shab-e-nafr ka zikr nahi kiya."
"162","Sulaiman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub ne mujhe khabar di, Yunus ibn Yazid se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hakim ibn Hizam ko kapre aur ghalle ki tijarat ka hukm diya, aur ghulamon ki tijarat se mana farmaya."
"163","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Abu Sinan se, Abdullah al-Muktib se - aur woh Abdullah ibn al-Haris hain - unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke samne se ek oont guzara gaya, jabke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) logon ke sath the. Logon me se ek shakhs ne kaha: Tum ne ise kitne me liya? Us ne kaha: Itne itne me. Phir us ne qeemat me izafa kar diya. Jab woh ghar wapas aaya to us ne kaha: Main ne un logon se jhoot bola jin me Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) maujud the. Phir woh Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur unhein izafe ke bare me bataya. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Zaid raqam sadqa kar do."
"164","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Yunus se, al-Hasan se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Makr, fareb aur khiyanat Aag me hain."
"165","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Amr ibn Alqamah se, Ibn Abi Husain se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Saman ka malik qeemat talab karne ka sab se zyada haqdar hai."
"166","Abu Taubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ek dehati ke paas se guzre jo koi cheez bech raha tha to farmaya: Pehli boli aur pehle bazaar ko lazam pakro, ya pehli boli ko; kyunke nafa narmi ke sath hai."
"167","Qutaibah ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Zakariyya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ya'qub al-Thaqafi se, Khalid se - yani Ibn Abi Malik - unhon ne kaha: Main ne Muhammad ibn Sa'd ko saman becha to unhon ne kaha: Apna hath lao taake main tum se musafaha karun, kyunke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Barkat mumasaha me hai."
"168","Muhammad ibn Sulaiman al-Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Abi Ishaq se, Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek dehati se sau sa' khajoor ke badle ek bachhera kharida. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un me se ek shakhs se farmaya: Jao aur un se kaho ke naap kar pura lein - yani naap - To woh shakhs apni kohniyan ragadte hue nikla, yani us ne jaldi ki."
"169","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Thawr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane me kuch aadmiyon par qarz hua karte the; hum ne kisi azaad shakhs ke qarz me beche jane ka ilm nahi."
"170","Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Yazid ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Ka'b ibn Malik ne mujhe khabar di ke Mu'adh ibn Jabal - jo un ki qaum Banu Salamah me se ek the - Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane me bahut zyada maqrooz ho gaye; Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un ke qarz khwahon ke liye is ke siwa kuch na kiya ke un ka maal le kar un ke hawale kar diya."
"171","Muhammad ibn al-Mutawakkil al-Asqalani aur Muhammad ibn Dawud ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar ne humen khabar di, al-Zuhri se, Ibn Ka'b ibn Malik se - Ibn Dawud ne un ka naam Abd al-Rahman bataya - ke Mu'adh ibn Jabal barabar qarz lete rahe yahan tak ke un ka sara maal khatm ho gaya; un ke qarz khwah Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye; Mu'adh ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se darkhwast ki ke un ke qarz khwahon se kahen ke kuch kam kar den ya mohlat de den lekin unhon ne inkar kar diya; agar woh kisi ki khatir kisi ko chhodne wale hote to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khatir Mu'adh ko chhod dete; phir Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un ke qarz me un ka sara maal bech diya yahan tak ke Mu'adh kuch ke baghair reh gaye."
"172","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, Abu Bakr ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Harith ibn Hisham ne mujhe khabar di ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne al-Zuhri ki hadith ke mafhoom ke mutabiq faisla farmaya, izafa karte hue: Aur agar us ki qeemat me se kuch bach jaye to woh qarz khwahon ke sath barabar ka shareek hai; Abu Bakr ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke jo shakhs mar jaye aur us ke paas kisi shakhs ka saman ba-ainihi maujood ho jis ki qeemat me se kuch ada na kiya ho to saman ka malik us me qarz khwahon ke sath barabar ka shareek hai."
"173","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-A'la ibn Abd al-A'la ne hum se bayan kiya, Burd se, Sulayman ibn Musa se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo jau mili hui khurak bech raha tha to farmaya: Is ko is se aur is ko is se alag kar do, phir jis tarah chaho becho; kyunke hamare deen me dhoka nahi hai."
"174","Isma'il ibn Mas'adah al-Tunukhi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Tawbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mus'ab ibn Mahan al-Asqalani ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Muhammad ibn Rashid se, Makhul se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) gandum bechne wale ek shakhs ke paas se guzre jo achhe ko kharab ke sath milata tha, to use mana farmaya aur farmaya: Har ek ko alag alag rakho."
"175","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Yunus se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farokht ke liye doodh me milawat karne se mana farmaya; Abu Dawud ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Ibrahim ne bhi Yunus se isi tarah riwayat kiya; aur Hammad ibn Salamah ne Yunus se, al-Hasan se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Umar ne kaha."
"176","Abd al-Salam ibn Atiq al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Mushir ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Hamzah ne mujhe bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Walid al-Zubaydi ne mujhe al-Zuhri se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne zinda janwar ko murda janwar ke badle bechne se mana farmaya."
"177","Hamein Al-Qanabi ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Malik se, unhon ne Zayd ibn Aslam se, unhon ne Saeed ibn al-Musayyib se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne gosht ko zinda janwar ke badle bechne se mana farmaya."
"178","Hamein Ahmad ibn Saeed al-Hamadhani aur Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Musa ibn Shaybah al-Hadrami ne Yunus ibn Yazid se, unhon ne Umara ibn Ghazziyya al-Ansari se, unhon ne Urwa ibn al-Zubayr se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ke sath Makkah se hijrat karke Madina ki taraf nikle to bakriyon ke ek charwahe ke paas se guzre, pas unhon ne us se ek bakri kharidi is shart par ke us ki oon usi ki rahegi."
"179","Hamein Ahmad ibn Saeed aur Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Al-Layth ne khabar di, unhon ne Yunus ibn Yazid se, unhon ne Umara ibn Ghazziyya se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se isi hadees ke sath riwayat kiya."
"180","Hamein Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Hammad se, unhon ne Ibrahim se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Saeed al-Khudri Raziallahu anhu se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mazdoor ko us ki ujrat wazeh kiye baghair kiraye par lene se mana farmaya - yani jab tak - us ki ujrat us ke liye wazeh na kar de."
"181","Hamein Ahmad ibn Abi Shuayb al-Harrani ne bayan kiya, hamein Zuhayr ibn Muawiya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu Ishaq se, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne Hazrat Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne farmaya: Bakriyon ki oon un ki pusht par hote hue mat becho aur un ka doodh un ke thanon me hote hue mat becho."
"182","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Mubarak ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Umar ibn Farrukh se, unhon ne Ikrima se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se isi mafhoom ke sath riwayat kiya."
"183","Hamein Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne bayan kiya, hamein Umar ibn Farrukh ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Habib ibn al-Zubayr se, unhon ne Ikrima se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne singi lagwai aur singi lagane wale ko us ki mazdoori ke taur par ek dinar ata farmaya."
"184","Hamein Al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Asim ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ikrima ibn Ammar se; hamein Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Pas un se mukatabat kar lo agar un me koi bhalai jano, unhon ne kaha: Agar tum un me koi hunar jano aur unhein logon par bojh bana kar na chhoro."
"185","Rahn ke mutalliq: Muhammad ibn Ubaid [ibn Hisab] ne hum se bayan kiya, [Muhammad ibn Saur ne hum se bayan kiya,] Ma'mar se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Ibn al-Musayyib se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Rahn zabt nahi hoga. Main ne un se kaha: Aap ke is qaul ke bare mein aap ka kya khayal hai, Rahn zabt nahi hoga, kya is se murad ye hai ke koi shakhs ye kahe: Agar main tumhare paas tumhara maal na laun to ye rahn tumhara hoga? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. [Unhon ne kaha:] Aur baad mein mujhe un se ye baat pahunchi ke unhon ne kaha: Agar wo halak ho jaye to is shakhs ka haq zaya nahi hoga; wo rahn ke malik ke nuqsan par halak hua; us ka nafa usi ke liye hai aur us ka tawan usi par hai."
"186","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Zib ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, jinhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya: Rahn zabt nahi hoga; us ka nafa us ke malik ke liye hai aur us ka tawan usi par hai."
"187","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Mubarak ne humein khabar di, Mus'ab ibn Sabit se. Main ne Ata ko bayan karte hue suna ke ek shakhs ne ek ghoda girwi rakha aur wo us ke qabze mein mar gaya, to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne girwi lene wale se farmaya: Tumhara haq zaya ho gaya."
"188","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mihran se, Zam'ah yani Ibn Salih se, Ibn Tawus se, unhon ne apne walid se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Rahn us ke badle hai jo us mein hai."
"189","Ali ibn Sahl al-Ramli ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata se, ke ek shakhs ne ek ghoda girwi rakha aur ghoda mar gaya, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Rahn us ke badle hai jo us mein hai."
"190","Hannad [ibn al-Sari] ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi al-Zinad se, unhon ne apne walid se, ke log Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke is farman ko samajhne mein ghalti karte hain, Rahn us ke badle hai jo us mein hai; aap ne ye baat sirf us bare mein farmayi jis ke mutalliq fuqaha mein se siqah shakhs ne humein khabar di: ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Rahn us ke badle hai jo us mein hai jab wo halak ho jaye aur us ki qeemat maloom na ho. Us waqt girwi rakhne wale se kaha jata hai: Tum ne dawa kiya tha ke us ki qeemat sau dinar hai, halanke tum ne us ke badle bees dinar liye aur rahn par razi ho gaye; aur dusre se kaha jata hai: Tum ne dawa kiya tha ke us ki qeemat das dinar hai, halanke tum ne use bees dinar ke badle ke taur par qabool kar liya tha."
"191","Koi shakhs apna maal dusre ke paas paye is ke bare mein: Harun ibn Abdullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Mas'adah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, Ikrimah ibn Khalid se. Usaid ibn Hudair ibn Simak ne mujhe bayan kiya, Harun ne kaha: Ahmad yani Ibn Hanbal ne mujh se kaha: Un ki kitab mein, [yani Ibn Juraij ki kitab mein,] Usaid ibn Zuhair hai, lekin Basre mein unhon ne un se isi tarah bayan kiya, ke Hazrat Muawiyah Raziallahu anhu ne Marwan ko likha: Jab koi shakhs apni chori shuda cheez kisi shakhs ke haath mein paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai. To Marwan ne mujhe is ke bare mein likha jabke main Yamamah par tha, aur main ne use likha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke jab wo use kisi aise shakhs ke haath mein paye jo muttaham na ho to agar chahe use utni qeemat par le le jitne mein wo kharida gaya tha, aur agar chahe apne chor ka peecha kare; aur aap ke baad Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu aur Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne bhi isi tarah faisla farmaya. To Marwan ne mera khat Muawiyah ko bhej diya, aur Muawiyah ne Marwan ko likha: Na tum aur na Usaid mere zimme lagaye gaye muamle mein mere khilaf faisla karoge; balke main tum dono ke khilaf faisla karunga, pas jo main ne faisla kiya hai use nafiz karo. To Marwan ne Muawiyah ka khat mujhe bhej diya, aur Hazrat Usaid Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: [Hazrat Nabi] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam), Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu aur Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne isi tarah faisla farmaya tha; Allah ki qasam, main kabhi is ke khilaf faisla nahi karunga."
"192","Amr ibn Aun ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaim ne humein khabar di, Musa ibn al-Sa'ib se, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, Hazrat Samurah Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apna asli maal kisi shakhs ke paas paye to wo us ka zyada haqdar hai, aur kharidar us ka peecha kare jis ne use becha tha."
"193","Hiba ke bayan mein: Al-Abbas ibn al-Walid ibn Mazyad ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Al-Awza'i se, unhon ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne mujh se bayan kiya, Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se, ke Aap ne farmaya: Zindagi mein janaf karne wale ke sadqe mein se utna hi radd kiya jata hai jitna maut ke waqt janaf karne wale ki wasiyyat mein se radd kiya jata hai. Al-Abbas ne kaha: Unhon ne hum se ek martaba Urwah se bayan kiya, aur ek martaba Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se bayan kiya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye hadith sahih nahin; is ka marfu hona sahih nahin."
"194","Sulayman ibn Dawud Al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di; Yunus ibn Yazid aur Ibn Sam'an ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Zinda dene wale ki zindagi mein us ke janaf mein se utna hi radd kiya jata hai jitna mayyit ke us ke janaf mein se us ki wasiyyat mein us ki maut ke waqt radd kiya jata hai."
"195","Muhammad ibn Yahya Ibn Faris ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Razzaq ne mujh se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, Al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, unhon ne kaha: Zinda dene wale ke janaf mein se utna hi radd kiya jata hai jitna mayyit ke janaf mein se us ki wasiyyat mein radd kiya jata hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Hiql ne ise Al-Awza'i se, Al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se mauquf taur par riwayat kiya."
"196","Ghulam aazad karne ke bayan mein: Muhammad ibn Rafi aur Yahya ibn Musa Al-Balkhi ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Hawshab ne humein khabar di, Isma'il ne mujh se bayan kiya - aur Yahya ne kaha: Isma'il ibn Umayyah - phir dono mutafiq hue: apne walid se, apne dada se, unhon ne kaha: Un ke paas Tahman - ya Dhakwan - naam ka ek ghulam tha, to un ke dada ne us ka aadha hissa aazad kar diya, to wo ghulam Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum apni aazadi mein aazad ho aur apni ghulami mein ghulam ho. To wo apne aaqa ki khidmat karta raha hatta ke wo faut ho gaya; Yahya ne izafa kiya: ya'ni wo ek mahina ghulam tha aur ek mahina aazad tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Un ke dada Amr ibn Sa'id ibn al-As hain."
"197","Tawliyah ke bayan mein: Muhammad ibn Ibrahim Al-Bazzaz ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur ibn Salamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Bilal ne hum se bayan kiya, Rabi'ah ibn Abi Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne ek hadith mein kaha jise wo goya Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tak marfu karte the: Khana qabze mein lene se pehle us mein tawliyah (lagat par farokht) mein koi harj nahin, aur khana qabze mein lene se pehle us mein iqalah (sauda khatm karne) mein koi harj nahin, aur khana qabze mein lene se pehle us mein shirkat mein koi harj nahin."
"198","Nikah ke bayan mein: Muhammad ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn Al-Mu'allim ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, Al-Hasan se, ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Roza rakho aur apne baalon ko poora rakho, pas be-shak ye badbu paida karte hain."
"199","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj ne hum se bayan kiya, Al-Hasan ibn Muslim se, Tawus se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam mein na zimam hai aur na tabattul hai."
"200","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Husayn se, Abu Malik se, Allah ke is farman ke bare mein: Aye iman walo! Un pakeezah cheezon ko haram na karo jo Allah ne tumhare liye halal ki hain. Unhon ne kaha: Ye Hazrat Uthman ibn Maz'un Raziallahu anhu aur un ke sathiyon ke bare mein nazil hui; unhon ne apne upar bahut si khwahishat aur auraton ko haram kar liya tha, aur un mein se ek ne apna aala-e-tanasul kaatne ka irada kiya; to Allah ne ye ayat nazil farmai: Aur hadd se na badho; be-shak Allah hadd se badhne walon ko pasand nahin karta."
"201","Hamen Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne bayan kiya, hamen Mu'adh ibn Mu'adh ne bayan kiya, hamen Ibn Jurayj ne bayan kiya; aur hamen Ahmad ibn Salih ne bayan kiya, hamen Abd al-Razzaq ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Maymun Abu Mughallis se, Abu Najih se - Ahmad [ibn Hanbal] ne kaha: woh Abdullah ibn Abi Najih ke walid hain - jinhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs nikah ki istita'at rakhte hue nikah na kare woh hum me se nahin."
"202","Hamen al-Rabi' ibn Nafi' ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Usamah ne bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, unhon ne apne walid se, jinhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton se nikah karo, pas be-shak woh tumhare paas maal layengi."
"203","Hamen Abu Tawbah al-Rabi' ibn Nafi' ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Damrah ne bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Allah Ta'ala ke is qaul ke baare me: (Aur tumhen badshah banaya). Unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya - ya, main sirf itna janta hun ke unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Biwi, rehne ka makan, aur khadim."
"204","Hamen Kathir ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamen Baqiyyah ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, al-Zubayr ibn Sa'id al-Hashimi se, unhon ne apne shuyukh se, Hazrat Nabi ki taraf marfu'an riwayat kiya: Aulad ki maaon ko lazam pakro, pas be-shak woh arhaam ke etebar se ba-barkat hain."
"205","Hamen Kathir ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamen Baqiyyah ne bayan kiya, Abu Saba' Utbah ibn Tamim se, Ali ibn Abi Talhah se, Ka'b ibn Malik se, ke unhon ne ek Yahudi aurat se nikah ka irada kiya, to [Hazrat Rasool Allah] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Us se nikah na karo, pas be-shak woh tumhen paak-daman nahin rakhegi."
"206","Hamen al-Hasan ibn al-Sabbah ne bayan kiya, hamen Ishaq ibn bint Dawud [ibn Abi Hind], jo behtareen aadmiyon me se the, ne bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Isma'il al-Makki se, Ziyad al-Sahmi se, jinhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne bewaquf aurat se doodh pilwane se mana farmaya, kyunke doodh mushabihat paida karta hai."
"207","Hamen Muhammad ibn Umar ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamen Abu Amir ne bayan kiya, hamen Sufyan al-Thawri ne bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Salamah al-Makhzumi se, Isa ibn Talhah se, jinhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne qarabat ki bina par aurat se nikah karne se mana farmaya, qata'-e-rahmi ke khauf se."
"208","Hamen Musa ne bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ne bayan kiya, Humayd se, al-Hasan se, ke ek aadmi ne kaha: Aye Hazrat Rasool Allah, mere paas ek yateem ladki zer-e-kafalah hai; kya main us se nikah kar lun? Unhon ne farmaya: Tumhara kya khayal hai - agar woh bad-surat hoti aur us ke paas koi maal na hota, kya tum us se nikah karte? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Unhon ne farmaya: Phir us ke liye behtar ka intekhab karo."
"209","Muammal ibn Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, [al-Hasan se, jinhon] ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne Hazrat Ali se isi jaisi baat kahi."
"210","Mehr ke bare mein: [Ahmad ibn Ali ibn Suwayd ibn Manjuf] ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hakam ibn Atiyyah se; unhon ne Abdullah ibn Kulayb al-Sadusi se suna [bayan karte hue], Yahya ibn Yamar se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurton ki sharmgahon ko apne behtareen maal ke zariye apne liye halal karo."
"211","Isa ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Damrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Abi Bakr se, Makhul se, ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis cheez se sharmgah halal ho, khwah mehr ho ya tohfa, woh mehr me se shumar hogi."
"212","Harun ibn Zayd ibn Abi al-Zarqa ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad - yani Ibn Rashid - ne hum se bayan kiya, Makhul se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis atiya ya wade se haram halal ho woh us aurat ka hai; aur aadmi jis ko izzat de us ki sab se zyada mustahiq us ki beti hai [aur us ki behan]. Abu Dawud ne kaha: [Is jaisi riwayat musnad surat me bhi naql hui hai]."
"213","Qutaybah ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Jafar se, Safwan ibn Sulaym se, Abdullah ibn Yazid se, Muhammad ibn Thawban se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs kisi aurat ko be-parda kare aur us ki sharmgah ko dekhe to mehr wajib ho gaya."
"214","Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Umayr al-Khathami se, Abd al-Malik ibn al-Mughirah al-Taifi se, Ibn al-Baylamani se, jinhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: (Aur aurton ko un ke mehr khushi se de do). Logon ne arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, un ke darmiyan talluqaat kya hain? Aap ne farmaya: Jis par un ke ghar wale bahami razi ho jayen."
"215","Nikah ka paigham dete waqt dekhne ke bare mein: Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Thabit se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek khatoon ko nikah ka paigham dene ka irada kiya to un ki taraf ek aurat ko bheja aur farmaya: Us ke munh ke kinaron ko sungho aur us ki takhnon ko dekho."
"216","Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Mutamir ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, Shabib ibn Abd al-Malik ne hum se bayan kiya, Muqatil ibn Hayyan se, ke [Nabi] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab apni betiyon ka nikah karte to hukm dete ke un ke shohar ghusl kiye baghair un ke qareeb na jayen, aur un ke shoharon ko is ka hukm dete."
"217","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Amr ne bayan kiya, hamein Jarir ne bayan kiya, al-Mughirah se, Ziyad yani Abu Ma'shar se, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) beemar hue to unhon ne apni azwaj se Hazrat Aishah ke ghar mein timardari ki ijazat talab ki, to unhon ne Aap ko ijazat de di."
"218","Hamein Ahmad ibn Abi al-Hawari ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Walid ne bayan kiya, Thawr ibn Yazid se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Jubayr se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne ek ghazwe mein seene aur pet mein bhari ek laundi dekhi to farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Falan shakhs ne use qaidiyon mein se khareeda hai. Aap ne farmaya: Kya wo us se jima karta hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji haan. To Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Wo use kaise wirasat mein dega jabke us ne us ke sunne aur dekhne mein khayanat ki hai, ya wo use kaise wirasat mein dega jabke wo us mein se nahin hai? Main ne irada kiya hai ke use aisi lanat karun jo us ke sath qabr mein dakhil hogi. [Unhon ne kaha:] Aur Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ke bachche ko aazad kar diya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Us ka ibtedai hissa muttasil sanad se riwayat kiya gaya hai, aur is mein ye izafa hai: Aur us ne us ke bachche ko aazad kiya."
"219","Hamein Muhammad ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, hamein Isma'il ibn Sumay' ne bayan kiya. Main ne Abu Razin al-Asadi ko kehte hue suna: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap se arz kiya: Allah Ta'ala ke is farman ke bare mein Aap kya farmate hain: (Talaq do martaba hai; phir bhale tareeqe se rok lena ya husn-e-sulook se chhor dena)? Unhon ne kaha: Phir teesri kahan hai? Aap ne farmaya: Husn-e-sulook se chhor dena, [teesri]."
"220","Hamein Ibn Mu'adh ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Ash'ath ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dehati ke Muhajir aurat se nikah karne se mana farmaya. Aur al-Hasan kaha karte the: Agar wo us ke sath sheher mein qayam kare to koi harj nahin."
"221","Hamein Abdullah ibn Sa'id al-Kindi ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Abi Ghaniyyah ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne bayan kiya, al-Hakam se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Yaman ke badshahon mein se ek naujawan se us ki behen ke liye paigham bheja, to us ne us ka Aap se nikah kar diya, phir wo use lene ke liye gaya. Jab wo apne walid ke paas aaya to us ne kaha: Tum ne shahzadiyon mein se ek aurat ka ek aam aadmi se nikah kar diya hai; wo use manata raha yahan tak ke wo razi ho gaya. Phir wo use le aaya, aur jab wo us ke paas dakhil hue to us ne kaha: Main tum se Allah ki panah mangti hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne yaqeenan panah dene wali zaat ki panah li hai, aur Aap ne use chhor diya."
"222","Hamein Muhammad ibn Salamah ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya, mujhe Ibn Lahi'ah ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Aswad Muhammad ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Nawfal se ke Hazrat Umm Habibah se Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne janashini mein nikah kiya; Hazrat Uthman ibn Affan ne Habsha ki sarzameen mein un ka Aap se nikah karaya, aur un ki walida Abu al-As ki beti thin, jo Hazrat Uthman ibn Affan ki phuphi thin."
"223","Kufu mein nikah ke bare mein: Hamein Yahya ibn Ma'in ne bayan kiya, hamein Hatim ibn Isma'il ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Hurmuz al-Fadaki ne bayan kiya, Sa'id aur Muhammad ibnay Ubayd se, Abu Hatim al-Muzani se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas aisa shakhs aaye jis ke deen aur akhlaq ko tum pasand karte ho to us se nikah kar do - teen martaba."
"224","Hamein Qutaybah [ibn Sa'id] ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Layth ne bayan kiya, Ibn Ajlan se, Abdullah ibn Hurmuz al-Yamani se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne isi tarah farmaya; unhon ne kaha: Logon ne Aap se takrar ki, to Aap ne use teen martaba dohraya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Abd al-Hamid ibn Sulayman ne use Ibn Ajlan se muttasil sanad se riwayat kiya hai, aur ye ghalat hai."
"225","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Shaybani se, al-Hakam ibn Utaybah se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Bilal ko Ansar ke ek gharane ki taraf un se nikah ka paigham de kar bheja, to unhon ne kaha: Ek siyah Habshi ghulam! To Hazrat Bilal ne kaha: Agar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhe tumhare paas aane ka hukm na diya hota to main tumhare paas na aata. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne tumhe hukm diya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Unhon ne kaha: Tum malik ban gaye ho. Phir woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur Aap ko khabar di, to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas sone ka ek tukda laya gaya to Aap ne woh unhe ata farmaya aur farmaya: Ise apni biwi tak pahuncha do; aur apne Sahaba se farmaya: Apne bhai ke liye us ke walime me jama ho jao."
"226","Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Mughirah se, Amir se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Bilal apne bhai ko le kar Arab ke kuch logon ki taraf us ke liye nikah ka paigham de kar gaye, to unhon ne kaha: Do Habshi ghulam! [To Hazrat Bilal ne kaha: Haan,] hum gumrah thay to Allah ne humein hidayat di, aur hum ghulam thay to Allah - [Azza wa Jalla] - ne humein azad farmaya."
"227","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Mughirah se; unhon ne is ka zikr kiya, Muharib se, unhon ne kaha: Agar tum hum se nikah karo to Alhamdulillah, aur agar tum humein lauta do to Allahu Akbar."
"228","Harun ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd se, Zayd ibn Aslam se, ke Banu Bukayr [Allah ke Rasul] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Hamari behan ka nikah falan shakhs se kar dijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Bilal kyun nahi? Unhon ne baat dohrai to Aap ne teen martaba baat dohrai, phir unhon ne us ka nikah us se kar diya. Unhon ne kaha: Banu Bukayr Banu Layth me se Muhajirin me se thay."
"229","Amr ibn Uthman aur Kathir ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zubaydi ne mujh se bayan kiya; al-Zuhri ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Banu Bayadah ko hukm diya ke woh Abu Hind ka nikah apne me se ek aurat se kar dein, to unhon ne kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasul, kya hum apni betiyon ka nikah apne azad kardah ghulamon se kar dein? To Allah - [Azza wa Jalla] - ne nazil farmaya: (Beshak Hum ne tumhe mard aur aurat se paida kiya aur tumhe qaumen aur qabile banaya) - ye ayat. al-Zuhri ne kaha: Ye khaas taur par Abu Hind ke bare me nazil hui. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is ka kuch hissa musnad tariqe se riwayat kiya gaya hai, aur woh zaeef hai."
"230","Isa ibn Yunus al-Tarsusi ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Muslim se, Amr ibn Dinar se: ke Hazrat Bilal ke nikah me ek Quraishi khatun thin."
"231","Ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ki riwayat me Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, ke ek shakhs ne apni beti ka nikah kar diya jabke woh razi na thin, to woh Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap se is ka zikr kiya, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum use napasand karti ho? Unhon ne kaha: Haan, to Aap ne un ka muamla un ke apne haath me de diya."
"232","Talaq ke bare me: Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Awf se, Anas ibn Sirin se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Abu Ayyub - yani unhon ne Umm Ayyub ko talaq dene ka irada kiya tha - ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se mashwara kiya, to Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Umm Ayyub ko talaq dena sakht gunah hai."
"233","Ibn Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar ne humein khabar di, al-Zuhri se, ke Ghailan ibn Salamah Islam laye jabke un ke nikah mein das biwiyan thin, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke un mein se chaar ko rakhen."
"234","Muhammad ibn Khallad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se; Ata ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas apne shohar ki shikayat karti hui aayi, to Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum us ka bagh use wapas karogi? Us ne kaha: Ji haan, aur zaid bhi. Aap ne farmaya: Zaid rahe to hargiz nahin."
"235","Ahmad ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij ne humein khabar di. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Dawud ibn Abi Asim ne kaha: Unhon ne khabar di ke Saeed ibn al-Musayyib ne unhein khabar di ke ek aurat jo Sabit ibn Qais ibn Shammas ke nikah mein thi aur us ne use mehr mein ek bagh diya tha aur woh ghayyur tha, pas us ne use mara yahan tak ke us ka haath tod diya, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur Aap se us ki shikayat ki, aur kaha: Main us ka bagh use wapas kar dungi. To Aap ne us ke shohar ko bulaya aur farmaya: Yeh tumhara bagh tumhein wapas karti hai. Us ne kaha: Aur kya woh mera hai? Aap ne farmaya: Ji haan. Us ne kaha: Maine qubool kiya, Ya Rasul Allah. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jao, aur woh ek hai. Phir us ne us ke baad Rifaah al-Amiri se nikah kiya, to us ne use mara, pas woh Usman ke paas aayi aur kaha: Main us ka mehr use wapas kar dungi. To Usman ne use bulaya aur us ne qubool kiya, aur Usman ne kaha: Jao, aur woh ek hai."
"236","Ishaq ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khula lene wali aurat ke baare mein farmaya: Woh us se zyada na le jitna us ne use diya tha."
"237","Ahmad ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Nuaim ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se, Ata se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khula lene wali aurat se us se zyada lene se mana farmaya jitna us ne use diya tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Waki ne kaha: Maine Ibn Juraij se is ke baare mein poocha, [to us ne is ka inkar kiya aur use pehchana nahin]."
"238","Haram qarar dene ka bayan: Muhammad ibn al-Musanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Aala ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, al-Hasan se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apni Qibti laundi Mariyah jo Ibrahim ki walida hain unhein apne upar haram qarar diya, pas unhein apni qasam ka kaffara ada karne ka hukm diya gaya, aur is par un ki itab ki gayi."
"239","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Arubah se, Qatadah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasul Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hafsa ke ghar mein the, pas woh andar aayin aur unhon ne Aap ke saath Aap ki laundi ko dekha, to unhon ne kaha: Mere ghar mein [aur mere din mein]? Aap ne farmaya: Khamosh raho; Allah ki qasam, main us ke qareeb hargiz nahin jaunga, aur woh mujh par haram hai."
"240","Hudood ka bayan: Hisham ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn Yahya al-Khushani ne hum se bayan kiya, Zaid ibn Waqid se, Makhul se, Ubadah ibn al-Samit se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasul Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hudood ko qaim karo, aabadi aur safar mein, qareeb aur door par, aur Allah ke maamle mein kisi malamat karne wale ki malamat ki parwa na karo."
"241","Hum se Abbas al-Anbari ne bayan kiya, hum se Abdur Razzaq ne bayan kiya, humein Mamar ne khabar di, az-Zuhri se ke Safwan ibn al-Muattal ne Hassan ibn Sabit ko talwar se mara [Allah ke Rasool] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane mein, aur Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ka haath nahi kaata."
"242","Hum se Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne bayan kiya, hum se Abdur Rahman ne bayan kiya, hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Isa se - yani Ibn Abi Azzah - ash-Shabi se, Abdullah se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se ke Aap ne paanch dirham ki qeemat par (haath) kaata."
"243","Hum se Ahmad ibn Abdah ne bayan kiya, hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Khusayfah se, Muhammad ibn Abdur Rahman ibn Sauban se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas ek chor laya gaya jis ne ek shawl churayi thi, to Aap ne farmaya: Hum nahi samajhte ke tum ne chori ki? Us ne kaha: Ji haan main ne kiya hai, to Aap ne farmaya: Use le jao aur us ko kaato phir us ko daagho phir use mere paas lao, to woh use le gaye aur us ko kaata phir us ko daagha phir use Aap ke paas laye, to Aap ne farmaya: Allah se tauba karo, us ne kaha: Main ne Allah se tauba ki, Aap ne farmaya: Aye Allah us ki tauba qubool farma."
"244","Hum se Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hum se Jarir ibn Hazim ne bayan kiya, al-Hasan se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Main khane mein haath nahi kaatta."
"245","[Abu Mamar] ne hum se bayan kiya, hum se Abdul Waris ne bayan kiya, al-Husayn [ibn Dhakwan] se, Yahya se, Baja ibn Abdullah al-Juhani se ke Juhaynah ka ek aadmi bazaar se samaan chura kar Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Main ne chori ki hai [to mera haath kaat dijiye], to Aap ne us ka haath kaata, phir us ne Allah ki raah mein jihad kiya aur shaheed ho gaya."
"246","Hum se Muhammad ibn Sulayman al-Anbari ne bayan kiya, [Hammad ibn Masadah ne hum se bayan kiya,] Ibn Jurayj se, Abd Rabbih ibn Abi Umayyah se, al-Haris ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Rabiah se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas ek chor laya gaya aur kaha gaya: Woh Ansar ke yateemon ka hai jin ke paas us ke siwa koi maal nahi, to Aap ne use chhod diya, phir dusri martaba to use chhod diya, phir teesri martaba to use chhod diya, phir chauthi martaba to use chhod diya, phir paanchvi martaba to us ka haath kaata, phir chhathi martaba to us ka paon kaata, phir saatvi martaba to us ka haath kaata, phir aathvi martaba to us ka paon kaata, phir Aap ne farmaya: Chaar chaar ke badle."
"247","Hum se Kasir ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, [Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Safwan ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya,] mujhe al-Fudayl ibn Fadalah al-Hawzani ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Aye Allah ke Rasool mere pet mein ek hadas hai - aur unhon ne [sangsaar ki kahani] zikr ki - to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Use sangsaar karo aur us ke gird pathar zyada karo aur us par lagatar barsao."
"248","Hum se Hannad ibn as-Sari ne bayan kiya, hum se Abul Ahwas ne bayan kiya, Simak se, al-Hasan al-Basri se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Main ne zina kiya hai - aur unhon ne hadees zikr ki - unhon ne kaha: Jab us ne bachcha jana to Aap ne use hukm diya to us ne taharat ki aur apne kafan pehne, phir Aap ne us ke bare mein hukm diya aur use sangsaar kar diya gaya."
"249","Diyat ke bare mein, us Musalman ke qisas mein qatl kiye jane ke bare mein jis ne kisi kafir ko qatl kiya ho: [Ibn Abi Najiyah] al-Iskandarani ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman [ibn Bilal] ne mujh se bayan kiya, Rabi'ah ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn al-Baylamani se riwayat hai; unhon ne un se bayan kiya ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas ek Musalman shakhs laya gaya jis ne ahl-e-zimmah mein se ek mu'ahid shakhs ko qatl kar diya tha, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us Musalman ko aage badhaya pas us ki gardan maar di gayi, aur Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Main us ke ahd ko poora karne ka sab se zyada haqdar hoon. Ibn Wahb ne kaha: Is ki tashreeh ye hai ke us ne use dhoka de kar qatl kiya tha."
"250","[Wahb ibn Bayan, Ahmad ibn Sa'id al-Hamadhani aur Ibn al-Sarh ne kaha:] Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Ya'qub ne mujhe khabar di; Abdullah ibn Abd al-Aziz ibn Salih al-Hadrami ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din ek Musalman ko ek kafir ke badle qatl kiya jise us ne dhoka de kar qatl kiya tha, aur farmaya: Main us ke ahd ko poora karne ka sab se zyada haqdar - ya sab se zyada mustahiq - hoon."
"251","Zakhamon se qisas kab liya jaye: Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, Aban ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Dinar se, Muhammad ibn Talhah se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya - aur ek shakhs ne use seeng se zakhmi kiya tha - aur us ne kaha: Aye Nabi Allah, mujhe qisas dilaiye. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Sehatyab hone tak intezar karo. Phir woh un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aye Nabi Allah, mujhe qisas dilaiye. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Sehatyab hone tak intezar karo. Phir woh teesri martaba un ke paas aaya aur kaha: Aye Nabi Allah, mujhe qisas dilaiye, to unhon ne qisas de diya. Phir jis se qisas liya gaya tha woh sehatyab ho gaya, jabke jis ko qisas dilaya gaya tha us ki taang langdi reh gayi, to us ne kaha: Aye Nabi Allah, meri taang langdi hai, pas qisas dilaiye. Unhon ne farmaya: Jao, tumhein qisas dila diya gaya hai."
"252","[Ibn Abdah] aur Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Muhammad ibn Talhah ibn Yazid ibn Rukanah se ... isi ma'na ke sath. Ibn al-Sarh ne is mein kaha: Main tum se pehle hi keh chuka tha."
"253","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Dinar se, unhi ki sanad se, isi tarah. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ibn Ulayyah ne use muttasil sanad se riwayat kiya, Ayyub se, Amr se, Jabir se, aur is mein ghalti ki; aur pehli riwayat zyada sahih hai."
"254","Diyat kitni hai: al-Haytham ibn Khalid al-Juhani ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Ayyub ibn Musa se, Makhul se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki wafat hui jabke diyat aath sau dinar thi, phir un ke baad Hazrat Umar ne andesha kiya, to unhon ne use barah hazar dirham ya ek hazar dinar muqarrar kar diya."
"255","Abu Kamil ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Zuray' ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se riwayat hai: ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane mein diyat ki qeemat aath sau dinar thi."
"256","Wahb ibn Bayan, Ibn al-Sarh aur Ahmad ibn Sa'id ne kaha: Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Yunus ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke us khat mein padha jo unhon ne Amr ibn Hazm ko likha jab unhein Najran ki taraf bheja - aur woh khat Abu Bakr ibn Hazm ke paas tha - Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us mein likha: Ye Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki taraf se bayan hai: (Aye iman walo, ahdon ko poora karo). Aur unhon ne us mein se aayaat likhin yahan tak ke (Beshak Allah jald hisab lene wala hai) tak pahunche. Phir unhon ne likha: Ye zakhamon ka bayan hai: Jaan ke badle sau oont; naak ke badle jab us ka kaatna mukammal ho sau oont; aankh ke badle pachaas oont; kaan ke badle pachaas oont; haath ke badle pachaas oont; paon ke badle pachaas oont; un mein se har ungli ke badle das oont; ma'mumah (dimagh ki jhilli tak pahunchne wale zakham) ke badle ek tihai diyat-e-jaan; ja'ifah (aar-paar hone wale zakham) ke badle ek tihai diyat-e-jaan; munaqqilah (haddi ko apni jagah se hatane wali toot-phoot) ke badle pandrah; mudihah (haddi ko zahir karne wale zakham) ke badle paanch oont; aur daant ke badle paanch oont. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Ye wohi hai jo maine us khat mein padha jo Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne likha tha, jo Abu Bakr ibn Hazm ke paas tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se riwayat kiya gaya hai lekin sahih nahin hai; Yahya ibn Hamzah ne use Sulayman ibn Arqam se, al-Zuhri se, Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se riwayat kiya hai."
"257","Abu Hubayrah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main ne ise Yahya ibn Hamzah ke asl nuskhe mein parha; mujhe Sulayman ibn Arqam ne bayan kiya. Aur Harun ibn Muhammad ibn Bakkar ne hum se bayan kiya; mujhe mere walid aur mere chacha ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Yahya ibn Hamzah, Sulayman ibn Arqam se, isi tarah. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Jo Sulayman ibn Dawud ne kaha, us mein us ne ghalati ki."
"258","al-Hakam ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Yahya ibn Hamzah ne bayan kiya, Sulayman ibn Dawud [al-Khawlani - siqah -] se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se; al-Hakam ne is mein ghalati ki."
"259","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ne bayan kiya, hamen Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Amr ibn Hazm se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke khat mein - yani is wale mein - tha: Zakar mein diyat hai; aur zaban mein diyat hai."
"260","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Hammad ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne Makhul se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Zaban mein diyat hai; zakar mein diyat hai; aur aage ke danton mein paanch paanch faraiz hain."
"261","Muhammad ibn [Abdullah] ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Abd al-Rahman, yani Ibn Maghra, ne bayan kiya, hamen Muhammad, yani Ibn Ishaq, ne bayan kiya. Main ne Makhul ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unsayain mein diyat ka faisla farmaya."
"262","Qutaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen al-Layth ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Had se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: [Hazrat Rasool Allah] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sulb mein diyat hai."
"263","Zimmi ki diyat: Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Yahya Abu Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Abu Muawiyah ne bayan kiya, hamen Ibn Abi Dhib ne bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har ahd wale ki diyat, jab tak woh apne ahd mein ho, ek hazar dinar hai."
"264","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, hamen Abd al-Razzaq ne bayan kiya, Mamar se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: [Hazrat Rasool Allah] (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Zakar mein diyat hai."
"265","Aur isi sanad ke saath riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dono haathon ke liye diyat ka faisla farmaya, aur dono paon ke liye diyat ka faisla farmaya."
"266","Aur isi sanad ke saath: al-Zuhri se riwayat hai ke Hazrat al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat - us ki taraf se us ke asabah us ki diyat ada karenge, aur us ke bete us ke waris honge. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yahya ibn Yaman ne ise Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se, Urwah se, al-Mughirah se riwayat kiya, aur ye ghalat hai."
"267","Muhammad ibn al-Wazir al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ya'ni Ibn Hassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Mujammi' ibn Ya'qub ne hum se bayan kiya. Mujhe Rabi'ah ibn Abi Abd al-Rahman ne khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Zimmi ki diyat Musalman ki diyat ki tarah thi Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke zamane mein, aur Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ke zamane mein, Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ke zamane mein, aur Hazrat Uthman Raziallahu anhu ke zamane mein, yahan tak ke ibteda hui - ya'ni Hazrat Mu'awiyah Raziallahu anhu ki hukumat ki - to Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Agar us ke ghar wale us ke nuqsan se musibat zadah hue hain to Musalmanon ka bait-ul-mal bhi us ke nuqsan se musibat zadah hua hai; pas Musalmanon ke bait-ul-mal ke liye aadha muqarrar karo, aur us ke ghar walon ke liye aadha: paanch sau dinar aur paanch sau dinar. Phir ahl-e-zimmah mein se ek aur shakhs qatl kiya gaya, to Mu'awiyah ne kaha: Agar hum us cheez ko dekhen jo bait-ul-mal mein dakhil hoti hai aur use Musalmanon aur un ki hifazat ke liye wazifah bana den - unhon ne kaha: to us waqt se us ne us ki diyat paanch sau muqarrar kar di."
"268","Qasamah ke baare mein: Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah aur Asim al-Ahwal se, dono ne Abu al-Mughirah se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Taif mein qasamah ki bunyad par qisas liya."
"269","Mahmud ibn Khalid aur Kathir ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha; (tahweel) aur Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya; al-Walid ne hamen khabar di, al-Awza'i se, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se - Ibn al-Sabbah ne apni riwayat mein kaha: ke us ne un se Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se riwayat ki - ke us ne qasamah ki bunyad par Banu Nasr ibn Malik ke ek shakhs ko Bahrar al-Rugha' mein qatl kiya; Mahmud ne izafa kiya: Liyyah ke kinare par; qatil aur maqtul unhi mein se the. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Mahmud is hadith mein un sab se zyada mazboot hain; aur Kathir ne kaha: Buhayr al-Rugha' mein."
"270","Harun ibn Zayd ibn Abi al-Zarqa ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Rashid ne hum se bayan kiya. Hamen Makhul ne bayan kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne qasamah mein qisas ka faisla nahi farmaya."
"271","Muhammad ibn Sama'ah al-Ramli ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Maine Ubaydullah ibn Umar se kaha: Kya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne qasamah (ijtimai qasmon) ki bunyad par qatl kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: To kya Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: To kya Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: To phir tum us ki bunyad par kyun qatl karte ho? To wo khamosh ho gaye. (Unhon ne kaha:) Phir main Malik ibn Anas se mila aur kaha: Kya Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne qasamah ki bunyad par qatl kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: To kya Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: To kya Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Maine kaha: To phir tum us ki bunyad par kyun qatl karte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Hum Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke farman ko dhoke par nahi dalte."
"272","Muhammad ibn Qudamah ibn A'yan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hajjaj ibn Abi Uthman se; mujhe Abu Raja' jo Abu Qilabah ke azaad kardah hain ne bayan kiya, Abu Qilabah se, ke Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ne kaha: Qasamah ke mutalliq tum kya kehte ho? Logon ne shor kiya, phir us ne kaha: Ai Abu Qilabah tum kya kehte ho, aur us ne mujhe logon ke samne numaayan kiya; pas us ne Uraniyyun ki hadith zikr ki. Maine kaha: Is muamle mein Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf se ek sunnat thi: Ansar ke kuch afrad ek raat un ke paas guftagu kar rahe the, phir un mein se ek shakhs un se aage nikal kar bahar gaya, phir wo us ke baad bahar gaye to apne saathi ko khoon mein tadapta hua paya. Wo Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas wapas aaye aur kaha: Ai Allah ke Rasool, hum aap ke paas se nikle aur hamara saathi hum se aage nikal kar gaya, aur hum us ke baad nikle to use khoon mein tadapta hua paya. Pas Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) bahar tashreef laye aur farmaya: Tum kise muttaham karte ho - ya tumhara kya khayal hai - ke tumhare saathi ko kis ne qatl kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Hamara khayal hai ke Yahudiyon ne use qatl kiya. Us ne Yahudiyon ko bulaya aur farmaya: Kya tum ne is shakhs ko qatl kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Farmaya: Kya tum pachaas Yahudiyon ki qasmon ko qubool karoge ke unhon ne use qatl nahi kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Wo parwah nahi karenge agar wo hum sab ko qatl kar den phir qasam kha len. Farmaya: To kya tum diyat ke mustahiq hoge, jabke tum mein se pachaas qasam khayen ke unhon ne use qatl kiya? Unhon ne kaha: Hum hargiz qasam nahi khayenge. Pas Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khud us ki diyat ada farmayi."
"273","Ubaidullah ibn Muaz ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ashas se, al-Hasan se: Ek shakhs ne apni biwi ke chehre par thappad mara, to woh Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aayin aur un se shikayat ki, kehte hue: Qisas. Phir yeh nazil hui: (Mard auraton par nigran hain), to unhon ne use (qisas ko) tark kar diya."
"274","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Imran ibn Muhammad ibn Said ibn al-Musayyib ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid Muhammad ibn Said ne mujhe khabar di, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ladai mein aamne saamne hone wale har do ladne walon ko un ke darmiyan pesh aane wali har cheez ka zamin qarar diya, jab woh iqrar kar len ya jab wazeh saboot qaim ho jaye. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-Muttalib ibn Abi Wadaah aur Yunus ibn Yusuf ne yeh khabar Ibn al-Musayyib se, Usman ibn Affan se, un ke apne qaul ke taur par riwayat ki, aur use (Nabi tak) marfu na kiya."
"275","Jihad ke bare mein: Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Humein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne kabhi kisi ghaib shakhs ko us maal-e-ghanimat mein se hissa ata na farmaya jis mein woh maujud na tha, siwaye Khaibar ke din ke, jab unhon ne Hudaybiyah walon mein se ghaib logon ko hissa ata farmaya, is liye ke Allah ne Khaibar Hudaybiyah walon mein se Musalmanon ko ata farmaya tha, aur Us ne farmaya: (Allah ne tum se bahut si ghanimaton ka wada kiya hai jinhen tum loge, aur Us ne yeh tumhare liye jald ata kar di). To woh Hudaybiyah walon ke liye thi, un mein se jo wahan hazir the aur jo us se ghaib the, aur un ke sath dusron mein se jo bhi hazir hua us ke liye. Aur humein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke unhon ne Badr ke din Usman ko hissa ata farmaya, aur humein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke unhon ne Talha aur Said ibn Zaid ko hissa ata farmaya, halanke woh Sham mein ghaib the."
"276","Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Masudi se, al-Hakam se, ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Jafar aur un ke sathiyon ko hisse ata farmaye, halanke woh Khaibar ke baad aaye the; unhon ne unhen us mein se hissa ata farmaya halanke unhon ne ladai mein haziri na di thi."
"277","Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se; Abu Usman ibn Yazid ne mujhe khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Is par musalsal amal hota raha, aur unhon ne use Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tak marfu kiya: Jab kisi shakhs ke yahan bachcha paida ho is ke baad ke woh Musalmanon ki sarzamin aur sulah wali sarzamin se nikal chuka ho, jabke woh dushman ki sarzamin mein ho - chahe wahi pehli jagah ho jis mein woh dakhil hua ho - to us naumaulud ka Musalmanon ke sath hissa hai. Unhon ne kaha: Aur unhon ne us shakhs ka naam liya jis ke bachche ke bare mein Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne (is tarah) faisla farmaya: jab koi shakhs dushman ki sarzamin mein dakhil hone aur Musalmanon ki sarzamin aur sulah wali sarzamin se nikalne ke baad faut ho jaye to us ka hissa us ke ghar walon ka hai."
"278","Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq al-Fazari ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn al-Simt se, al-Numan se, Makhul se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Khaibar mein (baz) auraton ko ek ek hissa ata farmaya."
"279","Said ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Amr ne mujhe khabar di, ke Said ibn Abi Hilal ne unhen khabar di, ke Ibn Shibl ne un se bayan kiya ke Sahlah bint Asim Khaibar ke din paida huin, to Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sahulat ke sath aayi, phir unhon ne un ke liye ek hissa muqarrar farmaya. Logon mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Aap ne Sahlah ko mere hisse ke barabar de diya."
"280","Said ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Yazid ibn Jabir se, al-Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apni jang mein baz Yahudiyon se madad li aur unhen hisse ata farmaye."
"281","Al-Qa'nabi aur Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya - al-Qa'nabi ne kaha: Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya - Haywah ibn Shurayh se, Ibn Shihab se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un Yahudiyon ko hissa ata farmaya jo Aap ke hamrah ghazwa me shareek hue the - Hannad ne izafa kiya: Musalmanon ke hisson ki manind."
"282","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn al-Hurr se; al-Hakam ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr ibn Shu'ayb se, un ke walid se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khums ka farz nazil hone se pehle nafal ata farmaya karte the; phir jab ye ayat nazil hui: (Jan lo ke jo kuch tum ghanimat me hasil karo to us ka panchwan hissa Allah ke liye hai), to Aap ne wo nafal tark kar diya jo Aap ata farmaya karte the, aur wo khums ke khums me shamil ho gaya; aur wahi Allah ka hissa hai aur Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka hissa hai."
"283","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Ja'far ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd se, al-Hakam se, ek shakhs se, us ke walid se, anfal ke bare me, unhon ne kaha: (Wo Aap se anfal ke bare me sawal karte hain), aur Ibn Mas'ud ki qirat me hai: (Wo Aap se anfalon ka sawal karte hain). Unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ghanimat me se jo chahte nafal ke taur par ata farmate the, aur Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Badr ke din Sa'd ibn Malik ko al-Asi ibn Sa'id ka hathyar nafal me ata farmaya tha, aur Sa'd ne al-Asi ko qatl kiya tha. Phir ye is ayat se mansukh ho gaya: Jan lo ke jo kuch tum ghanimat me hasil karo to us ka panchwan hissa Allah ke liye hai; aur Abdullah ki qirat me hai: (Jo kuch tum ghanimat me hasil karo wo Allah aur Rasool ke liye hai). Ghanimat li jati phir us me se panchwan hissa alag kiya jata, aur Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khums ke khums me se apna hissa nafal ke taur par ata farmate. Aur aaj ka imam Allah aur Rasool ke hisse me se jo chahe nafal de sakta hai, kyunke wo sirf khums ka khums hai - us ke siwa us ke liye kuch nahi."
"284","Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ishaq se; Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ne humein khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Qurayzah ka ghazwa pehla ghazwa tha jis me hisse muqarrar kiye gaye aur taqseem ke hisse wazeh kiye gaye; Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne sawar ko teen hisse ata farmaye aur pyade ko ek hissa, aur ghode chhattis the."
"285","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Shu'aythi ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Ma'dan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Arabi ghode ko do hisse ata farmaye aur hajeen ko ek hissa."
"286","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi, Hammad ibn Khalid aur Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne un se ek hi mafhum bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah ibn Salih se, Abu Bishr se, Makhul se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din hajeen ko hajeen qarar diya aur Arabi ko Arabi: Arabi ke liye do hisse hain aur hajeen ke liye ek hissa."
"287","Ghode aur sawari ke janwaron ke bare me bab: Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Rashid se, unhon ne kaha: Makhul se kaha gaya: Abd al-Rahman ibn Salim ne Tustar ke qile se - ek qila jo us ne fatah kiya tha - ghodon ko hissa nahi diya. To Makhul ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din ghodon ko hissa ata farmaya tha, halanke wo sirf ek qila tha."
"288","Muhammad ibn Musaffa ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Shu'ayb ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Nu'man ne mujhe khabar di, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Khaybar ke din ghodon ko do hisse, pyade ko ek hissa, bachchon ko ek hissa aur auraton ko ek hissa ata farmaya."
"289","Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd ibn Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz ibn Rufay' se, Makkah walon mein se ek shakhs se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek ghazwe par jihad farmaya aur unhen ghanimat hasil hui, to Aap ne sawar ko teen hisse diye, pyade ko ek hissa aur zirah posh (baktar band) ladne wale ko do hisse diye."
"290","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ya'ni Ibn Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zubayr ya'ni Ibn al-Khirrit se, Nu'aym ibn Abi Hind se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas ek ghoda laya gaya to Aap us ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur us ke chehre, us ki aankhon aur us ke nathnon ko apni qamis ke aasteen se ponchha, arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasool Allah, kya Aap apni qamis ke aasteen se ponchhte hain? Aap ne farmaya: Jibrail ne ghodo ke mu'amle mein mujhe malamat ki hai."
"291","al-Walid ibn Utbah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Hawshab ne hum se bayan kiya; unhon ne Makhul ko yeh kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ko ponchho (aur malo) aur unhen jholon se dhanko."
"292","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah aur Muhammad ibn Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya; Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Masarrah ibn Ma'bad se, al-Wadin se - Muhammad ibn Sulayman ne kaha: al-Wadin ibn Ata' - unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ghodon ko un ki peshaniyon se pakad kar na hanko ke tum unhen zaleel karo."
"293","Ahmad ibn Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Wa'il se - ya Bakr ibn Wa'il se - al-Zuhri se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tak rafa' karte hue, Aap ne farmaya: Bojhon ko muakkhar karo, kyunke haath latke hue hain aur paon bandhe hue hain."
"294","Ghulul (maal-e-ghanimat mein khayanat) ke bare mein bab: Ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur ibn Abi al-Aswad se, al-A'mash se, Shimr se, Abu Hazim se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas ghanimat mein se chamde ki ek chatai lai gai to arz kiya gaya: Ya Rasool Allah, yeh Aap ke liye hai taake Aap is se dhoop se saya hasil karen, Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum pasand karte ho ke tumhare Nabi aag ki chatai se saya hasil karen?"
"295","Saron ko (kaat kar) le jane ke bare mein: Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Usamah se, Bashir ibn Uqbah se, Abu Nadrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) dushman se muqabil hue aur farmaya: Jo shakhs (kata hua) sar le kar aayega us ke liye Allah ki taraf se woh hoga jo woh chahega, do aadmi ek sar le kar aaye aur us mein jhagda karne lage to Aap ne us ka faisla un mein se ek ke haq mein farmaya aur farmaya: Allah se jo chaho mango, us ne kaha: Main tez talwar chahta hun jis se main ladun hatta ke qatl kar diya jaun, Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Is mauzu' mein Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se kai ahadith hain jin mein se koi sahih nahin."
"296","Saleeb dene ke bare mein: Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Isra'il ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Haytham ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Uqbah ibn Abi Mu'ayt ko ek darakht se maslub farmaya, us ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, kya main Quraysh se alag (muntakhab kiya gaya) hun? Aap ne farmaya: Han, us ne kaha: Phir bachchon ki dekh bhal kaun karega? Aap ne farmaya: Aag."
"297","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ibn Hazim se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Mushrikon ne ek shakhs ko Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko qatl karne par sone ke uqiya dene ki peshkash ki. Unhon ne kaha: Pas Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use pakad liya aur use Madinah ke ek pahad par saleeb par chadha diya jise Dhubab kaha jata hai; woh Islam mein sab se pehla saleeb diya gaya shakhs tha."
"298","Sawari ke janwaron ke bare mein: Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Anbas se, Zadham se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali ne teen aadmiyon ko ek khachchar par sawar dekha to kaha: Tum mein se ek utar jaye, kyunke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne teesre par lanat farmayi hai."
"299","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd se, Muhammad ibn Ubayd al-Ansari se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs baghair lagaam aur baghair nakel ke sawari par sawar ho aur woh use gira de ... to unhon ne is ke bare mein sakht baat kahi."
"300","Muhammad ibn Rafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Hasan yani Ibn Atash ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Wadin se - aur mere nazdeek woh Ibn Ata hain - ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs naqat ke sath ek uqba paidal chale to us ke liye ek gardan azad karne ke barabar sawab hai."
"301","Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se; Muhammad ibn Murrah ne mujhe khabar di ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki talwar ka naam Dhu al-Faqar tha, aur Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zirha ka naam Dhat al-Fudul tha."
"302","Jihad ki fazilat ke bare mein bab: Amr ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jabir se, Makhul se, ke woh unhein Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se riwayat karke sunate the ke Aap ne farmaya: Jis ne hajj na kiya ho us ke liye ek hajj das ghazwon ya nau ghazwon se behtar hai; aur hajj ke baad ek ghazwa das hajjon ya nau se behtar hai."
"303","Said ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn al-Ghaz se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Ghazwa Tabuk ke din hajj ke liye ijazat mangne walon ne Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se bahut taqaza kiya, to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis ne hajj kar liya ho us ke liye ek ghazwa chalis hajjon se behtar hai."
"304","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abdullah al-Awdi ne hum se bayan kiya, ke Wabarah Abu Kurz al-Harithi ne un se bayan kiya ke unhon ne Rabi ibn Ziyad ko kehte hue suna: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) safar farma rahe the to Aap ka samna Quraysh ke ek ladke se hua jo raste se alag thalag chal raha tha. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya woh fulan nahi hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ji han, beshak. Aap ne farmaya: Phir use bulao. Aap ne farmaya: Tum raste se alag kyun hue? Us ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, mujhe ghubar napasand aaya. Aap ne farmaya: Is se alag na ho, pas us Zaat ki qasam Jis ke Hath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai, beshak woh Jannat ka bareek ghubar hai."
"305","Hamein Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hamein Wuhayb ne bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke Sahaba mein se kuch Hazraat apne ek saathi ki khair ke sath tareef karte hue aaye, unhon ne kaha: Hum ne falan shakhs jaisa koi shakhs hargiz nahi dekha; jab bhi hum safar mein hote to woh qirat mein mashghool hota, aur jab bhi hum manzil mein hote to woh namaz mein mashghool hota. To Aap ne farmaya: Phir us ke kaam ki kifayat kaun karta tha? ... yahan tak ke Aap ne zikr farmaya: Aur us ke oont ya us ke janwar ko chaara kaun khilata tha? Unhon ne kaha: Hum khilate the. To Aap ne farmaya: Phir tum sab us se behtar ho."
"306","Hamein Mahdi ibn Hafs ne bayan kiya, hamein Isa ne bayan kiya, Yunus se, Mamar se, Musa ibn Shaybah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs do mah se zyada badiya mein rahe to woh aarabiyat hai."
"307","Hamein Musa ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, Amr ibn Dinar se, Said ibn Jubayr se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) al-Batha mein the ke Yazid ibn Rukanah - ya Rukanah - apni kuch bakriyan lekar Aap ke paas aaya aur Aap se kaha: Ae Muhammad, kya aap mujh se kushti ladenge? Aap ne farmaya: Tum kya shart lagate ho? Us ne kaha: Meri bakriyon mein se ek bakri. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se kushti ladi aur use pachar diya aur ek bakri le li. Phir Rukanah khada hua aur kaha: Kya dobara ka irada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Tum kya shart lagate ho? Us ne kaha: Ek aur. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se kushti ladi aur use pachar diya. Aap ne us se usi tarah farmaya, phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum kya shart lagate ho? Us ne kaha: Ek aur. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se kushti ladi aur use pachar diya - unhon ne kai martaba is ka zikr kiya - phir us ne kaha: Ae Muhammad, Allah ki qasam, kisi ne kabhi mera pehlu zameen par nahi lagaya, aur Aap woh nahi hain jis ne mujhe pachar diya - yaani: to woh Islam le aaya - aur Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ke liye dua farmayi."
"308","Hamein Abu Tawbah al-Rabi ibn Nafi ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn al-Mubarak ne bayan kiya, Mamar se, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein ek nek giroh hamesha rahega; woh Allah se jo bhi cheez mangenge Woh un ke liye qubool farmayega. Un ke zariye tumhari madad ki jati hai aur un ke zariye tum par barish barsayi jati hai, aur mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha: Aur un ke zariye tum se museebat door ki jati hai."
"309","Hamein Qutaybah ibn Said ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Safwan yaani al-Marwani ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhib se; mujhe Salih ibn Kathir ne khabar di - aur woh Ibn Shihab ke saathi the - unhon ne kaha: Ibn Shihab Jumuah ke din din ke awwal hisse mein safar ke liye nikle, to main ne un se is bare mein baat ki, to unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Jumuah ke din din ke awwal hisse mein safar ke liye nikle."
"310","Hamein Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Hafs ibn Ghiyath ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke koi mard akele safar kare ya akele ghar mein raat guzare."
"311","Hamein Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, Yunus se, Ikrimah se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne al-Fajr naam ke ek shakhs ko apne kisi kaam ke silsile mein Ahl-e-Makkah ki taraf bheja. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Isi mana mein muttasil sanad ke sath riwayat marvi hai."
"312","Hamein Said ibn Mansur ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdullah ibn al-Mubarak ne bayan kiya, Haywah se, Uqayl se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen saathi chaar hain, behtareen dastay chaar sau hain, aur behtareen lashkar chaar hazar hain."
"313","Makhlad ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Usman ya'ni Ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ne humein khabar di, Uqail se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Hazrat Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se ... isi ma'na ke sath. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye riwayat muttasil sanad se bayan hui hai lekin ye sahih nahi; Jarir ibn Hazim ne ise musnad bayan kiya hai aur ye ghalati hai."
"314","Abu Salih Mahbub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne humein khabar di, Yazid ibn al-Simt se, unhon ne al-Nu'man se, unhon ne Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu ko wasiyyat farmayi, phir farmaya: Jab tum ghazwe par jao aur dushman se muqabla ho to buzdili na dikhana; jab tumhein (maal-e-ghanimat) hasil ho to khayanat na karna; kisi momin ko taklif na dena; sahib-e-amr ki nafarmani na karna; khajoor ke darakhton ko na jalana aur na unhein gharq karna. Unhon ne kaha: Pas Hazrat Abu Hurayrah Raziallahu anhu logon ko in baton ki khabar diya karte the."
"315","Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya - Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di - Amr ibn al-Harith ne mujhe khabar di, Usman ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne al-Qasim se jo Abd al-Rahman ke azaad karda ghulam hain: Hazrat Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko jo ghazwe par gaya tha wasiyyat farmayi ke: Phal dene wala darakht na kaatna, jis janwar ki tumhein hajat na ho use qatl na karna, aur mominon ko taklif dene se bachte rehna."
"316","Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ishaq se ke Hazrat Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Taif ki taraf rawana hue aur Malik ibn Awf ke qile ko girane ka hukm diya aur angoor ki belon ko kaatne ka hukm diya."
"317","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya se ya'ni Ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Badr ke din mashwara talab farmaya to Hazrat al-Hubab ibn al-Mundhir Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Hamari rae hai ke ek kunwen ke siwa tamam kunwen band kar diye jayein taake hum logon se ya'ni dushman se us par muqabla karein. Pas Hazrat Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un tamam kunwon ko band karne ka hukm diya siwae Badr ke kunwen ke, pas unhon ne logon se us par muqabla kiya. Aur jab Aap Khaybar tashrif laye to logon se mashwara kiya ke hum kahan padhao dalein to Hazrat al-Hubab Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Qilaon ke darmiyan ya'ni un ke darmiyan padhao dalein taake hum in ki khabar un se aur un ki khabar in se munqata kar dein. Pas Aap mehlon ke darmiyan utre."
"318","Abu Tawbah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mu'awiyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Sallam se ke unhon ne Abu Sallam ko kehte hue suna: Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Khaybar me utre to Aap ne us ke ek hisse me qital farmaya phir dusre hisse ki taraf muntaqil hue. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Hum basti ke kinare ki taraf muntaqil ho rahe hain, pas koi shakhs wahan qital na kare jahan hum qital karte the. Wo Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath Un ke dastoun ki haisiyat se rawana hue lekin Ansar ke sardaron me se ek shakhs ne apne sathiyon ke ek giroh samait mukhalifat ki aur wahan qital kiya jahan Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein mana farmaya tha. Wo qatl kar diya gaya aur wo use uthaye hue laye. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Us par namaz padhne ke liye khade hue phir mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: Kya wo hamare mana karne se pehle qatl hua ya hamare mana karne ke baad? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ke mana karne ke baad. Pas Aap ne Us se e'raz farmaya phir munadi ko hukm diya ke logon me elan kare: Jannat nafarman ke liye halal nahi. Phir wo din ke aakhir tak pada raha yahan tak ke us ki qaum ke kuch log Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Kya hum use dafan na karein? Aap ne farmaya: Jo chaaho karo."
"319","Harun ibn Zayd ibn Abi al-Zarqa' ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne dushman par hamla kiya aur kaha: Main Farsi ladka hun. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Tum ne ye kyun na kaha: Main Ansari ladka hun? Aur wo Ansar ka azaad karda ghulam tha."
"320","Qutaybah ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne Ata' al-Khurasani se ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, Banu Salamah ke sab log qital karte hain; un me se koi duniya ke liye qital karta hai, koi shuja'at ke liye qital karta hai, aur koi Allah Ta'ala ki raza ki talab me qital karta hai to un me se shaheed kaun hai? Aap ne farmaya: Sab hi shaheed hain jab tak us ke muamle ki bunyad ye ho ke Allah ka kalma buland rahe."
"321","Hazrat Sa'id ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, al-Hasan se: Ek shakhs ne akelay mushrikeen par hamla karne ka irada kiya, to Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tum samajhte ho ke tum akelay hi unhein qatl kar loge? Tehro yahan tak ke tumhare saathi hamla karein, phir un ke hamrah hamla karo."
"322","Hazrat Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awzai ne hum se bayan kiya; main ne Abu Uthman ko kehte hue suna: main ne al-Hasan ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne gunahon mein ghir jaye to use chahiye ke Roomiyon ke darron ko apni pusht ke peeche kar le. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke Abu Uthman, Jisr ibn al-Hasan al-Basri hain."
"323","Hazrat Ahmad ibn Abi Shuayb al-Harrani ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ayan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awzai se, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Jabir ibn Abdullah se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Musalmanon ki bastiyon ke peeche se chalees din tak sarhad ki hifazat kare, Allah Taala use, har us shakhs ke badle jise us ne apni pusht ke peeche chhora - millat walon, zimmi logon aur un ke hathon mein jo maweshi hain un mein se - ek qirat, ek qirat neki ata farmayega."
"324","Hazrat Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ne humein khabar di, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke Arbon se Islam ke liye qital kiya jaye aur us ke siwa un se kuch aur qubool na kiya jaye; aur hukm diya ke Ahl-e-Kitab se Islam ke liye qital kiya jaye, phir agar woh inkar karein to jizya liya jaye."
"325","Hazrat Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Yunus se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Musaylamah ke saathiyon ne Musalmanon mein se do aadmiyon ko pakar liya aur unhein Musaylamah ke paas laye. Us ne un mein se ek se kaha: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Allah ka Rasool hun? Us ne kaha: Main behra hun - teen martaba - to us ne us ke qatl ka hukm diya. Aur us ne dusre se kaha: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke Muhammad Allah ke Rasool hain? Us ne kaha: Haan. Us ne kaha: Kya tum gawahi dete ho ke main Allah ka Rasool hun? Us ne kaha: Haan, to us ne use chhor diya. Woh Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur Aap ko khabar di, to Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare saathi ne afzal tareeqa ikhtiyar kiya aur tum ne rukhsat par amal kiya. Aaj tum kis baat par ho? Us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Aap Allah ke Rasool hain aur woh jhoota hai."
"326","Hazrat Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Raja Abu al-Miqdam ne humein khabar di, al-Walid ibn Hisham se: Ke Hunayn ke din ek shakhs ne baghair hukm diye akelay mushrikeen par hamla kiya. To Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Bilal ko hukm diya, to unhon ne elaan kiya: Koi nafarman Jannat mein dakhil nahin hoga."
"327","Hazrat Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Sumay al-Hanafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik ibn Umayr al-Hanafi se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, main dushman se mila aur un mein apne baap se mila, aur main ne us se Aap ke baare mein buri baat suni, to main ne use nezay se maar kar qatl kar diya. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us se khamosh rahe. Phir dusra aaya aur kaha: Ya Nabi Allah, main apne baap se mila to use chhor diya, kyunke main ne chaha ke us se koi aur nimat le. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap us se khamosh rahe."
"328","Hazrat Said ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar se; mere ek saathi ne mujh se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf kabhi koi sar nahin laya gaya, Badr ke din bhi nahin. Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ki taraf ek sar laya gaya to unhon ne use napasand farmaya. Sab se pehle jin ki taraf sar laye gaye woh Abdullah ibn al-Zubayr the."
"329","Abu Salih Mahbub ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya - Abu Ishaq ne humein khabar di - Sufyan se, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Amr al-Shaybani se, unhon ne kaha: Riyah al-Suhaymi Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye aur kaha: Kya mere bachche aur mere maal par hamla kiya gaya hai? Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Raha maal to wo taqseem ho chuka hai, aur raha bachcha to jao aye falan! is ke sath, pas agar wo apne bachche ko pehchan le to unhein is ke supurd kar do. Pas wo is ke sath gaya aur us ne use us ko dikhaya. Unhon ne kaha: Pas us ne use pehchan liya. Unhon ne kaha: Haan, use is ke hawale kar do. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Riwayat kiya gaya hai ke unhon ne lootmar se pehle Islam qabool kar liya tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se riwayat hua hai lekin sahih nahi hai; Israil ne ise Abu Ishaq se, Hazrat al-Bara Raziallahu anhu se riwayat kiya hai, aur ye zyada sahih hai."
"330","Muhammad ibn Uthman Abu al-Jumahir al-Tanukhi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Busr al-Hubrani se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Adi al-Bahrani se, apne bhai Abd al-Ala se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se, ke Aap ne Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ko Bir Khumm ke din bheja aur ek shakhs ko dekha jis ke paas Farsi kaman thi. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye kaman wale! ise phenk de, kyunke is ka uthane wala maloon hai. Tum par lazim hain ye Arabi kamanein - aur Aap ne apni kaman se ishara kiya - in ko aur in jaisi doosri ko ikhtiyar karo, aur neze aur barchhe, Allah in ke zariye tumhare deen ko mazboot karega, aur in ke zariye Allah tumhein mulkon mein ghalba ata farmayega. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye hadith muttasil sanad se riwayat ki gayi hai lekin ye qawi nahi hai; aur ye Abdullah ibn Busr qawi nahi hai - Yahya ibn Said use zaeef qarar dete the."
"331","Said ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Madan ibn Hudayr al-Hadrami se, Abd al-Rahman ibn Jubayr ibn Nufayr se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein se jo log jihad karte hain aur ujrat lete hain - yani apne dushman ke muqable mein taqat hasil karte hain - un ki misaal Hazrat Musa Alaihis Salam ki walida ki si hai, jo apne bachche ko doodh pilati hain aur apni ujrat leti hain."
"332","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Wuhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne al-Taif mein ek maqtool aurat dekhi aur farmaya: Kya maine auraton ke qatl se mana nahi kiya tha? Is maqtool aurat ka zimmedar kaun hai? Qaum mein se ek shakhs ne kaha: Main hun, Ya Rasoolullah - maine use apne peeche sawar kiya tha aur us ne mujhe girane aur qatl karne ka irada kiya. Pas Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke use dafan kar diya jaye."
"333","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Wuhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Said ibn Mansur ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Ikrimah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ahl al-Taif ka muhasra kiya to ek aurat zahir hui aur us ne apni sharmgah khol di, aur kaha: Lo mujh par nishana lagao, teer chalao. Pas Musalmanon mein se ek shakhs ne us par teer chalaya aur us ka wo nishana khata na hua. Ye Said ke alfaz hain; aur Wuhayb ki hadith mein hai: Us ka nishana khata kiye baghair use qatl kar diya. Pas Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne hukm diya ke use dafan kar diya jaye."
"334","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Thawr se, Makhul se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ahl al-Taif ke khilaf manjaniqein nasb kein."
"335","Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne humein khabar di, al-Awzai se, Yahya se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un ka - yani ahl al-Taif ka - ek mah tak muhasra kiya. Maine kaha: Kya aap ko ye baat pahunchi hai ke Aap ne un par manjaniqon se teer barsaye? Unhon ne is ka inkar kiya, kaha: Ye baat maroof nahi hai."
"336","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bishr ne humein khabar di, Said ibn Jubayr se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Badr ke din Quraysh ke teen afrad ko bandhe hue qaidi ki haisiyat se qatl kiya: al-Mutim ibn Adi, al-Nadr ibn al-Harith aur Uqbah ibn Abi Muayt. Jab Aap ne al-Nadr ke qatl ka hukm diya to Hazrat Miqdad ibn al-Aswad Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Mera qaidi hai, Ya Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: Wo Allah ki Kitab aur Allah ke Rasool ke bare mein jo kehta tha wo kehta tha. Unhon ne ye do ya teen martaba kaha, pas Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aye Allah! Miqdad ko apne fazl se ghani kar de. Aur Miqdad ne al-Nadr ko qaid kiya tha. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Shubah ne kaha: al-Mutim ki jagah Tumah ibn Adi. Abu Dawud ne kaha: al-Mutim ghalat hai, balke ye Tuaymah ibn Adi hai. Aap Alaihis Salam ne farmaya: Agar al-Mutim ibn Adi zinda hota, phir wo in galeez logon ke bare mein mujh se sifarish karta to main unhein is ki khatir riha kar deta; aur Wahshi ko Hazrat Hamzah Raziallahu anhu ke qatl ke badle Tuaymah ke iwaz azad kiya gaya."
"337","Chhoti umar ke bachon ke badle fidya dene aur jo shakhs apna maal maal-e-ghanimat mein paye us ke bare mein bab: Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khums mein se bacha hua hissa jo aurton aur aulad par mushtamil tha Hazrat Sa'id ibn Zayd ke sath Najd ki taraf bheja taake woh Aap ki taraf se unhe ghodon aur hathiyaron ke badle farokht karen. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye Ghazwa-e-Qurayzah ke silsile mein zikr kiya gaya tha."
"338","Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas ne hum se bayan kiya, Simak se, Tamim ibn Tarafah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne apni oontni dusre shakhs ke qabze mein payi to dono apna muqaddama Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas laye. Us ne gawahi qaim ki ke ye us ki oontni hai aur dusre ne gawahi qaim ki ke us ne use dushman se khareeda tha. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar tum chaho to use us qeemat par le lo jis par us ne use khareeda tha aur agar chaho to chhod do."
"339","Us maal ke bare mein jis par aadmi Islam laye: Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, Yunus se, al-Zuhri se, ke al-Mughirah ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, is maal mein se khums le lijiye jo maine Banu Malik ke qafle se hasil kiya jinhe maine qatl kiya tha. Lekin Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhe ye ata karne se inkar kar diya is liye ke ye dhoke ka maal tha aur farmaya: Raha Islam to hum use tum se qubool karenge."
"340","Ja'far ibn Musafir ne hum se bayan kiya, Misr ke sahilon mein se Abdullah ya'ni Ibn Yahya al-Burlusi ne hum se bayan kiya; Haywah ibn Shurayh ne humein khabar di, Uqayl ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, ke al-Mughirah ibn Shu'bah apne kuch sathiyon ke sath Aylah mein utre aur sharab pi yahan tak ke nashe mein dhut ho kar so gaye jabke woh kafir the aur ye al-Mughirah ke Islam lane se pehle tha. Phir al-Mughirah un par toot pade aur un sab ko zibah kar diya phir jo kuch un ke paas tha woh sab le liya aur use lekar chale yahan tak ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye. Al-Mughirah Islam le aaye aur maal Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke hawale kar diya aur Aap ko khabar se agah kiya. To Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo maal zabardasti chheen kar liya gaya ho us mein se khums nahi nikala jata. To Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne maal al-Mughirah ke hath mein hi rehne diya."
"341","Tez raftari se safar karne ke bare mein bab: Ibn al-Musaffa ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Mughirah ne humein khabar di, Hariz ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn Ubayd se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab apne ghazwon aur sarayon se wapas lautte to zade-rah ki kami ki wajah se tez chalte the."
"342","Fatah ke waqt kya kaha jaye us ke bare mein bab: Hannad ibn al-Sari ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hilal ibn Salman se; maine al-Sha'bi ko kehte hue suna: Jab (Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa jaye) nazil hui to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko jab bhi fatah ata hoti to farmate: Subhanallah, Alhamdulillah, main Allah ki taraf ruju karta hun aur Us se bakhshish mangta hun."
"343","Aulad ko sahilon aur sarhadon par basane ke bare mein bab: Umar ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Al-Walid ibn Muslim ne humein padh kar sunaya, al-Wadin ibn Ata' se, Makhul aur al-Qasim Abu Abd al-Rahman se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aulad ko dushman ke samne na chhodo."
"344","Aulad par ehsan karne ke bare mein bab: Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Abi Ishaq se, Abu al-Safar se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Badr ke din farmaya: Jo shakhs Umm Hakim ibn Hizam ko qaid kare woh use chhod de. Ansar mein se ek shakhs ne use us ki choti se pakad kar qaid kiya tha phir jab us ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke munadi ko suna to use chhod diya."
"345","Darakht kaatne ke baare mein ek baab: Hamein Ahmad ibn Abdah al-Dabbi ne bayan kiya, hamein Wahb ya'ni Ibn Jarir ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne bayan kiya, Ibn Ishaq se, mujhe mere walid Ishaq ibn Yasar ne bayan kiya, al-Mughirah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Aur mujhe Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ne bayan kiya ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Banu al-Nadir ke paas tashreef laye - aur unhon ne poora qissa bayan kiya - unhon ne kaha: Pas Aap un ki taraf badhe aur unhon ne qilon mein panah li; Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khajoor ke darakht kaate aur jalaye. Jab unhon ne khajoor ke darakhton ko kat-te aur jalte dekha to unhon ne pukara: Ae Muhammad, aap fasaad se mana karte the, to khajoor ke darakhton ko kaatne aur jalane ka kya matlab hai? Aur Musalmanon mein se baaz ke dilon mein is se bechaini hui, to Allah ne nazil farmaya: (Tum ne khajoor ke jo darakht kaate ya unhein khada chhoda), ye aayat hai."
"346","Hamein Ahmad ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein Hajjaj ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, unhon ne kaha: Unhein Adhri'at aur Ariha ki taraf jila watan kiya gaya - ya'ni Banu al-Nadir ko. Allah Ta'ala farmata hai: (Aur nafarmanon ko ruswa karne ke liye)."
"347","Wasiyyaton ke baare mein: Hamein Ibn al-Sarh ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Ayyub se, Amr ibn al-Harith se, Abu al-Zubayr al-Makki se, ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Mu'ahid (ahd wale ghair Muslim) ko us ke do faislon mein se aakhri par pakda jayega, jab woh hoshmand ho."
"348","Hamein Abu Ma'mar Isma'il ibn Ibrahim ne bayan kiya, hamein Hajjaj ne bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata' al-Khurasani se, Hazrat Ibn Abbas Raziallahu anhu se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Waris ke liye koi wasiyyat nahi, magar ye ke waris chahein. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ata' al-Khurasani ne Ibn Abbas ko nahi paya aur na unhein dekha."
"349","Hamein Ibrahim ibn Marwan al-Dimashqi ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne bayan kiya, hamein Hiql ibn Ziyad ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Awza'i ne bayan kiya, Yunus se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Chalis gharon ke andar rehne wala hamsaya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Pas maine Ibn Shihab se kaha: Chalis ghar kaise? Unhon ne kaha: Us ke dayein, bayein, peeche aur saamne chalis ghar."
"350","Mudabbar (woh ghulam jise aaqa ki maut par aazad karne ka wada kiya gaya ho): Hamein Umar ibn Hisham al-Qibti ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, Hasan ya'ni Ibn Salih se, Sufyan al-Thawri se, Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mudabbar ko teesre hisse mein rakha."
"351","Hamein Hannad ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, ke Banu Udhrah ke ek shakhs ne apni beemari mein apna ghulam aazad kiya, us ke paas us ke siwa koi maal na tha; to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use do tihai mein mehnat karke ada karne ka hukm diya."
"352","Hamein Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Khalid ne khabar di, Abu Qilabah se, Banu Udhrah ke ek shakhs se, ke un mein se ek shakhs ne apni maut ke waqt apna ek ghulam aazad kiya; aur unhon ne is ka mafhoom bayan kiya."
"353","Miras ke faraiz ke bare mein: Abu Kamil ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Awanah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-A'mash se, Ibrahim al-Taymi se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dadi ko chhata hissa bator rizq ata farmaya."
"354","Abd al-Salam ibn Mutahhar ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne teen dadiyon ko chhata hissa ata farmaya. Main ne kaha: Woh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Tumhare walid ki taraf se tumhari do dadiyan, aur tumhari walida ki taraf se tumhari nani."
"355","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur se, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe bataya gaya ke Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ... phir unhon ne usi ki manind zikr kiya. (Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne pucha) woh kaun hain? Unhon ne kaha: Baap ki do dadiyan: us ke baap ki maan aur us ki maan ki maan, aur maan ki nani: us ki maan ki maan."
"356","Ubaydullah ibn Mu'adh ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Ash'ath se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek dadi ko chhata hissa ata farmaya, halanke us ka beta zinda tha."
"357","Ibn al-Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Salam ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Ubayd se, Muhammad ibn Sirin se, unhon ne kaha: Pehli dadi jinhen Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne rizq ke taur par hissa ata farmaya, baap ki maan thin, halanke un ka beta zinda tha."
"358","Muhammad ibn Sulayman al-Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Fadl ibn Dalham se, al-Hasan se, ke Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne teen dadiyon ko virasat ata farmayi."
"359","Isa ibn Yunus al-Tarsusi ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj, yani Ibn Muhammad, ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jan bujh kar ya ghalti se qatl karne wala diyat mein se kuch virasat nahi payega. al-Zuhri ne kaha: Woh us ke siwa dusre mal mein se virasat payega. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ma'mar, Salih ibn Kaysan aur Yunus ne al-Zuhri se isi ki manind riwayat kiya, Ibn al-Musayyib ke qaul ke taur par (mauquf)."
"360","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz, yani Ibn Muhammad, ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd, yani Ibn Aslam, se, Ata' se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) phuphi aur khala ki virasat ke bare mein rehnumayi (istikhara) hasil karne ke liye Quba' tashrif le gaye, to un par wahi nazil hui: Un ke liye koi virasat nahi. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Is ka matlab hai: Un ka koi muqarrar hissa nahi, lekin woh rishtedari ki bina par virasat payenge."
"361","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abi Hind ne humein khabar di, Abdullah ibn Ubayd se, Sham walon mein se ek shakhs se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Mula'ana ki gayi aurat ka bachcha, us ke asaba us ki maa ke asaba hain."""
"362","Ishaq ibn Ibrahim ibn Habib ibn al-Shahid ne hum se bayan kiya, Humayd yani Ibn Abdur Rahman ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hasan ibn Salih se, Abdul Aziz ibn Rufay se, Abu Burdah ibn Abi Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs faut hua aur us ne apni beti aur apne azaad karne wale aaqaon ko chhora, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne maal ko un dono ke darmiyan aadha aadha taqseem farmaya, us ki beti aur us ke azaad karne walon ke darmiyan."
"363","Muhammad ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hakam se, Abdullah ibn Shaddad se, ke unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho ke Hamzah ki beti ka mujh se kya rishta hai? Wo meri maa ki taraf se meri behan thin, aur unhon ne apne ek ghulam ko azaad kiya phir wo faut hua aur us ne apni beti aur apni azaad karne wali khatoon ko chhora, to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ki wirasat ko un dono ke darmiyan aadha aadha muqarrar farmaya. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Kayi afrad ne Abdullah ibn Shaddad se riwayat kiya ke Hamzah ki beti hi azaad karne wali thin."
"364","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Mughirah se, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Hamzah ibn Abdul Muttalib ka ek azaad karda ghulam faut hua, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hamzah ki beti ko aadha diya aur doosra aadha qabze mein le liya. Husayn ibn Ali ibn al-Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Sharik ne kaha: Ibrahim ne is qaul mein sakht be-ehtiyat jurrat se kaam liya hai, illa ye ke unhon ne koi cheez suni ho aur use riwayat kar diya ho, aur wo kam riwayat karte the."
"365","Husayn ibn Ali ibn al-Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya yani Ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdus Salam yani Ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr aur doosron se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Umarah bint Hamzah ka nikah Salamah ibn Abi Salamah se kiya halanke wo dono baloghat ko nahi pahunche the, phir wo dono faut hue aur ek doosre ke waris bane."
"366","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Wahhab al-Thaqafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib ibn al-Muallim se, Hasan se, ke mushrikeen mein se ek shakhs Hajj karte hue nikla, phir jab wo wapas palatte hue aaya to Musalmanon mein se ek shakhs use mila aur use qatl kar diya, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use hukm diya ke us ki deet us ke ghar walon ko ada kare."
"367","Qutaybah ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Ishaq ibn Isa Abu Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abdur Rahman al-Taifi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd Rabbihi ibn al-Hakam se, ke jab Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Ahl-e-Taif ka muhasra kiya to un ke ghulamon mein se kuch ghulam nikal kar Aap ke paas aaye aur Islam le aaye, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein azaad farmaya. Phir jab un ke aaqa baad mein Islam le aaye to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne wala (mawalaat ka haq) unhein wapas lauta diya."
"368","Muhammad ibn al-Wazir al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya yani Ibn Hassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Rahman ibn Muhammad ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Kisi qaum ki wirasat ko tukre tukre na kiya jaye jab wo taqseem ko bardasht na kar sakti ho."""
"369","Muhammad ibn Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, Yaqub ibn Kab ne hum se bayan kiya, Isa ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr se, Sulayman ibn Musa se, Nusayr se jo Muawiya ke azaad karda ghulam hain, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne nuqsan pahunchane wali taqseem se mana farmaya."
"370","Husayn ibn Ali ibn al-Aswad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya yani Ibn Adam ne hum se bayan kiya, Ammar ibn Zurayq ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Salama ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Ya Rasool Allah, Wo aap se fatwa poochte hain, keh dijiye: Allah tumhen kalala ke bare mein fatwa deta hai? Aap ne farmaya: Jo na aulad chore na walid, us ke waris kalala hain. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ammar ne bhi Abu Ishaq se, al-Bara se, kalala ke bare mein riwayat kiya: Tumhen garmi wali aayat kafi hai."
"371","Isa ibn Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Damra se, Sad ibn Abdullah ibn Sad se, Muhammad ibn Kab se, ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bhi rai apni raiyat mein zaati nafa kamaye, us ki raiyat halak ho jati hai."
"372","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad yani Ibn Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Mughira se: Main ne al-Shabi ko kehte hue suna, ke jab Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khawateen se baiat lene ke liye tashreef laye to ek Qatri chadar layi gayi, pas Aap ne use apne hath par rakh liya, phir farmaya: Main aurton se musafaha nahin karta."
"373","Umar ibn Hisham al-Qibti ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jafar al-Razi se, al-Rabi ibn Anas se, Abu al-Aliya se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas maal-e-ghanimat laya jata to Aap use paanch hisson mein taqseem farmate, phir pure khums mein se ek mutthi bhar lete, phir farmate: Ye Kaba ke liye hai. Phir farmate: Allah ke liye hissa muqarrar na karo, kyunke Allah hi ke liye aakhirat aur duniya hai. Phir Aap apne liye ek hissa lete, aur qaraabatdaron ke liye ek hissa, aur yateemon ke liye ek hissa, aur miskeenon ke liye ek hissa, aur musafir ke liye ek hissa."
"374","Khushaysh ibn Asram ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Yusuf ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhriz ne hum se bayan kiya: Main ne al-Hasan se anfal ke bare mein poocha, unhon ne kaha: Ghanimaten jama ki jati thin, pas jab jama ho jatin to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka un mein se ek hissa hota tha jise safi ka hissa kaha jata tha, jo Allah ne Aap ke liye muqarrar farmaya tha, phir unhon ne hadees bayan ki."
"375","Ahmad ibn Amr ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Ayyub ne mujhe khabar di, Ibn Tawus se, un ke walid se, ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se poocha gaya ke qurbani ke janwaron aur oonton mein se kaun se na-pasandida hain? Aap ne farmaya: Kani, laghar kamzor, aur jis ke than tamam ke tamam khushk ho gaye hon."
"376","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Aban ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya se, ke Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ne un se bayan kiya, Abu Salama ibn Abd al-Rahman aur Sulayman ibn Yasar se, ke un dono ko ye baat pahunchi ke Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Qurbani ka gosht Muharram ke chand tak hai, us ke liye jo is mein takheer karna chahe."
"377","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr ibn Yazid se, al-Salt se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Musalman ka zabiha halal hai, khwah us ne Allah ka naam liya ho ya na liya ho; agar us ne naam liya to us ne Allah ke naam ke siwa kisi ka naam nahi liya."""
"378","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us aqiqah ke bare mein farmaya jo Hazrat Fatimah ne Hazrat Hasan aur Hazrat Husayn ke liye kiya tha: ""Us mein se ek raan daya ko bhejo, aur khao aur khilao, aur us ki koi haddi na todo."""
"379","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Jafar ibn Muhammad se, apne walid se, ke unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Fatimah bint Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Hasan, Hazrat Husayn, Hazrat Zaynab aur Hazrat Umm Kulthum ke baalon ka wazan kiya, aur us ke wazan ke barabar chandi sadqa ki."
"380","Muhammad ibn Abd al-Malik ibn Marwan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ata se, unhon ne kaha: Aqiqah mein se bhuna hua gosht banane mein koi harj nahi."
"381","al-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya — aur ye Zuhayr ki hadith hai — Ata ibn al-Saib ne hum se bayan kiya, Amir se, ke ek dehati ne Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ek hiran tohfe mein diya. Aap ne farmaya: ""Tumhein ye kahan se mila?"" Us ne kaha: Maine ise kal teer mara aur us ka peecha kiya, lekin wo mujh se nikal gaya yahan tak ke shaam ne mujhe aa liya, to main wapas laut aaya. Subah ko main us ke nishan par chala aur use ek ghaar mein, ya patharon mein paya, aur us mein mere teer ka phal laga tha jise main pehchanta hun. Aap ne farmaya: ""Us ne tum se door ek raat guzari, aur mujhe andesha hai ke kisi zahrile janwar ne us ke khilaf tumhari madad na ki ho. Mujhe is ki koi hajat nahi."""
"382","Nasr ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Abi Aishah se, Abu Razin se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas shikar lekar aaya aur kaha: Maine use raat mein teer mara aur wo mujh se nikal gaya, phir subah ko maine apna teer us mein paya, aur maine apne teer ko pehchan liya. Aap ne farmaya: ""Raat Allah ki makhluq mein se ek azeem makhluq hai; shayad kisi cheez ne us ke khilaf tumhari madad ki aur use tum se door rakha."""
"383","Mujhe Ibn al-Mubarak se riwayat kiya gaya, Ibrahim ibn Tahman se, Abbad ibn Ishaq se, apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ababeelon ko, jo gharon mein panah leti hain, (qatl karne se) mana farmaya."
"384","Ibrahim ibn Marwan al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Layth ibn Sad ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Abi Habib ne mujhe bayan kiya, Irak ibn Malik se, ke wo kaha karte the: Mitran (zabah ka aala) se zabah kiya ja sakta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se us ke bare mein pucha gaya to Aap ne farmaya: ""Wo halal hai."""
"385","Yahya ibn Khalaf ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdul Aala ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Saeed ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Qatada se, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tak marfu'an riwayat kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Kitabullah ki kisi surat ki qasam khaye to us par us ki har ayat ke badle ek yameen-e-sabr lazim hogi, agar chahe to use pura kare aur agar chahe to use tor de."
"386","Ibrahim ibn Musa al-Razi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Isa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Awf se, unhon ne Hasan se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne isi mafhum ke sath farmaya."
"387","Harun ibn Abbad al-Azdi ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hajjaj ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Lais ibn Saad se, unhon ne Muawiya ibn Saleh se, unhon ne Abu al-Zahiriyya aur Rashid ibn Saad se riwayat kiya: Ek khatun ne Hazrat Ayesha Raziallahu anha ko khajuren tohfe me din to unhon ne kuch kha lin aur kuch khajuren baqi rah gain, to us khatun ne kaha: Main aap ko qasam de kar kehti hun ke aap sab kha len, to Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Gunah us par hai jo dusre se qasam tudwata hai."
"388","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Abdur Razzaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Mamar ne hamen khabar di, unhon ne Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne wisal tak koi qazi muqarrar nahi farmaya aur na Hazrat Abu Bakr Raziallahu anhu ne aur na Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne, magar ye ke unhon ne apni khilafat ke aakhir me ek shakhs se kaha: Mujhe logon ke baaz muamlat se kafayat karo."
"389","Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Yaqub ibn Ibrahim ibn Saad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, mere walid ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se isi mafhum ke sath, unhon ne kaha: Yahan tak ke un ki zindagi ke aakhir ke qareeb yani Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ke zamane me to unhon ne Namir ki behan ke bete Yazid se kaha: Mujhe logon ke baaz muamlat se kafayat karo, yani chhote muamlat se."
"390","Muslim ibn Ibrahim ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Jafar ibn Hayyan ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs qaziyon me se kisi qazi ki taraf bulaya jaye aur woh hazir na ho to woh zalim hai."
"391","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Yahya ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Muhammad ibn al-Mughira al-Makhzumi al-Madani ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Sulaiman ibn Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Urwa ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Abdullah ibn Abdul Aziz al-Umari se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Ali ibn Abi Talib Raziallahu anhu ko Yemen par amil muqarrar farmaya to Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Aap ne mujhe bulaya aur mujhe wasiyyat farmai, un se kehte hue: Kam rutbe wale ko sharif se pehle rakho, kamzor ko taqatwar se pehle rakho aur mardon ko aurton se pehle rakho."
"392","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se hadees bayan ki, Hammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, unhon ne Shaabi se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi muamle me faisla farmate phir us ke baad us ke khilaf Quran nazil hota to Aap pehli martaba jo faisla farma chuke hote use nafiz farmate aur aainda Quran ke laye hue hukm ke mutabiq faisla farmate."
"393","Hamein Hilal ibn Bishr ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ibn Muhammad ibn Qays ne bayan kiya: Maine Zayd ibn Aslam ko suna ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jo shakhs kisi cheez par das saal tak qabiz rahe to woh usi ki hai."""
"394","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Muthanna ne bayan kiya, hamein Affan ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne Qatadah aur Humayd se, unhon ne al-Hasan se bayan kiya ke Quraish ke ek aadmi ne ek oontni chori ki to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ka haath kaat diya, phir bhi us ki gawahi qabil-e-qabool rahi."
"395","Hamein Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdul Aziz — yani Ibn Muhammad — ne bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Zayd — yani Ibn al-Muhajir — se, unhon ne Talhah ibn Abdullah — yani Ibn Awf — se, unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya, Aap ne farmaya: ""Dushman aur badguman ki gawahi nahin hai."" Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-zanin se murad muttaham hai, al-jinnah woh hai jis mein junoon ho, aur al-hinnah se murad keena rakhne wala hai."
"396","Hamein al-Qasim ibn Isa ne bayan kiya, hamein Hajjaj ne bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Dhib se, unhon ne al-Hakam ibn Muslim se, unhon ne Abdul Rahman al-Araj se, unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se riwayat kiya ke Aap ne farmaya: ""Badguman aur keena rakhne wale aur majnoon ki gawahi jaiz nahin hai."" Ibn Abi Dhib ne kaha: Badgumani aur keena wala."
"397","Hamein Qutaybah ibn Said ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Layth ne Bukayr se bayan kiya: Unhon ne Ibn al-Musayyib ko kehte hue suna: Do aadmi kisi cheez ke bare mein Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas jhagda lekar aaye, aur un mein se har ek barabar tadad mein aadil gawah laya, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un ke darmiyan qura andazi farmayi aur farmaya: ""Ae Allah, Tu hi un ke darmiyan faisla farma."""
"398","Hamein Abu Tawbah ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Ishaq — yani al-Fazari — ne khabar di, Abu Ishaq — yani al-Shaybani — se, unhon ne al-Qasim — yani Ibn Abd al-Rahman — se riwayat kiya: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Logon ko un ki qasmon mein us cheez par majboor na karo jise woh nahin jante."""
"399","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Usamah aur Yazid ne al-Saq ibn Hazn se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab aadmi se us ke bhai ke bare mein poocha jaye to use ikhtiyar hai, agar chahe to khamosh rahe aur agar chahe to bole aur sach bole."" Un mein se ek ne kaha: Aadmi ke bare mein."
"400","Hamein Sulayman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Uyaynah ne Ibn Abi Najih se bayan kiya, unhon ne Mujahid se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas se guzra to Aap ne farmaya: ""Ise kaun pehchanta hai?"" Ek aadmi ne kaha: Main ise chehre se pehchanta hun aur ise naam se nahin janta. Unhon ne farmaya: ""Yeh (haqiqi) pehchan nahin hai."""
"401","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan al-Thawri ne hum se bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn Umayyah se, al-Zuhri se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Qadeemi kunwen ka hareem pachaas haath hai, aur naye khode gaye kunwen ka hareem pachees haath hai. Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ne apni taraf se kaha: Aur kheti ke qaleeb ka hareem teen sau haath hai."
"402","Amr ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zubaydi ne hum se bayan kiya: hum se al-Zuhri ne bayan kiya: Sunnat aur qaza Sufyan ki mukammal hadith ke mafhoom ke mutabiq hai, har ek ke liye har simt se yeh kehte hue: yeh hareem hai, kunwen ki jagah qaleeb ka lafz barhate hue, aur yeh izafa karte hue: Chashme ka hareem har simt se paanch sau haath hai. Yeh un khudaiyon ka hareem hai jin ki ijazat Sultan de, siwae is ke ke kisi qaum ke paas aisi zameen ho jis par unhon ne Islam qabool kiya ya jise unhon ne khareeda."
"403","Abbad ibn Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Talhah yani Ibn Yahya al-Ansari ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus ibn Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Imran se, Urwah ibn al-Zubayr se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khajoor ke darakht ke hareem ka faisla us ki lambai ke barabar farmaya."
"404","Muhammad ibn Abd al-Jabbar al-Hamadhani ne hum se bayan kiya, Musa ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Sallam ibn Miskin ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Kuch logon ne patharon se jang ki aur un ke darmiyan ek maqtool paya gaya, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne unhein qaid karne ka hukm diya, phir unhon ne hadith bayan ki."
"405","Ahmad ibn Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Abu Harun al-Madani se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abbas Raziallahu anhu ke ghar mein ek parnala tha jo masjid mein girta tha, phir Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu aaye aur use ukhaar diya. Hazrat Abbas Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use khud apne haath se lagaya tha. Hazrat Umar Raziallahu anhu ne kaha: Tumhare liye meri peeth ke siwa koi seedhi nahi hogi yahan tak ke tum use us ki jagah wapas lagao. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yeh Isa kirana farosh ka bhai hai, Abu Harun, jabke Isa darzi hai, kirana farosh aur kapde kootne wala, aur woh Isa ibn Maysarah hai, aur us ka bhai la-bas hai."
"406","Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman yani Ibn Maghra ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban se, apne chacha Wasi ibn Habban se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Abu Lubabah Raziallahu anhu ka ek khajoor ka khosha ek shakhs ke bagh mein tha, to unhon ne us se baat ki ke tum apne khoshe tak pahunchne ke liye mere bagh mein chalte ho, main tumhein tumhare bagh mein us jaisa deta hun, pas use mujh se nikal lo. Us ne inkar kiya, to unhon ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se is ke bare mein baat ki. Aap ne farmaya: Ai Abu Lubabah, apne khoshe jaisa le lo aur use apne maal se mila lo aur apne saathi se woh rok lo jo woh napasand karta hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main aisa karne wala nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Phir jao aur us ke liye us ke khoshe jaisa us ke bagh mein kaat do, phir us ke upar deewar bana do, kyunke Islam mein na nuqsan hai na badle ka nuqsan. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Al-adhq fatha ke saath khajoor ka darakht hai, aur al-idhq kasra ke saath khosha hai."
"407","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah Ibn al-Mubarak se, aur maine use Sa'id ibn Yaqub par Ibn Mubarak se parha, Mamar se, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khudai mein ek dusre ko nuqsan na pahunchayo. Sa'id ne izafa kiya: Aur woh yeh hai ke aadmi dusre aadmi ke pehlu mein is liye khode ke us ka pani le jaye."
"408","Malik ibn Abd al-Wahid al-Mismai ne hum se bayan kiya, Rawh aur Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Jarir ibn Hazim ne hum se bayan kiya: Maine Amr ibn Shuayb se suna: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne aurat ko ijazat di ke woh apne shohar par iddat khatm hone tak sog manaye, aur apne walid par saat din, aur un ke siwa har ek par teen din."
"409","Mahmud ibn Khalid aur Amr ibn Usman ne hum se riwayat kiya, dono ne kaha: al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jabir se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Apne maut ke qareeb logon ke paas hazir raha karo aur un se pucha karo kyunke woh dekhte hain, aur unhen La ilaha illa Allah ki talqeen karo."""
"410","Abd al-Hamid ibn Bakkar al-Bayruti ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Muslim ne hum se bayan kiya, mujhe Ismail ne khabar di, Abu Salama Sulayman ibn Sulaym se, Yahya ibn Jabir se, ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasool Allah, musibat ke sawab ko kaun si cheez zaya kar deti hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Ye ke aadmi apna dayan hath apne bayan hath par mare."" Aur Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apna dayan hath apne bayan hath par maar kar dikhaya."
"411","Qutaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya yani Ibn Sulaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Imran al-Qasir se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka chiragh bujh gaya to Aap ne Inna lillahi wa inna ilayhi rajiun parha, Hazrat Ayesha Raziallahu anha ne kaha: Ye to sirf ek chiragh hai, Aap ne farmaya: ""Har woh cheez jo momin ko nagawar guzre woh musibat hai."""
"412","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Salama al-Makhzumi se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Jafar aur Hazrat Zayd Raziallahu anhuma ki shahadat ki khabar aayi to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Zayd ke ghar tashreef laye, jab Aap darwaze par the to Zayd ki ek beti Aap ke samne rote cheekhte hue aayi to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) roye yahan tak ke hichkiyan lene lage, kaha gaya: Ya Rasool Allah ye kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: ""Mehboob ki mehboob ke liye tadap hai."""
"413","Harun ibn Abbad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Bakr yani Ibn Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Abi Sahl se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Jab koi aurat mardon ke darmiyan faut ho aur un ke sath us ke siwa koi aurat na ho, aur koi mard aurton ke darmiyan faut ho aur un ke sath us ke siwa koi mard na ho, to dono ko tayammum karaya jayega aur dafan kiya jayega, aur woh us shakhs ke hukm me hain jise pani na mile."""
"414","Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Zuhri se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) me woh cheez talash ki jo mayyit me talash ki jati hai to use na paya, to unhon ne kaha: Mere maa baap Aap par qurban hon, Aap zindagi me bhi pakeeza rahe aur maut me bhi."
"415","Ziyad ibn Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya, Hushaym ne hum se bayan kiya, Mansur ne hamen khabar di, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke lahd me ek surkh dharidar chadar rakhi gayi jo Aap ne Khaybar ke din hasil ki thi, kyunke Madina ki zameen shor zadah hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye musnad hai siwae alfaz ke kuch hisson ke jin me gharabat paida ho gayi, is liye ye mursal ho gayi."
"416","Muhammad ibn Sulayman al-Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Murrah al-Qurashi se, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko qibla ki taraf se qabr me utara gaya aur Aap ko kheench kar seedha nahi utara gaya."
"417","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Hasan ibn al-Rabi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq yani al-Fazari ne hum se bayan kiya, Ata ibn al-Saib se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne janaze par ek salam phera."
"418","Abbad ibn Musa aur Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Ataki ne hum se hum-mana ke sath bayan kiya ke Khalaf ibn Khalifa ne unhen bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: un tak ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Nuaym ibn Masud ko qabr mein utara aur apne munh se takiye hataye."
"419","Ahmad ibn Mani ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sad se, Ziyad yani Ibn Thalab se, Abu al-Munzir se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek qabr mein mitti ki teen lapen dalin."
"420","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya ke Abu Bakr ibn Ayyash ne un se bayan kiya: Salih ibn Abi al-Akhdar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: maine Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki qabr ko ek balisht ya taqreeban ek balisht buland dekha."
"421","Abd al-Wahhab ibn Najda ne hum se bayan kiya, Isa ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Murra se, Hammad se, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki qabr khodi hui mitti ke dher (nabath) ke sath banayi gayi aur use barabar hamwar nahi kiya gaya."
"422","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Husayn se, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: maine shuhada ki qabron ko kohan numa ubhri hui yani teelon ki surat mein dekha."
"423","Abdullah ibn Maslama ibn Qanab aur Abdullah ibn Umar ibn Muhammad ibn Aban ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya ke Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne un se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Muhammad yani Ibn Umar se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne sahabzade Ibrahim ki qabr par pani chhidka. Ibn Umar ne apni hadith mein izafa kiya: ye pehli qabr thi jis par chhidkao kiya gaya, aur unhon ne kaha jab unhen dafan kiya gaya aur un ke sirhane se farigh hue: Salam alaikum. Main sirf itna janta hun ke unhon ne kaha: unhon ne apne hath se us par mitti dali. Al-Qanabi ne nahi kaha: yani Ibn Umar."
"424","Amr ibn Usman ne hum se bayan kiya, Baqiyya ne hum se bayan kiya, (ha) aur Muhammad ibn Awf ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Mughira ne hum se bayan kiya, Safwan se, Abu al-Yaman al-Hawzani se, unhon ne kaha: jab Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke chacha Abu Talib ka inteqal hua to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) bahar tashreef laye aur un ke janaze ke samne aaye. Ibn Awf ne kaha: wo us ke pehlu se hat kar chalne lage aur farmane lage: rishtedari ne tum se bhala sulook kiya aur tumhen bhalai ka badla diya jaye. Aur wo un ki qabr par khade nahi hue. Ibn Awf ne izafa kiya: unhon ne un ke liye maghfirat ki dua nahi ki. Aur Amr ne Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka zikr nahi kiya."
"425","Hamein Ahmad ibn Hanbal ne bayan kiya, hamein Hajjaj ne bayan kiya, Ibn Juraij se: mujhe Muhammad ibn Ali ne khabar di ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sahabzade Hazrat Ibrahim ka janaza ghode ke palan ke dhanche par uthaya gaya tha."
"426","Hamein Ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, hamein Sulaiman ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, Husain se, Abu Malik se, unhone kaha: Uhud ke din Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas Hazrat Hamzah ibn Abdul Muttalib ko laya gaya, unhein rakha gaya, phir nau afrad ko laya gaya to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un par namaz parhi, phir unhein utha liya gaya aur Hazrat Hamzah ko chhor diya gaya, phir mazeed nau afrad ko la kar rakha gaya to aap ne un par saat namazein parhin, yahan tak ke aap ne sattar admiyon par namaz parhi, har namaz mein Hazrat Hamzah un mein shamil the jo aap ne parhi."
"427","Hamein Hannad ne bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas se, Ata se, al-Shabi se, unhone kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Uhud ke din Hazrat Hamzah par sattar namazein parhin, ibteda Hazrat Hamzah se ki: aap ne un par namaz parhi, phir shuhada ko bulate rahe aur un par namaz parhte rahe jabke Hazrat Hamzah apni jagah par rahe."
"428","Hamein Ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhone kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan do admiyon ko rajm kiya; aap ne un mein se ek par namaz parhi aur dusre par namaz na parhi. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se digar alfaz mein bhi riwayat ki gayi hai."
"429","Hamein al-Nufaili ne bayan kiya, hamein Miskin ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Masudi ne bayan kiya, Awn ibn Abdullah se, unhone kaha: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi janaze mein hote to aap par gham chha jata; aap dil mein bahut ghaur o fikr karte aur bahut kam guftagu farmate."
"430","Hamein Hannad ibn al-Sari aur Uthman ibn Abi Shaibah ne bayan kiya, hamein Muhammad ibn Ubaid ne bayan kiya, Wail ibn Dawud se: maine al-Bahiyy ko kehte suna: Jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sahabzade Hazrat Ibrahim ka inteqal hua — un ka inteqal chhe mah ki umar mein hua — to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne maqaeed par un par namaz-e-janaza parhi. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Hannad ne riwayat kiya: Aur beshak wo siddiq hai, aur beshak Jannat mein us ke liye doodh pilane wali hai."
"431","Maine Said ibn Yaqub al-Talaqani ko parh kar sunaya: tumhein Ibn al-Mubarak ne bayan kiya, Yaqub ibn al-Qaqa se, Ata se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne sahabzade Hazrat Ibrahim par namaz parhi jab wo sattar raaton ke the."
"432","Hamein Ibn Kathir ne bayan kiya, hamein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, al-Zubair ibn Adi se, Ata ibn Abi Rabah se, unhone kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Uhud ke shuhada par namaz parhi."
"433","Ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Said se, Said ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan do aadmiyon ko sangsar kiya, pas Aap ne un mein se ek par namaz parhi aur dusre par namaz nahi parhi. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye dusre alfaz ke sath muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat ki gayi hai."
"434","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulayman yani Ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Husayn se, Abu Malik se: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas Hazrat Hamzah ko laya gaya aur nau afrad ko laya gaya, to Aap ne un par namaz parhi, mukammal hadith jaisa ke pehle guzar chuki hai."
"435","Hannad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu al-Ahwas se, Ata se, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Hamzah par namaz parhi, hadith jaisa ke thori der pehle guzar chuki hai."
"436","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatadah se, ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab laundi ko haiz aaye to durust nahi ke us ka chehra aur kalai ke jor tak us ke dono hathon ke siwa kuch nazar aaye."
"437","Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Asim se, Ibn Jurayj se, Ziyad se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya ke dono jootiyon mein se koi cheez qadmon par chadhi hui ho."
"438","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Wuhayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid al-Hadhda se, Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne kaha: Main Madinah aaya to mere pas do jootiyan lai gayin jin ke bare mein unhon ne dawa kiya ke ye Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki nalain hain, jin mein do tasmay thay, un ke tasmayon ke sire un ki girahon mein mure hue thay, pas maine is ka zikr Muhammad se kiya to unhon ne usi waqt apni jooti mangwai aur unhein badal diya."
"439","Uqbah ibn Mukram ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Jafar ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid se, Abdullah ibn al-Harith se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki nalain dekhin jin mein do agle tasmay thay."
"440","Al-Harith ibn Miskin ko mere samne parh kar sunaya gaya jabke main maujud tha, Ibn al-Qasim ne aap ko khabar di, Malik se, aur un se Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki nal ke bare mein pucha gaya ke kya unhon ne use dekha tha, ke us ki sakht kaisi thi, unhon ne kaha: Wo kuch golai ki taraf mail thi, us ka darmiyani hissa pichli taraf se patla tha, wo darmiyan se patli aur piche se edi wali thi, pas maine kaha: Kya us mein do tasmay thay, unhon ne kaha: Mere khayal mein wahi hai jo apni walida Umm Kulthum ki taraf se Rabiah al-Makhzumi ke gharane ke pas hai."
"441","Ibn Muaz ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya: Ibn Aun ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Madina me ek mochi ke paas aaya aur main ne use hukm diya ke meri jutiyon me do agle tasmay lagaye, to us ne mujh se kaha: Kya main unhen waisa na banaun jaisa main ne Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki juti dekhi hai? Main ne kaha: Tum ne use kis ke paas dekha hai? Us ne kaha: Fatima bint Ubaidullah ibn Abbas ke paas. Main ne kaha: Phir unhen isi tarah bana do, to us ne dono ko dahini tarz par bana diya."
"442","Nasr ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ibn Yazid al-Haddadi Abu Hashim ne mujh se bayan kiya: Abu Abdud Daim ne mujh se bayan kiya, Abu Malih se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki juti toot gayi ya un ki juti ka tasma toot gaya, to Aap ek juti me chalte rahe yahan tak ke dusri ko durust kar liya."
"443","Nasr ibn Ali ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed yani Ibn Abi Ayyub ne hum se bayan kiya: Khalid ibn Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe ye baat pahunchi hai ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas ek aaina aur surme ka bartan tha."
"444","Muhammad ibn Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne humen khabar di, al-Amash se, Ibrahim se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khushbu ki mehak se pehchane jate the."
"445","Abdullah ibn Maslama ne hum se bayan kiya ke al-Hakam ibn al-Salt ne un se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Muti se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab kisi shakhs ke samne koi izzat pesh ki jaye to use chahiye ke us me se thoda ya zyada zaroor le."
"446","Nusair ibn al-Faraj ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Saeed ne hum se bayan kiya, Uqail se, Ibn Shihab se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs ke samne khushbu ya mithas pesh ki jaye to use wapas na kare, kyunke wo khushgawar khushbu wali aur uthane me halki hoti hai."
"447","Amr ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Marwan yani Ibn Muawiya ne hum se bayan kiya, Uthman ibn al-Aswad se: Unhon ne Mujahid ko ye kehte hue suna: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ek lambi dadhi wale aadmi ko dekha to farmaya: Tum me se koi apne aap ko kyun bigadta hai? Aur Aap ne ek bikhre sar wale yani uljhe balon wale aadmi ko dekha to farmaya: Bas, apne balon se achha sulook karo ya unhen mundwa do."
"448","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne humen khabar di, al-Auzai se, Harun ibn Riab se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne pachhne lagwaye phir ek aadmi se kaha: Ise dafan kar do taake koi kutta ise na nikale."
"449","Ibn Nufayl ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhayr ne hum se bayan kiya, mere khandan ki ek khatun ne mujh se bayan kiya, Mulaykah bint Amr se, ke un ke halaq ke dard ke liye unhen gaaye ka ghee tajweez kiya gaya tha, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Us ka doodh shifa hai, us ka ghee dawa hai aur us ka gosht beemari hai."
"450","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdur Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar ne humen khabar di, Zuhri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Budh aur Hafta ke din pachhne lagwaye phir use wazah ho jaye to wo apne siwa kisi ko malamat na kare. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye sanad ke sath riwayat hua hai lekin ye sahih nahin hai."
"451","Abu Mamar aur Ahmad ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hafs ibn Ghiyas ne hum se bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn Artah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs pachhne lagwana chahe to Hafta ke din pachhne lagwaye. Ahmad al-Duri ne kaha: Aur Hafs ne kaha: Maine ye Sufyan al-Thawri ko bayan kiya to unhon ne usi jagah hajjam ko bulaya aur pachhne lagwaye."
"452","Ali ibn al-Jad ne hum se bayan kiya, Shubah ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Raja se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hasan se nushrah ke bare me pucha to unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se naql karke bataya gaya ke Aap ne farmaya: Ye shaitan ke amal me se hai."
"453","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Yahya Abu Muhammad aur Ahmad ibn Amr ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya ek hi mafhum me, dono ne kaha: Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Amr se, Yahya ibn Jadah se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas kandhe ki haddi par ek tehreer layi gayi to Aap ne farmaya: Kisi qaum ki gumrahi ke liye yehi kafi hai ke wo apni Kitab ke siwa koi aur kitab talash karen, apne Nabi ke siwa kisi aur nabi ki taraf. Phir Allah Azza wa Jalla ne nazil farmaya: Kya un ke liye ye kafi nahin ke Hum ne Aap par Kitab nazil ki jo unhen parh kar sunayi jati hai."
"454","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ayyub se, Abu Qilabah se, ke Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) kuch Yahudiyon ke pas se guzre aur unhen Taurat ki ek dua ka zikr karte hue suna to unhon ne use naql kar liya, phir use Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke pas laye aur use parhne lage, jabke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka chehra mutaghayyar hone laga. Ek shakhs ne kaha: Aye Ibn al-Khattab, kya tum nahin dekhte ke Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke chehre par kya hai. To Hazrat Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kitab rakh di, aur Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Azza wa Jalla ne mujhe Khatam bana kar bheja hai aur mujhe jawami al-kalim aur us ki mohren ata ki gayi hain, aur mere liye kalam mukhtasar kar diya gaya hai, pas mutahayyir log tumhen mashghul na karen. Maine Abu Qilabah se pucha: Mutahawwikun se kya murad hai. Unhon ne kaha: Hairaan o pareshan log."
"455","Ubaydullah ibn Muaz ne hum se bayan kiya, Mutamir ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abu al-Ala se, ke Hazrat Allah ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki hadith ek dusre ko mansukh karti thi jaise Quran ek dusre ko mansukh karta hai."
"456","Abdullah ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Khalid se, Ibn Ajlan se, Tawus se, Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Musibat ke nazil hone se pehle us me jaldi na karo, kyunke agar tum aisa nahin karoge to Musalmanon me aise log maujud rahenge ke jab wo baat karega to use durust baat ki tawfiq di jayegi ya use kamyabi di jayegi, lekin agar tum jaldi karoge to tumhare sath raste yahan aur yahan aur yahan phoot niklenge."
"457","Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, Usamah ibn Zayd yani al-Laythi ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Abi Kathir se, Abu Salamah ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya, aur unhon ne isi ma'na ki milti julti baat zikr ki."
"458","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Thawr ne hum se bayan kiya, Ma'mar se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne al-Zuhri se kaha: Yahan andhe, langde aur bimar ka zikr kyun hai? Mere chacha Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ne unhen bayan kiya ke Musalman jab jihad ke liye nikalte to apne mazuron ko peeche chhor jate, aur unhen apne darwazon ki chabiyan de dete, kehte hue: Hum ne tumhen ijazat de di hai ke hamare gharon mein jo kuch hai us mein se khao. Lekin wo is se parhez karte, kehte hue: Hum un mein dakhil nahin honge jabke wo ghair hazir hain. To ye ayat un ke liye rukhsat ke taur par nazil hui."
"459","Hajjaj ibn Abi Ya'qub ne hum se bayan kiya, Ya'qub yani Ibn Ibrahim ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Salih se, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utbah aur Ibn al-Musayyib se, ke ahl-e-ilm mein se kuch hazraat bayan karte the ke ye ayat: Andhe par koi harj nahin, sirf is liye nazil hui ke Musalman Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke sath Allah ki rah mein nikalne ki khwahish rakhte the, to wo apni chabiyan apne mazur zer-e-kafalah afrad ko de dete, un se kehte hue: Hum ne tumhen ijazat de di hai. Phir unhon ne isi tarah ki aur us se zyada mukammal baat zikr ki."
"460","Zayd ibn Akhzam ne hum se bayan kiya, Bishr ibn Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Sa'd ne humen khabar di, Salih ibn Kaysan se, al-Zuhri se, Hazrat Aishah Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Musalman khwahish rakhte the, aur unhon ne isi tarah ki baat zikr ki. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur sahih Ya'qub aur Ma'mar ki hadith hai."
"461","Ibn al-Musaffa ne hum se bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Thawban ne hum se bayan kiya, apne walid se: Main ne Makhul se pucha: Logon mein sab se zyada haqdar kaun hai ke khane par un ki imamat kare? Makhul ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Imam, ya khane ka malik, ya un mein se behtareen. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ai Abu Ubaydah Raziallahu anhu apna hath aage badhao."
"462","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Amr se. Thabit ibn Thawban ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya, isi mafhoom ke sath, aur unhon ne kaha: Aur log samajhte the ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us din rozedar the."
"463","Ishaq ibn Suwayd al-Ramli ne hum se bayan kiya, Sawwar ibn Umarah ne hum se bayan kiya, Masarrah yani Ibn Ma'bad ne mujh se bayan kiya. Unhon ne kaha: al-Zuhri aur Sulayman ibn Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kachcha gosht na khao hatta ke us ke liye teen din guzar jayen, ya use aag lage."
"464","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awza'i se, Wasil ibn Abi Jamil se, Mujahid se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne bakri mein se saat cheezon ko napasand farmaya: masana, pitta, ghudud, zakar, sharmgah aur khusyain."
"465","Ibrahim ibn Marwan ibn Muhammad al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Shu'ayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar ibn Muhammad ya'ni al-Umari ne mujh se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kulhe ka gosht nahi khate the aur farmate the: Us ka bahiri hissa irq-un-nasa hai aur us ka andruni hissa falij hai."
"466","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Yahya ibn Abi Kathir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ansar me se ek shakhs se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dil ke dono kaanon ko khane se mana farmaya."
"467","Muhammad ibn al-Sabbah ibn Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awza'i se ke unhon ne al-Zuhri se suna, woh is baat ka inkar kar rahe the ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apni mumaniat ke baad ghare ki nabeedh ki ijazat di thi, aur jo shakhs is ka da'wa karta hai us ko bura-bhala kehte the."
"468","Abu Kamil al-Fudayl ibn al-Husayn al-Jahdari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Wahid ne hum se bayan kiya, Salih ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya. Abu Ma'shar ne hum se bayan kiya ke ek shakhs ne Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko noora lagaya, phir jab woh sharmgah tak pahuncha to woh shakhs ruk gaya, to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne khud apne aap ko noora lagaya."
"469","Abdullah ibn Muhammad ibn Ishaq al-Adhrami ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Wahhab ya'ni Ibn Ata ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id se, unhon ne Qatadah se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne kabhi noora istemal nahi kiya, na Hazrat Abu Bakr ne, na Hazrat Umar ne aur na Hazrat Usman ne."
"470","Qutaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya, Uqayl se, unhon ne al-Zuhri se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum me se koi shakhs ghusl na kare magar is tarah ke us ke qareeb ek shakhs ho jo nazar na kare, woh us ke nazdeek ho aur us se baat kar raha ho."
"471","Isi sanad ke sath, al-Zuhri se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Khule sehra me ghusl na karo magar jab tum koi pardah dekho, aur agar tumhe koi pardah na mile to tum me se ek shakhs kamre ki tarah ek lakeer kheench le, phir Allah ka naam le aur us ke andar ghusl kare."
"472","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Abd al-Rahman ya'ni Ibn Salman ne mujhe khabar di, Amr jo al-Muttalib ke azaad karda ghulam hain, un se riwayat hai ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne dekhne wale aur us shakhs par la'nat farmayi jis ki taraf dekha jaye."
"473","Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Usamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Abu Bakr ke sath baithe hue thay, aur ye us waqt tha jab khajoor ke shagofe ka pehli martaba zahoor hua tha, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne ek shagofa dekha jo Madina me dekha gaya pehla shagofa tha to wo khush hue aur kaha: Shagofa! To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur farmaya: Ae Allah, hum se koi bhalai na cheen jo Tune hamein ata farmai hai ya jo Tune hamein ata farmaya hai us me se koi bhalai."
"474","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, Ibn Shihab se, unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat me noe phal pesh kiya jata to Aap use apni aankhon par rakhte, phir us me se kuch tanawul farmate, phir farmate: Ae Allah, jaisa Tune hamein is ka awwal khilaya hai hamein is ka aakhir bhi khila aur is me hamare liye barkat ata farma."
"475","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Asim aur Sulayman ibn Harb ne hum se bayan kiya, Jarir ibn Hazim se, Yunus al-Ayli se, Ibn Shihab se ke jab bhi Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat me noe phal pesh kiya jata to Aap use bosa dete aur use apni aankhon par rakhte."
"476","Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb se, Haywah aur Ibn Lahi'ah ne mujhe khabar di, Uqayl se, Ibn Shihab se ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ek aisi deewar ke paas se guzre jo jhuk gayi thi ya phat gayi thi to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne apne kapde samet liye, phir tez qadmi se chale yahan tak ke us se aage nikal gaye, aur apne Sahaba se farmaya: Tez chalo. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur ye muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat kiya gaya hai, lekin ye kuch nahin."
"477","Abd al-Wahhab ibn Najdah ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Abu al-Mughirah ne, dono ne kaha: Safwan ibn Amr ne hum se bayan kiya, Rashid ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum me se koi apne bhai ko pukare aur wo us se kahe: Labbaik to wo ye na kahe: Aap ke samne, balke ye kahe: Allah tumhein tumhari pasand ke mutabiq jawab de."
"478","Abbas al-Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Razzaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Ahl-e-Iraq me se ek shakhs ne hamein khabar di, Ma'mar se, al-Zuhri se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Neeli aankhein ba'is-e-barkat hain. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Fir'aun neeli aankhon wala tha, aur oontni ki kaanch kaatne wala bhi neeli aankhon wala tha."
"479","Ahmad ibn Yunus ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Muslim yani al-Ta'ifi ne hum se bayan kiya, ek shakhs se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jis shakhs me asabiyyat ka kuch hissa dakhil hota hai to us me se iman ka utna hi hissa nikal jata hai jitni asabiyyat us me dakhil hui hai."
"480","Isma'il ibn Ibrahim Abu Ma'mar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Idris ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'bah se, al-Hakam se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Abdullah aur Hazrat al-Miqdad ke bare me ye kehne se mana farmaya ke wo Quraish me se nahin hain. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yani Ibn Mas'ud murad hain."
"481","Musa ibn Marwan al-Raqqi ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Mu'afa ibn Imran ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr se, Khalid ibn Ma'dan se, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, hazm o ehtiyat kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Sahib-e-rae se mashwara karna phir us ki ita'at karna."
"482","Muhammad ibn al-Wazir ne hum se bayan kiya ke Yahya ibn Hassan ne unhen bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Hamzah ne hum se bayan kiya, Thawr ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi Husayn se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, phir unhon ne usi ki manind baat zikr ki, aur Aap ne farmaya: Sahib-e-aql o fehm wala."
"483","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah aur al-Nufayli ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: Hafs ne hum se bayan kiya, Ash'ath se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasul Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Walidain se neiki jihad se kifayat karti hai."
"484","Muhammad ibn Abdullah al-Mukharrimi ne hum se bayan kiya, Zakariyya ibn Adi ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibrahim ibn Humayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Urwah se, Abu Hazim se, Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne baap ko mare use qatl kar do. Ibrahim ne kaha: Main ne is ka Sufyan se zikr kiya to unhon ne kaha: Main ne ise Abu Hazim se suna hai."
"485","Ibn al-Sarh ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne hum se bayan kiya, Sa'id ibn Abi Ayyub se, Ata ibn Dinar al-Hudhali se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne kaha: Ya Rasul Allah, walidain mein se kis ka haq zyada bada hai? Aap ne farmaya: Us ka jis ne use dono pehluon ke darmiyan uthaya, dono chhatiyon se doodh pilaya, dono ranon par god mein liya, aur walidain ke badle us par qurban hui."
"486","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn al-Sa'ib se, Sa'id ibn Amr ibn Sa'id ibn al-As se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Chhote bhaiyon par bade bhai ka haq aisa hai jaisa aulad par walid ka haq hai."
"487","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Safwan ibn Sulaym se, Ata ibn Yasar se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se sawal kiya, kehte hue: Ya Rasul Allah, kya main apni walida ke paas aane ki ijazat talab karun? Aap ne farmaya: Haan. Us shakhs ne kaha: Main un ke sath ghar mein rehta hun. To Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tum pasand karte ho ke unhen barhana dekho? Us ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: To un se ijazat talab karo."
"488","Nusayr ibn al-Faraj ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn Yazid ne hum se bayan kiya, Haywah ne hum se bayan kiya, Bakr ibn Amr ne hamen khabar di ke Safwan ibn Sulaym ne unhen khabar di ke Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Umm Ayman se, jo Usamah ki walida hain, farmaya: Tum ne subah kaisi ki ya shaam kaisi ki? Unhon ne kaha: Ba-khair hun Ya Rasul Allah. To Allah ke Rasul (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ameen, Allah tumhen ba-khair rakhe."
"489","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Malik se, unhon ne Zayd ibn Aslam se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab jamaat me se ek shakhs salam kare to woh un sab ki taraf se kafi ho jata hai. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Aur ye musnad bhi riwayat kiya gaya hai lekin woh zaeef hai."
"490","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ali ibn Mushir se, unhon ne al-Ajlah se, unhon ne al-Sha'bi se ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Ja'far ibn Abi Talib se mulaqat ki to unhen gale lagaya aur un ki dono aankhon ke darmiyan bosa diya. Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye musnad riwayat hua hai lekin sahih nahin hai."
"491","Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah aur Ahmad ibn Mani' ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn al-Mubarak se, unhon ne Ma'mar se, unhon ne Qatadah se ke ek Yahudi ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke liye doodh doha to Aap ne farmaya: Ae Allah use husn ata farma, to us ke baal siyah ho gaye."
"492","Amr ibn al-Hubab ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah ibn al-Harith al-Makhzumi ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne al-Zubayr ibn Sa'id se, unhon ne al-Yasa' ibn al-Mughirah se, unhon ne kaha: Khalid ibn al-Walid ne Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se apne makan ki tangi ki shikayat ki to Aap ne farmaya: Aasman ki taraf wus'at ikhtiyar karo."
"493","Abdullah ibn Muhammad aur Ali ibn Sahl al-Ramliyyan ne hum se bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abdullah ibn al-Ala se, unhon ne Atiyyah ibn Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki azwaj ke hujre khajoor ki tehniyon ke the. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apne ek ghazwe me tashreef le gaye aur Umm Salamah khush-haal thin to unhon ne tehniyon ki jagah kachi eenten laga din. Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Ye kya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne chaha ke logon ki nigahon ko apne se rok dun. Aap ne farmaya: Ae Umm Salamah sab se buri cheez jis me Musalman mard ka maal kharch ho woh imarat hai."
"494","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Shu'ayb ibn al-Habhab ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Abu al-Aliyah se ke al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Muttalib ne ek bala khana banaya to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Ise gira do. Unhon ne kaha: Kya main is ke kharch ke barabar Allah ki rah me sadqa kar dun. Aap ne farmaya: Ise gira do, to unhon ne ise gira diya."
"495","Ghassan ibn al-Fadl ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Dawud ibn Qays se, unhon ne kaha: Main ne hujre dekhe jo khajoor ki tehniyon ke the aur bahar se balon ke taton se dhake hue the aur main ne hujre ke darwaze se ghar ke darwaze tak hujre ka arz taqreeban chhe ya saat haath samjha aur andar wale ghar ka andaza das haath lagaya aur mera khayal hai ke us ki unchai aath aur nau ke darmiyan thi aur isi tarah, aur main Aishah ke darwaze par khada hua to woh maghrib ki taraf rukh kiye hue tha."
"496","Ghassan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne Hurayth ibn al-Sa'ib se: Main ne al-Hasan ko kehte hue suna: Main Uthman ibn Affan ki khilafat ke dauran Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki azwaj ke gharon me dakhil hota tha to apne haath se un ki chhat ko chhu leta tha."
"497","Main ne Qutaybah ibn Sa'id ko parh kar sunaya: Ibn Abi Fudayk ne tumhen bayan kiya, Muhammad ibn Hilal se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Aishah ka darwaza sagwan ki lakri ka tha."
"498","Harun ibn Abbad al-Azdi ne hamen bayan kiya, Waki ne hamen bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Muhammad ibn al-Zubayr al-Hanzali se, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) zameen par pari hui ek tehreer ke paas se guzre to apne sath maujood ek naujawan se farmaya: Yeh kya hai? Us ne kaha: Bismillah, Aap ne farmaya: Allah lanat kare us par jis ne yeh kiya, aur Allah ke naam ko us ke munasib muqam ke siwa kahin na rakho, Unhon ne kaha: Phir main ne Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ko dekha ke unhon ne apne ek bete ko dekha jis ne deewar par Allah ka zikr likha tha to unhon ne use mara."
"499","Muhammad ibn al-Musaffa ne hamen bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ne hamen bayan kiya, al-Wadin ibn Ata se, Yazid ibn Marthad se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Makri shaitan hai, pas use qatl karo."
"500","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hamen bayan kiya, Yazid ibn Zuray ne hamen khabar di, Hajjaj al-Sawwaf se, Hanan se, Abu Uthman se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko rehan diya jaye to woh use radd na kare, kyunke woh Jannat se nikla hai."
"501","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamen bayan kiya, Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hamen bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya mal'oon hai aur jo kuch us mein hai mal'oon hai, siwa us cheez ke jo us mein se Allah ke liye ho."
"502","al-Hasan ibn Shawkar ne hamen bayan kiya, Isma'il ibn Ja'far ne hamen bayan kiya, Abd al-Aziz se yani al-Majishun, Ayyub al-Sakhtiyani se, Ibrahim ibn Murrah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko bichchu ne dank mara to Aap ne farmaya: Use kya hai, Allah us par lanat kare, woh na kisi Nabi ka khayal karta hai aur na kisi aur ka."
"503","Muhammad ibn al-Musaffa ne hamen bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ne hamen bayan kiya, al-Wadin ibn Ata se, Yazid ibn Marthad al-Mudda'i se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Makri shaitan hai, pas use qatl karo."
"504","Abd al-Rahman ibn Muhammad ibn Sallam ne hamen bayan kiya, Hajjaj ibn Muhammad ne hamen bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Abi al-Zinad se, Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz ibn Wuhayb se, Main ne Kharijah ibn Zayd ko kehte hue suna: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apni majlis mein tamam logon se zyada bawaqar the, Aap apne a'za mein se kisi cheez ko taqreeban bahar na nikalte the."
"505","Hamein Hannad ibn al-Sari ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, al-Awzai se, Urwah ibn Ruwaym se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se pehli cheez jis se mere Rab ne mujhe buton ki ibadat ke baad mana farmaya woh sharab noshi aur aadmiyon se jhagadna hai."
"506","Hamein Hannad ibn al-Sari ne bayan kiya, hamein Abthar ne bayan kiya, Mutarrif se, Abu al-Safar se, Ali ibn Rabiah se, unhon ne kaha: Jab Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Makkah fatah kiya to Aap fauran Taif ki taraf rawana hue aur Hazrat Abu Bakr Aap ke saath the aur Said ibn al-Aas ke dono bete bhi un ke saath the, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne kaha: Ye kis ki qabr hai? Unhon ne kaha: Said ibn al-Aas ki qabr hai, Hazrat Abu Bakr ne kaha: Allah is qabr wale par laanat farmaye kyunke woh Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki mukhalifat karta tha, to Said ke dono beton ne kaha: Allah Abu Quhafah par laanat farmaye kyunke woh na mehman ki khatir karta tha aur na ruswai se bachata tha, to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Murdon ko bura kehna zindon ko naraaz karta hai, pas jab tum mushrikon ko bura kaho to un sab ko ikattha bura kaho."
"507","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Yazid ibn Harun ne bayan kiya, Dawud ibn Abi Hind se, al-Abbas ibn Abd al-Rahman se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Hazrat Abbas ke paas aaya aur kaha: Banu Sahm ki kahina al-Ghaytalah ka kya haal hai jo Abd al-Muttalib ke saath Aag mein hai? To Hazrat Abbas ne us ki naak par maara, phir woh Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas aaye to Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se kisi ko kya hai ke woh apne bhai ko kisi muamle mein takleef deta hai agarche woh haq hi ho?"
"508","Hamein Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya yani Ibn Said ne bayan kiya, Ali ibn Husayn se, ke Abdullah ibn Ubayy ne kaha: Agar hum Madinah ki taraf laute to izzat wala zaroor zaleel ko wahan se nikaal dega, aur ye Tabuk ki muhim mein hua, unhon ne kaha: Aur logon mein se aakhri log abhi utre bhi na the, to Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Kooch karo, kooch karo, to Hazrat Umar ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, kya hum us ki qaum ke kisi aadmi ko hukm na dein ke us ki gardan maar de? To Aap ne farmaya: Main napasand karta hun ke us ki wajah se woh naraaz ho jis ka naraaz hona main nahi chahta."
"509","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud al-Mahri ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe al-Walid ibn al-Mughirah ne khabar di, al-Harith ibn Yazid al-Hadrami se, unhon ne hadith ko Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tak marfu kiya, Aap ne farmaya: Apne halqon ko seedha karo, kyunke jab farishte baithne ke liye aate hain aur us mein tedh dekhte hain to wapas laut jaate hain."
"510","Hamein Abu Bakr ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Waki ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Tariq se, al-Shabi se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tumhare paas kisi qaum ka shareef aadmi aaye to us ki izzat karo, Imam Abu Dawud ne farmaya: Ye muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat ki gayi hai lekin ye kuch nahi."
"511","Hamein Ubaydullah ibn Muadh ne bayan kiya, hamein mere walid ne bayan kiya, hamein Shubah ne bayan kiya, Sad yani Ibn Ibrahim se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab do aadmi hon to teesra un dono ke qareeb na jaye yahan tak ke un dono se ijazat le le."
"512","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe Abd al-Ala ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Farwah ne khabar di, al-Muttalib ibn Abdullah ibn Hantab se, unhon ne kaha: Maine suna ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi aur us ke walid ke darmiyan judai nahi ki jati, main apne ek chacha ke saath baitha tha ke woh aaye to hum ne un ke liye apne darmiyan jagah kushada ki, to Abd al-Ala ne kaha: Ye to mere chacha hain, unhon ne kaha: Haan, chacha Allah ki Kitab mein walid hai."
"513","Abu Salih al-Antaki ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne humein khabar di, Sufyan se, Muhammad ibn Juhadah se, al-Hasan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) mehaz ilzam par kisi ko na pakarte the aur na kisi ke muqable mein kisi ki baat tasleem karte the."
"514","Qutaybah ibn Sa'id ne hum se bayan kiya, Hafs ne humein khabar di, Ibn Jurayj se, Amr ibn Dinar se ke Hazrat Umar ibn al-Khattab Raziallahu anhu ne Madina mein kurraj dekha to kaha: Mera muamla to ye hai ke agar maine Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko tumhein chhore hue na dekha hota to main tumhein na chhorta."
"515","Hannad aur Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, Ziyad ibn Abi Muslim se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Salih Abu al-Khalil ko bayan karte hue suna ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne jhoolon ko kaat dene ka hukm diya. Hannad ne kaha: Ke unhon ne ise suna tha."
"516","Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Yunus se, al-Hasan se, Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se ke Aap ka guzar aise logon ke paas se hua jo ek shakhs ke gird jama the jo unhein hansa raha tha. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs hai jo gadhe ki naql karta hai, apne sathiyon ko hansata hai. Aap ne farmaya: Subhan Allah, is shakhs ko kya aman hasil hai, jabke Allah ne us ki soorat achhi banayi hai, ke use gadhe ki soorat mein badal diya jaye."
"517","Kathir ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Isma'il se, Sulayman ibn Sulaym se, Yahya ibn Jabir se, Yazid ibn Shurayh se ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Teen cheezein juwe mein se hain: qimar bazi, gutiyon se khelna aur kabootaron ko seeti bajana."
"518","Sulayman ibn Dawud ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Wahb ne humein khabar di, Yunus ne mujhe bayan kiya, Ibn Shihab se ke Muhammad ibn Urwah ne unhein khabar di, Urwah se, unhon ne kaha: Ek aurat faut hui jis par Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke Sahaba hanste the. Hazrat Bilal Raziallahu anhu ne us ke bare mein kaha: Bechari ne aaram paya. Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Aaram to wahi pata hai jise bakhsh diya gaya."
"519","Harun ibn Zayd ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn Sa'd ne hum se bayan kiya, Zayd ibn Aslam se, Hazrat Aisha Raziallahu anha se, unhon ne kaha: Maine Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko kabhi kisi ki nisbat karte hue nahin suna magar deen ki taraf."
"520","Sahl ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki' ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ibn Mina se, Ibn Jawdan se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs apne Musalman bhai se mazirat kare aur wo us se qabool na kare to us par utna hi gunah hai jitna najaiz tax lene wale par hai."
"521","Hamein Wahb ibn Baqiyyah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Khalid se, unhon ne Yunus se, unhon ne Hazrat al-Hasan se riwayat kiya ke ek khatoon Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas sawal karne aayi, lekin Aap ke paas kuch na paya. Us ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolallah, mujh se waada kijiye. Aap ne farmaya: Waada atiya hai."
"522","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Wahb se, unhon ne Hisham ibn Sa'd se, unhon ne Hazrat Zayd ibn Aslam se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasoolallah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ka pukhta qaul barhaq aur wajib hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Yani us ka waada."
"523","Hamein Hisham ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, hamein Baqiyyah ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Wadin ibn Ata ne bayan kiya. Mujhe Yazid ibn Marthad al-Mudda'i ne bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolallah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi cheenke ya dakaar le to in ke sath awaz buland na kare, kyunke Shaitan is baat ko pasand karta hai ke in ke sath awaz buland ki jaye."
"524","Hamein Sulayman ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Wahb ne khabar di, mujhe al-Layth ibn Sa'd ne khabar di, unhon ne Uqayl se, unhon ne Ibn Shihab se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ek shakhs barabar Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke chehre se koi cheez door karta raha, goya is ne Hazrat Rasoolallah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko takleef pahunchayi. To Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai se koi cheez door kare to use dikhaye."
"525","Hamein Nasr ibn Asim ne bayan kiya, hamein Yahya ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Ibn Harmalah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Sa'id ibn al-Musayyib ke sath nikla jabke woh mera hath pakde hue the. Maine apna sar uthaya to achanak hilal nazar aaya. Maine kaha: Hilal hai, ae Abu Muhammad. Unhon ne apna sar uthaya aur kaha: Main us Zaat par iman laya jis ne tujhe paida kiya, tujhe durust banaya aur tujhe mutadil kiya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolallah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) isi tarah farmaya karte the."
"526","Hamein Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hamein Aban ne bayan kiya. Hamein Qatadah ne bayan kiya ke un ko ye baat pahunchi ke Hazrat Rasoolallah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab hilal dekhte to farmate: Khair aur rushd ka hilal, khair aur rushd ka hilal; main us Zaat par iman laya jis ne tujhe paida kiya, teen martaba. Phir farmate: Tamam tarif Allah ke liye hai jis ne falan mahina le gaya aur falan mahina laya. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se bhi riwayat hui hai, lekin sahih nahin hai."
"527","Hamein Muhammad ibn al-Ala ne bayan kiya ke unhein Zayd ibn al-Hubab ne khabar di, unhon ne Abu Hilal se, unhon ne Qatadah se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Rasoolallah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab hilal dekhte to apna chehra us se pher lete the."
"528","Hamein Muhammad ibn Qudamah ibn A'yan ne bayan kiya, mujhe Jarir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne Sulayman ibn Abdullah ibn Uwaymir se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Main Hazrat Urwah ibn al-Zubayr ke sath tha, maine apne hath se badal ki taraf ishara kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Aisa na karo, kyunke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne is ki taraf ishara karne se mana farmaya hai."
"529","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Jurayj se, Ibn Abi Husayn se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne barish ki taraf ishara karne se mana farmaya."
"530","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, Marwan ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne hum se bayan kiya. Ubaydullah ibn Abi Jafar ne mujh se bayan kiya ke kuch logon ne garaj suni to unhon ne takbir kahi. Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum garaj suno to tasbeeh karo aur takbir na kaho."
"531","Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne hum se bayan kiya, Waki ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Amash ne hum se bayan kiya, Habib se, hamare ek shaykh se, unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ke paas koi pasandida muamla aata to Aap farmate: Tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai jo Nemat dene wala Fazl karne wala hai, jis ki nematon se nekiyan mukammal hoti hain, aur jab Aap ke paas koi napasandida muamla aata to farmate: Har haal me tamam tareef Allah ke liye hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye muttasil sanad se riwayat ki gayi hai, aur is me zaeef ahadees hain, aur ye sahih nahi hai."
"532","al-Hasan ibn Ahmad ibn Abi Shuayb ne hum se bayan kiya, Miskin ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awzai se, Ibrahim ibn Tarif se, Muhammad ibn Kab al-Qurazi se. Mujh se us shakhs ne bayan kiya jis par mujhe koi shak nahi, Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se, Aap ne farmaya: Mere baad tumhare bare me jin cheezon ka mujhe sab se zyada khauf hai wo teen hain: jo tum par duniya ki raunaq aur zeenat khol di jayegi, aur aise log jo Quran ki taweel us ki taweel ke khilaf karenge, aur aalim ki laghzish. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Kya me tumhe is se nikalne ka rasta na bataun? Jab tum par duniya khol di jaye to Allah ka shukr ada karo; taweel me se jise tum pehchano use lo, aur jis me tumhe shak ho use Allah Azza wa Jall ki taraf lauta do; aalim ke haq ki taraf lautne ka intezar karo, aur us ki laghzish par toot na pado."
"533","Abd al-Salam ibn Atiq al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Mushir ne hum se bayan kiya, Khalid ibn Yazid ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hisham ibn al-Ghaz ne mujh se bayan kiya, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne mujhe Quran ata farmaya, aur us ke saath us se dugni hikmat bhi."
"534","Isa ibn Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Layth ne hame khabar di, Ibn Ajlan se, Abu Said jo Ibn Kuraiz ke aazad karda ghulam hain se, al-Hasan al-Basri se, ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo koi koi jurm kare ya kisi mujrim ko panah de to us par Allah ki aur farishton ki aur tamam logon ki lanat hai; us se na tauba qabool ki jayegi aur na fidya. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah! Jurm kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Baghair sunnat ke bidat, baghair hadd ke musla, baghair haq ke lootmaar."
"535","Muhammad ibn al-Muthanna ne hum se bayan kiya, Rawh ibn Ubadah ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Awzai ne hum se bayan kiya, Hassan ibn Atiyyah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Jibrail (Alaihis Salam) Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par Sunnat ke saath is tarah nazil hote the jis tarah Aap par Quran ke saath nazil hote the, aur Aap ko us ki is tarah taleem dete the jis tarah Aap ko Quran ki taleem dete the."
"536","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ashath al-Huddani se, Shahr ibn Hawshab se, ke Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke kalam ki fazilat tamam kalamon par aisi hai jaisi Allah Jalla wa Ala ki fazilat tamam makhluq par hai."
"537","Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Faris ne hum se bayan kiya, Abd al-Rahman ibn Mahdi ne hum se bayan kiya, Muawiyah ibn Salih se, al-Ala ibn al-Harith se, Zaid ibn Artah se, Jubair ibn Nufair se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum Allah ki taraf kabhi us cheez se behtar kisi cheez ke zariye ruju nahi karoge jo Us se nikli hai, yani Us ka kalaam."
"538","Amr ibn Uthman ne hum se bayan kiya, Baqiyyah ne hum se bayan kiya, Salih ne mujhe bayan kiya. Abd al-Rahman ibn Sabit al-Jumahi ne mujhe bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi banda aisa nahi magar us ke dil mein badshuguni dakhil hogi, pas jab woh us ko mehsoos kare to use kehna chahiye: Main Allah ka banda hun, jo Allah chahe, Allah ke baghair koi quwwat nahi, Allah ke siwa koi nekiyan lane wala nahi aur Allah ke siwa buraiyon ko door karne wala koi nahi, main gawahi deta hun ke Allah har cheez par qadir hai, phir woh apne raste par chalta rahe."
"539","Ahmad ibn Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Abi Fudaik ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali ibn Umar ibn Ali se, un ke walid se, un ke dada se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Madina tashreef laye aur farmaya: Ai Quraysh ki jamaat, tum maweshiyon se mohabbat karte ho, pas un mein se kam rakho, kyunke tum sab se kam barish wali zameen ho, kheti bari karo, kyunke kheti mubarak hai, aur us mein kasrat se khopdiyan rakho."
"540","Abdullah ibn Umar ibn Muhammad ibn Aban ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Darawardi ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ibn Hafs se, mere walid ne mujhe khabar di, ke unhon ne Umar ibn Ali ibn Husain aur Abdullah ibn Anbasah ko faslon mein rakhi jane wali khopdiyon ka zikr karte hue suna. Umar ibn Ali ibn Husain ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne is ka hukm sirf nazar-e-bad ki wajah se diya tha."
"541","Abu Salih ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ishaq ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid ibn al-Simt se, al-Numan se, Makhul se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Hazrat Abu Hurairah ko wasiyyat farmayi, phir farmaya: Jab tum jang ke liye niklo, aur unhon ne chand cheezon ka zikr kiya, farmate hue: Na khajoor ke darakht ko jalao aur na use gharq karo, aur kisi momin ko takleef na pahunchana."
"542","Mujhe Ibn Wahb se riwayat kiya gaya, Amr ibn al-Harith se, Sulaiman ibn Abd al-Rahman se, al-Qasim jo Abd al-Rahman ke azaad karda ghulam hain se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya, phir unhon ne isi tarah ki baat zikr ki, aur farmaya: Na khajoor ke darakht ko jalao aur na use gharq karo, na phal dar darakht kato, na us janwar ko qatl karo jis ki tumhein hajat nahi, aur momin ko takleef dene se bacho."
"543","Mahmud ibn Khalid ne hum se bayan kiya, al-Walid ne hum se bayan kiya, kehte hue: Ibn Jabir ne kaha: Makhul ne mujhe bayan kiya ke Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Aur Yahud mein se jo hamari pairwi kare us ke liye hamari taraf se aman hai, na un par zulm kiya jayega aur na un ke khilaf madad ki jayegi."
